{"ID":"20231011154723-4wcc28c","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20231011154723-4wcc28c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231011154723-4wcc28c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231011154723-l9t74xh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231017102224-2nydwx9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231011154723-l9t74xh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"笔记☰☱☲☳☴☵☶☷","type":"doc","updated":"20240601091000"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231011154723-l9t74xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011154723-l9t74xh","updated":"20231011161940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、美国玉米不能吃，美国将蜘蛛基因移至玉米中，所以形上面是玉米，神上是蜘蛛，蝗虫过境不敢吃；所以人吃下去摄取的不知道是玉米还是蜘蛛，呈现未知性；"}]},{"ID":"20231011155110-9hkhlgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011155110-9hkhlgr","updated":"20231011161941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、提炼、改良过的精细的食物具有成瘾性，影响现代人寿命；"}]},{"ID":"20231011155253-wkx4flj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011155253-wkx4flj","updated":"20231011161941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、黄帝内经认为人的寿命超过百岁才是正常的；"}]},{"ID":"20231011155324-vl8aooy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011155324-vl8aooy","updated":"20231011161942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、中医叫做岐黄之术就是从内经开始的，就是黄帝跟歧伯的对话；"}]},{"ID":"20231011155449-of4tdhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011155449-of4tdhp","updated":"20231011161943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、阴阳合称‘道’。中医简化来说就是阴阳二字；肉眼看得到的东西就是阴，形而上看不到但真实存在的叫做阳；"}]},{"ID":"20231011155744-avmgrs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011155744-avmgrs5","updated":"20231011161943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、中医观念认为人要持满，即保持永远充盈的状态才能长寿，而不是把它消耗掉，如精气神；"}]},{"ID":"20231011160216-05ps541","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011160216-05ps541","updated":"20231011162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、《难经》五邪：正邪、虚邪、实邪、微邪、贼邪；"}]},{"ID":"20231011162204-2xezims","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011162204-2xezims","updated":"20231011162204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 258px;","style":"width: 248px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231011162204-60qz6qi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 248px;\" parent-style=\"width: 258px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231011160459-rhulw5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011160459-rhulw5b","updated":"20231011161946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.1、正邪：病脏本身出现问题称之为正邪，如心脏本身有病；"}]},{"ID":"20231011161048-h40gjg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161048-h40gjg9","updated":"20231011161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.2、虚邪（五行相生）：如肝脏有问题，产生了心脏的问题，就称之为虚邪（木生火）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011161054-i1jz6hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161054-i1jz6hn","updated":"20231025144757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.3、实邪（五行倒生）：如脾脏有问题，反过来影响心脏时候，称之为实邪（土倒生火）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011161056-2ihskkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161056-2ihskkf","updated":"20231025144712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.4、微邪（五行倒克）：如肺脏有问题，导致心脏有问题，称之为微邪（金倒克火）；（微邪，即轻微的邪，力道没那么大）"}]},{"ID":"20231011161403-icxrtkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161403-icxrtkt","updated":"20231011162004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.5、贼邪（五行正克）：如肾脏有问题，影响到心脏有问题，称之为贼邪（水克火）；（影响力道较大）"}]},{"ID":"20231011161954-b0qkt29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161954-b0qkt29","updated":"20231011164409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.6、上面的实邪，中医针灸里面的治疗原则，‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"实则泻其子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’就是以此来的；同理‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚则补其母"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’的原则，则是根据虚邪而来的；"}]},{"ID":"20231011164029-xcqg5mu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011164029-xcqg5mu","updated":"20231011165540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.7、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子能令母实，母能令子虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；例，肝脏里长东西为实症，如需对治就需要想办法让实变成‘虚’就是消掉它，由"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"母能令子虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，由水生木，补肾就可以对治（情景：水是克火的，补肾能让心火衰，为了让火继续旺起来，肝木就会不断往火里丢木头生火，致使木虚下来）；例，肝虚，想要补肝，由"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子能令母实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，补心火就可以对治（情景：心火旺，火克金，金又克木，心火把肺金克了之后，肺金就对肝木的影响就会降低，从而达到实肝的作用）"}]},{"ID":"20231011163053-35mwxmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011163053-35mwxmb","updated":"20231011165551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、神农本草经、伤寒金匮源于黄帝内经；"}]},{"ID":"20231011165018-m6s829s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011165018-m6s829s","updated":"20231011171547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、跑步并不养生，走路对身体更好更长寿（上帝创造人有两条腿，说明用来走更好，如果是四条腿，那跑步更好）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011163043-qfqyd1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011163043-qfqyd1w","updated":"20231011172258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、歧伯说女子以七数，男子以八数；"}]},{"ID":"20231011171812-uz125ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011171812-uz125ji","updated":"20231011174240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"女子二七天葵至，七七天葵竭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；女人最早七岁肾气开始，肾主骨，牙为骨之余，肾其华在发，所以到七岁时女人头发开始长，牙齿开始换；二七十四岁开始来月经，任脉开始通畅，这时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太冲脉盛，月事以时下，故能有子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（现代女人的换牙速度及月经来的速度往往提前，因为摄取的营养太过了导致提前，这也导致了寿命的缩减；太冲穴是肝经原穴，乳房的乳头朝躯干的方向络到肝脏，如图，所以太冲脉盛肝气旺则生火，推动心火，心脏加速）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011174126-6ysk6xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011174126-6ysk6xj","updated":"20231011174126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 126px;","style":"width: 116px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231011174126-9nhbdk5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 116px;\" parent-style=\"width: 126px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231011173905-0fqg1w0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011173905-0fqg1w0"}},{"ID":"20231011172809-6ofbbut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011172809-6ofbbut","updated":"20231012081150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"月事一次正常的周期是四七28天"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；女人的女水就是女人的月经，平常的奶水是肺白，但最早初乳喂母乳的时候初乳是黄色的，所以奶水本源来自脾脏，脾脏受了食物五味，将营养输送到肺脏就出来白色的母乳，又肺金跟心火是相刑的，所以在肺中的奶水会由心将之集中入乳房，月经来时后顺着阳明经一直往下沉，直到到卵巢子宫里才会生成月经（所以治疗妇人奶水病多以强心为主），因为卵巢子宫是贴近小肠的，所以正常人的小肠火能将白色的奶水蒸化成血色的月经，所以小肠控制着月经的量及颜色（所以如遇月经偏淡的情况，则可能是小肠火温度不够，月经偏黑则可能是小肠火温度太高，非绝对）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011175334-4flvdcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011175334-4flvdcq","updated":"20231012082311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女子到三七二十一岁时肾气平均，真牙深而长极"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；所以女人21岁时牙齿长到顶了，身高骨头也长到顶点了，因为在以肾气在生长；（中医认为世界上所有东西没有水不能生存，所以女人月经、女人成长通通是以肾脏作标准）"}]},{"ID":"20231012082541-d3thnk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012082541-d3thnk7","updated":"20231012084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女子到四七二十八岁时筋骨会非常坚硬"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，头发最长，身体壮盛；到了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五七三十五岁时阳明脉衰，脸开始焦黄，头发开始坠落"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（对治可常灸足三里穴，维持青春，胃气不衰）；到了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六七四十二岁三阳脉衰于上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，整个脸焦黄了，头发开始白；到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"七七四十九岁时任脉虚，地道不通，形坏而无子，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"任脉开始虚弱，太冲脉也衰落，月经开始停（有时存在子宫肌瘤或肿瘤，停经可能会延后至五十多岁，等它天葵尽了以后，子宫卵巢慢慢萎缩掉了肿瘤也跟着萎缩掉了）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012084816-n15ks1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012084816-n15ks1m","updated":"20231012090010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"男子八岁肾气实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，八岁开始掉胎毛，长真正的头发，牙齿开始生长；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"二八十六岁肾气盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，男人的天葵就是精子，这时男女交合的话就会生子；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 三八二十四岁肾气平均，筋骨强，真牙生而长极"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（男人长高要在二十四岁以前完成，助长可吃补肾药）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四八三十二岁，筋骨隆盛，肌肉满壮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五八四十岁肾气衰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六八四十八岁阳气衰竭於上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，开始发白，长皱纹；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"七八五十六岁肝气衰，筋不能动，天葵竭精少"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"八八六十四岁发落牙脱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231012090011-cio6kq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012090011-cio6kq6","updated":"20231012090640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10.6、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主水，受五脏六腑之精而藏之，故五脏盛而能泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；肾脏在决定一个人的寿命长短，所以肾衰则五脏衰，筋骨解堕，天葵尽矣，精竭所以不会生小孩，肾脏保养的人都是长寿的；"}]},{"ID":"20231011173203-0rd6yv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011173203-0rd6yv9","updated":"20231012082312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、过去的医术有说扎冲阳脉‘血出则死’，因为古代针太粗，动脉的地方扎到就血流不止，而现代针细，不至于死；"}]},{"ID":"20231011173432-k8o98x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011173432-k8o98x0","updated":"20231012082313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、中医认为胚胎的第一个内脏是肾，有这个真水在里面阴阳交合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"两周后"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"会生木（肝主全身筋），再"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"两周后"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"木会生火（心膜心脏开始跳动）；"}]},{"ID":"20231011161407-iqycxv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011161407-iqycxv8","updated":"20231012093510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、有些人的年龄已经过了正常标准，之所以还能生小孩，歧伯说是天数过度（有的人天赋异禀，气脉常通，肾气有余），就算有小孩，男人不过六十四岁，女人不过四十九岁，这里通指一般人；得道的人则例外，就算再老形不会改变，就算到了七八十，照样能生；"}]},{"ID":"20231012093343-64klgvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012093343-64klgvb","updated":"20231012094046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、上古有真人者，真人就是得道之人，能了解天地道理如呼吸、精气、独立、守神（情景：天地灵气←草←牛←人，人如能跳过牛、草直接食天地灵气，就是真人）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012093343-tie1tis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012093343-tie1tis","updated":"20231012095740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、吃东西不要吃太饱，感觉不饿即可；"}]},{"ID":"20231012093343-mlqpxm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012093343-mlqpxm9","updated":"20231012113322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、春夏秋冬，生长收藏；春夏养阳，秋冬养阴（预防医学，保养之法）"}]},{"ID":"20231012095427-127tg94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012095427-127tg94","updated":"20231012102143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.1、春三月（发陈，把陈旧的东西发出来）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"晚睡早起，广步于庭（庭院里慢慢走路，保持平静），生而勿杀，予而勿夺，赏而勿罚，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如反逆，春属肝脏，逆之伤肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；如肝受伤，能在夏天看到寒的症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231012095700-svfvc6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012095700-svfvc6i","updated":"20231012102321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.2、夏三月（蕃秀，生长之道，万物华实）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"晚睡早起，无厌于日（不讨厌被太阳晒，享受流汗）， 使志无怒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如反逆，夏属心脏，逆之伤心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；如心受伤，能在秋天看到看到症状如往来寒热、咳嗽，到冬天时，因为冬为水，水克火，病就会加重；"}]},{"ID":"20231012095705-1l0ixri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012095705-1l0ixri","updated":"20231012102716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.3、秋三月（容平，天气疾，肃杀，干燥）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"早睡早起，使志安宁，收敛神气使秋气平（这样才能把秋天肃杀的金气降下来）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如反逆，秋属肺脏，逆之伤肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，能在冬天看到症状下痢等症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231012095707-8ok83b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012095707-8ok83b5","updated":"20231012104457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.4、冬三月（闭藏）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"早睡晚起，收敛情志，不宜大汗，不宜大寒（跳冰水冬泳，因为寒极生热，出冰水会生大热冒大汗，但真正有心脏病的人，反而适合洗冷水，解释看16.5）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如反逆，冬属肾脏，逆之伤肾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肾脏上就会有如肌肉萎缩、精神不振等症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231012103158-b6nbg18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012103158-b6nbg18","updated":"20231012103610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.5、心喜寒，水生木，木生火，水又克火，根据母能令子虚，水寒盛之后，木就会虚之，将能量用于生火，所以心脏能加强；"}]},{"ID":"20231012105820-p5iyr1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012105820-p5iyr1r","updated":"20231012110125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.6、长夏季（属脾脏）：长夏季位于季节交替之中，一般是18天；"}]},{"ID":"20231012145102-gm3drzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012145102-gm3drzb","updated":"20231012145106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.7、只有阳没有阴，阳会往外走，因为有阴，阳才能在阴的外面固表，阳的能量是由阴提供的，两者是相辅相成的；所以春夏养阳，让他出汗透发，秋冬养阴，减少出汗；"}]},{"ID":"20231012102725-gejowjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012102725-gejowjc","updated":"20231012104224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、如冬天不敢洗冷水澡，用冷水冲脚也可以；因为脚是离心脏最远，用冷水冲脚，一开始冲一两分钟会很冰，然后会寒极生热，越冲越热，心脏的阳就会回升；如一年四季脚冰，用冷水冲脚也是一种保养的方法，能让脚热起来；"}]},{"ID":"20231012104927-hw2hvpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012104927-hw2hvpy","updated":"20231012150652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、脉诊看阴阳：例左手寸关尺，以关位画横线，关往上的‘寸’往上最多九分代表阳，关往下的‘尺’往下最多一寸代表阴；如果摸到‘寸’脉超过九分，则称之为‘溢脉’，溢脉产生的原因是阴太盛（阴盛则阳虚，把阳往外推），如果摸到‘尺脉’超过一寸，则称之为‘覆脉’，覆脉产生的原因是阴虚（阴虚则阳盛，阴被压回躯干方向）；不管是溢脉还是覆脉，都是胃气已经没有的脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231017164714-mnwf41y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017164714-mnwf41y","updated":"20231017165126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18.1、关隔位为横隔所在，如果上阳下阴，如果阳脉超过了9分，就知道病人的喉咙出问题了，因为横隔往上越过心肺就是喉咙；（如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"开方对治，能摸到脉慢慢缩回正常的位置，可由此判断是否正确治疗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20231017173802-w3iznvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017173802-w3iznvb","updated":"20231024162658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18.2、溢脉和覆脉就是所谓的真脏脉，一般真脏脉出现时，意味着阴阳分隔了；（临床真脏脉不管是溢脉还是覆脉，脉感通通是浮大洪大的，死症）"}]},{"ID":"20231017164810-hy2sxy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017164810-hy2sxy9","updated":"20231017164818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231013160120-incgldh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231024161907-klnuovj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024161907-klnuovj","updated":"20231024162128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18.3、寸部虽在形上九分较短，但力量上阳的力道是浮而有力，尺部虽在形上一寸较长，但力量上阴的力量沉而轻；（所以‘形’上阴长于阳，‘神’上阳长于阴）"}]},{"ID":"20231012144709-acffna3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012144709-acffna3","updated":"20231012152639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、呼吸：呼出靠的是心肺（阳），吸入靠的是肝肾（阴），呼吸中间过程就是脾胃作用；"}]},{"ID":"20231124142847-6xgsaz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124142847-6xgsaz6","updated":"20231124142847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231124142847-b2xoe0p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231012144904-xz5i7j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012144904-xz5i7j7","updated":"20231012154202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、呼吸的过程（如图，吸气顺督脉下来到命门，再出到关元位置顺任脉上去吐出）"}]},{"ID":"20231012153935-5zti39l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012153935-5zti39l","updated":"20231012153935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231012153935-z48ir6e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231012145111-64jyp0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012145111-64jyp0r","updated":"20231012160644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、伤阳的方式"}]},{"ID":"20231012160646-ybwhpf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012160646-ybwhpf0","updated":"20231012160655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21.1、因于寒：体内如里寒，阳气就不能固表，容易外浮（如戴阳）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012153943-r94e5cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012153943-r94e5cq","updated":"20231012160650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21.2、因于热：如体内太热，津液伤到了，汗烦喘渴，体若燔炭汗出而散，在伤寒论中就是阳明证（纯热症，病在阳明，大肠、胃都在阳明上，这时把干燥的食物残渣清掉津液就会回来）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012153944-dmf8rlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012153944-dmf8rlp","updated":"20231012161010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21.3、因于湿：湿太盛，伤到阳气，诸阳之会在头上，湿太盛则伤头面，头有种被绳子绑到的感觉；"}]},{"ID":"20231012161012-5dr0jya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012161012-5dr0jya","updated":"20231012164900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21.4、因于气：因气伤阳，病人会产生肿的现象（所谓有气伤跟形伤，十二经脉中，脉有脉气，气就是巡行的速度，气受伤的时候‘形’就会改变，形就会变肿，如有人突然身体变得臃肿，就说明气伤到了；还有种情况就是形受伤导致气伤，如不小心磕碰到，撞击部位先肿了，然后形伤导致气伤）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012161218-5qvvejc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012161218-5qvvejc","updated":"20231012172229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、阳气本身行的速度很快，它不会停留在一个地方，一直在体内循环，如果过于操劳，阳气耗损不够，中间假如有一小段受伤了，前后不能相气的时候，它会停滞下来，从而使人昏厥、不出汗、眼睛看不到；（耳能听，眼能视，口能尝味，鼻能嗅诸如此类的作用，都是因为有阳气相协才能作用）"}]},{"ID":"20231012172316-18ubd6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012172316-18ubd6i","updated":"20231012174255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22.1、如耳朵突然听不到，肾主耳，所以要补肾阳；眼睛突然看不到，肝主眼，补肝阳；这些都是阳气被惊厥在里面，阳气被阻绝的情况；筋阳气不够时就没法控制它；"}]},{"ID":"20231012161015-ei61sx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012161015-ei61sx5","updated":"20231012175528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、湿疣：汗出见湿，乃生痤疿；出汗时又遇到湿气，一段时间后皮肤就产生疣；汗出遇到寒气生皮疱（好像青春痘一样的红疹）；"}]},{"ID":"20231012161015-wrhxeue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012161015-wrhxeue","updated":"20231012175646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、早上做运动，晚上不适合运动；"}]},{"ID":"20231012175629-2sejltp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012175629-2sejltp","updated":"20231012175920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、营气、卫气，营就是血，卫就是阳气；"}]},{"ID":"20231012175844-l7dvvwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012175844-l7dvvwg","updated":"20231013093457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、褥疮（躺太久生的疮）：躺在那阳气不行，阴气就会累积在那生成疮；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093458-bbrhrrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093458-bbrhrrq","updated":"20231013093616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、肝藏魂、肺藏魄、心藏神；（魂和魄都是由神在管）"}]},{"ID":"20231013093702-pvbknfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093702-pvbknfj","updated":"20231013094213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.1、魄，拆字为白鬼，可以解读为白天看到鬼，白天都容易被惊吓到说明肺有问题，魄不守；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093815-a610tzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093815-a610tzc","updated":"20231013094214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.2、魄汗：肺里面的汗；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093507-zbn9wxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093507-zbn9wxy","updated":"20231013094214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、背后的俞穴都是阳气走的地方，前面的募穴都是阴气走的地方；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093508-gxovhq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093508-gxovhq1","updated":"20231013094544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.1、俞穴的阳气不行的时候，发为风疟（阳本身要发散出来，毛孔闭塞阳气不能行，风就是动，风疟可以理解为身体抖动）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013094305-ixmqkyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013094305-ixmqkyw","updated":"20231013094717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、风为百病之始；"}]},{"ID":"20231013094717-rkzf8si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013094717-rkzf8si","updated":"20231013094822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.1、治脏病治到后来出来表症如身体抖动、感冒、皮肤红疹之类的，说明风邪被逼到表面，病快要痊愈；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093509-krctt2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093509-krctt2l","updated":"20231013135756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、脏腑：脏是收藏，腑是宣泄；泄和藏都是靠的阳气推动作用，如果阳气不足身体就会累积东西（阳是无形的，所以累积的都是阴的东西）；脏腑是阴阳相连的，所以可以用腑来看体内有什么问题；"}]},{"ID":"20231013114632-9s9fc2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013114632-9s9fc2p","updated":"20231013114848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.1、正常人食物在身体流转24小时排出，所以超过24小时都没有排便情况的人，一般是因为身体阳气不足或堵塞；"}]},{"ID":"20231013153039-rqop6fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013153039-rqop6fe","updated":"20231016084027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.2、脏为阴（肝心脾肺肾），腑为阳（胆、胃、小肠、大肠、膀胱、三焦）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013094219-v5ws8bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013094219-v5ws8bh","updated":"20231013140417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、肝属木，为风脏，邪伤肝也（有风邪入体，就会把树木吹的晃动，所以伤肝）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013140522-lav3uyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013140522-lav3uyw","updated":"20231013140716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31.1、人处理抬东西或抗东西靠的是肾脏（扛重物靠的是骨的力量而不是肌肉的力量，硬扛过重的物体会伤到肾气）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013103646-01l2m28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013103646-01l2m28","updated":"20231013142510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、阳强不能密，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴气乃绝；阴平阳秘，精神乃治，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴阳离决，精气乃绝；"}]},{"ID":"20231013114852-yohrjhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013114852-yohrjhb","updated":"20231013143933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、五味入脏（酸入肝、苦入心、甘入脾、辛入肺、咸入肾）"}]},{"ID":"20231013082232-zw55oc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013082232-zw55oc8","updated":"20231013144712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33.1、常吃醋的地方极少胆结石，常吃味厚重咸的地方极少肾结石（常吃青盐能预防肾结石，海盐不行）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013144418-giymrtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013144418-giymrtz","updated":"20231013151156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、春天伤于风，病在头上；夏天风于风，病在内脏；秋天伤于风，病在肩背痛；冬天伤于风，病在四肢；"}]},{"ID":"20231013150934-zothm9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013150934-zothm9z","updated":"20231013151921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、人之精，生之本也；"}]},{"ID":"20231013151916-rermdzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013151916-rermdzb","updated":"20231013152916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、男胸为阴，背为阳；女人胸为阳，背为阴；（如看水中尸体，面朝上就是女的，朝下就是男的）"}]},{"ID":"20231013152835-7qw0xtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013152835-7qw0xtp","updated":"20231013153718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、将‘肝心脾肺肾’分阴阳的话，心肺为阳，肝脾肾为阴，两者由中间的横膈膜区分开；"}]},{"ID":"20231013153713-wppgxpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013153713-wppgxpm","updated":"20231013153713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231013153713-2s7hdsd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231013153953-c16qtnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013153953-c16qtnu","updated":"20231013154116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.1、阳为清，阴为浊；正常人的体内的浊物不会越过隔膜向上，如浊物超过隔膜的界限就是反常，就需要治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20231013154202-on1mwav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013154202-on1mwav","updated":"20231013154218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.2、横膈膜最重要的作用就是分清浊；"}]},{"ID":"20231013154734-oh0gr93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013154734-oh0gr93","updated":"20231013154825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.3、阳中之阳为心，阳中之阴为肺，阴中之阳为肝，阴中之阴为肾，阴中之至阴为脾；"}]},{"ID":"20231013155107-y5lrf6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013155107-y5lrf6w","updated":"20231013160112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.4、寸关尺，以关来区分，关就是关膈，上阳下阴，中间的关膈以五季来定就是长夏，讲的是脾脏"}]},{"ID":"20231013160120-7ji7y2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013160120-7ji7y2m","updated":"20231017164815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231013160120-incgldh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 252px;","style":"width: 242px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231013160334-f7qrvy5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 242px;\" parent-style=\"width: 252px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231013160340-jezibh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013160340-jezibh0","updated":"20231013160454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.5、阴阳统筹由中央长夏控制，中央，即央，阴央阳，中央就是长夏；"}]},{"ID":"20231013153714-t90euk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013153714-t90euk7","updated":"20231016084747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、东方为木主青色（肝），南方为火主赤色（心），西方为金主白色（肺），北方为水主黑色（肾）；中央为土主黄色（脾）；青赤黄白黑；"}]},{"ID":"20231013161120-ne6ggei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013161120-ne6ggei","updated":"20231013161120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 195px;","style":"width: 185px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231013161120-rw6dtx7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 185px;\" parent-style=\"width: 195px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016084237-g2s4f97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016084237-g2s4f97","updated":"20231016084718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.1、五行相生则为吉，逆生则为凶；（情景：如患者脸发青，肝病，如治疗之后脸色变成红色，相生，则说明治疗方向是对的，反之，治成了黑色，就是治错了，医之过）"}]},{"ID":"20231016084239-vkdx6rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016084239-vkdx6rc","updated":"20231016084632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.2、青黑为痛、赤黄为热，白色为寒（望诊）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013161124-kydfj4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013161124-kydfj4d","updated":"20231016084835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、味淡入气分，味厚入血分；"}]},{"ID":"20231016084836-m07ef6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016084836-m07ef6o","updated":"20231016085139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、剋：制衡；"}]},{"ID":"20231016084840-cjoun42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016084840-cjoun42","updated":"20231016085314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、当季看到当季的颜色会好些，比如春天脸上发青，夏天脸色发红（适中，并非严重的病色）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016084842-m41lur4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016084842-m41lur4","updated":"20231016105553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝之畜为鸡，肝主筋；心之畜为羊，心主脉；脾之畜为牛，脾主肉；肺之畜为马，肺主皮毛；肾之畜为彘（黑猪），肾主骨；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016085747-1xqda6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016085747-1xqda6u","updated":"20231016090825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.1、鸡除了脖子被斩断抽筋以外，其他时候不会抽筋，所以常抽筋时可以吃鸡肉；"}]},{"ID":"20231016090224-z5pafr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016090224-z5pafr7","updated":"20231016094003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.2、肝之果为李（春）；心之果为杏；脾之果为枣；肺之果为梨；肾之果为坚果\u0026amp;栗；"}]},{"ID":"20231016090330-qjlma0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016090330-qjlma0f","updated":"20231016090826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.3、肝之菜为韭菜；心之菜为薤白；脾之菜为芹菜；肺之菜为葱类；肾之菜为豆的嫩芽；"}]},{"ID":"20231016094541-2z980xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016094541-2z980xx","updated":"20231016095527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.4、肝之谷为麦；心之谷为黍（过去的红米）；脾之谷为稷（即北地小米之大而黄者）；肺之谷为稻；肾之谷为豆（黑豆，性沉色黑）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016100044-26e8h63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016100044-26e8h63","updated":"20231016100249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝开窍于目；心开窍在舌；脾开窍于口；肺开窍于鼻；肾开窍于耳；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016094033-qydc127","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016094033-qydc127","updated":"20231016104040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.6、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝属木，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其色青，其臭臊，其味酸，其声呼，其液泣，其音角；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心属火，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其臭焦，其味苦，其声笑，其液汗，其色赤，其音徵；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾属土，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其味甘，其声歌，其液涎，其色黄，其臭香，其音宫；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺属金，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其声哭，其液涕，其色白，其臭腥，其味辛，其音商；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾属水，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其液唾，其色黑，其臭腐，其味咸，其声呻，其音羽。"}]},{"ID":"20231016094831-bxucpcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016094831-bxucpcu","updated":"20231016100032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.7、脾数5，肾数6，心数7，肝数8，肺数9"}]},{"ID":"20231016094833-o0m1zg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016094833-o0m1zg3","updated":"20231016100033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.8、天一生水，地六成之。地二生火，天七成之。天三生木，地八成之。地四生金，天九成之。天五生土，地十成之。"}]},{"ID":"20231016094841-xpo6wai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016094841-xpo6wai","updated":"20231016100036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.9、8数是阴的极数（2468），所以人体最深的一个脏就是肝脏；9是阳的极数（13579），肺是人体最表的一个脏；"}]},{"ID":"20231016090451-a9rohf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016090451-a9rohf4","updated":"20231016091050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、激流水：瀑布上取得水，用其煲中药，治风湿关节炎时吃了，药性能一下冲到脚上去；"}]},{"ID":"20231016090831-7ia42j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016090831-7ia42j5","updated":"20231016091418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（应急）河里的水为阳水（经常晒太阳），井里水为阴水（阴暗无光照），如吃了不消化的食物或食物中毒，阳水+阴水服用后会通通吐掉；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016091231-6pwzbls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091231-6pwzbls","updated":"20231016093401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、（保养）青色柠檬带皮削几片泡水喝，对肝好；"}]},{"ID":"20231016091513-ohgsqwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091513-ohgsqwy","updated":"20231016103525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、脾开窍在口，舌头根本；口中之所以会有津液，是因为舌头的舌根是脾在管；"}]},{"ID":"20231016093520-mdzgamw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016093520-mdzgamw","updated":"20231016104731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、肾管大小便，可以据此判断患者是肾阳虚还是肾阴虚（情景：拉肚子一天好几次，就是肾阳虚，吃八味肾气丸，肾阴虚，则六味地黄丸）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016093527-67dxm9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016093527-67dxm9v","updated":"20231016111934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、寒气生浊，热气生清；清阳为天，浊阴为地；"}]},{"ID":"20231016112005-647hcxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016112005-647hcxb","updated":"20231016112103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48.1、所以正常人清阳出上窍（如眼泪是清澈的），浊阴出下窍（小便大便浊）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016112137-dvq28xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016112137-dvq28xd","updated":"20231018112217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48.2、清阳持四肢，浊阴归六腑；（四肢为阳，身体为阴；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾管四肢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，脾为土，四肢如树枝由土而生"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20231016112459-v7qn20q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016112459-v7qn20q","updated":"20231016135521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48.3、热伤气，寒伤血（长期呆着才会有影响，短期不会）；阳盛则热，阴胜则寒，重寒则热，重热则寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231016113537-38rnhvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016113537-38rnhvn","updated":"20231016113550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48.4、辛甘发散为阳，酸苦涌泄为阴；"}]},{"ID":"20231016110856-5hxze9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016110856-5hxze9q","updated":"20231016142658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、风盛则动，热盛则肿，燥盛则干，寒盛则浮，湿症则濡泻；"}]},{"ID":"20231016142658-31ittgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016142658-31ittgy","updated":"20231016151303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、春夏秋冬长夏（寒→冬、暑→夏、燥→秋、湿→长夏、风→春）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013161438-1hpyyr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013161438-1hpyyr4","updated":"20231016154559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、肝（怒）、心（喜）、脾（思）、肺（忧）、肾（恐）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016152001-lvhtibe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016152001-lvhtibe","updated":"20231016152327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.1、寒暑伤形，喜怒伤气，暴怒伤阴，暴喜伤阳，厥气上行，脉满去形，喜怒不节，寒暑过度，生乃不固；（厥气即浊气， ）"}]},{"ID":"20231016152806-9dtb7e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016152806-9dtb7e0","updated":"20231016153200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"冬伤于寒，春必温病；春伤于风，夏必飧泄（下痢拉肚子）；夏伤于暑，秋必咳虐（肺里津液伤到了，秋天就有咳虐现象）；秋伤于湿，冬生咳嗽；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016142705-76vepto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016142705-76vepto","updated":"20231016153351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、八纲辨证：阴阳表里虚实寒热；"}]},{"ID":"20231016152634-8u6z9yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016152634-8u6z9yx","updated":"20231016154328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、哕：打嗝、嗝气（胃中积累陈寒+新食，两者作用产生打嗝，对治则去新食+去陈寒）；"}]},{"ID":"20231016153743-rps29k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016153743-rps29k3","updated":"20231016154409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、肾脏是先天之本，脾脏是后天之本；"}]},{"ID":"20231016154636-55umqed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016154636-55umqed","updated":"20231016174536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、四十岁开始阴气和阳气各半，开始衰弱；过五十岁体重、耳目不聪，阳衰下去，阴慢慢盛起；年六十，阴痿气大衰，阳气大衰，阴阳不利，九窍不利，下虚上实；知之则强，不知则老；"}]},{"ID":"20231016174537-axrtfnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016174537-axrtfnm","updated":"20231016174715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"智者察同，愚者察异；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（中医观念里面的同症同治的观念由来）"}]},{"ID":"20231016174759-o8p76fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016174759-o8p76fq","updated":"20231016174843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56.1、如病人过来说是关节痛，并没有透露他是骨癌，不要理会症状名称，同症同治，就按关节痛的标准开药治；"}]},{"ID":"20231016174844-07cm24z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016174844-07cm24z","updated":"20231017091345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"天不足西北（阴）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，即右耳阴，左耳阳，阳指敏锐力、动力、能量，所以左耳比右耳敏锐；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"地不满东南"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，东南比较平窄（多有湖泊、山河），不够完整，所以一般人左手不如右手强；"}]},{"ID":"20231017091307-w2zmu0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017091307-w2zmu0h","updated":"20231017091307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 165px;","style":"width: 155px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231017091307-gz2122u.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 155px;\" parent-style=\"width: 165px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231016153354-dk5f5oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016153354-dk5f5oa","updated":"20231017102018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、病在皮毛，针轻轻刮下皮毛穴位就会流汗，次之病在六腑，再次之病在五脏后，半死半生（救活的概率只有一半左右，实际标准很宽松，日常临床要做到八九层以上）；"}]},{"ID":"20231017102145-c7cvo0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017102145-c7cvo0v","updated":"20231017102322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、天之邪气害人五脏，水谷寒热伤人六腑；地之湿气伤人皮肉筋脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231017102220-9aygd6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017102220-9aygd6m","updated":"20231017102552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、左病右治，右病左治，由阴引阳，由阳引阴；"}]},{"ID":"20231017102224-2nydwx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017102224-2nydwx9","updated":"20231017103404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、浮脉、滑脉为阳脉；沉脉和瀒（涩）脉为阴脉；（涩脉：力量不大，似有似无；）"}]},{"ID":"20231017103621-z25q7pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017103621-z25q7pi","updated":"20231017105248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61.1、如摸寸脉沉，说明阳不足；如摸尺脉浮大，说明阴太盛；"}]},{"ID":"20231017104158-p3hx0gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017104158-p3hx0gl","updated":"20231017105249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、上工治未病（如肝病先实脾），"}]},{"ID":"20231017104819-2kqi23v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017104819-2kqi23v","updated":"20231017112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、东方实导致西方虚（东木西金，金不平木也），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"泻南补北"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；——难经75难；"}]},{"ID":"20231017105251-lnvyrjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017105251-lnvyrjh","updated":"20231017111942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如木盛金虚，木过盛，如补土由土生金去制衡木，木太实力量会不够，所以难经75难就提出了泻南补北的方法，北水南火，泻南即泻火，泻火后肝就会救火，由实变虚，然后再补北即补水，因为肝已经实了，这时补水对生木作用不大，根据母能令子虚，肝又能进一步变虚，又由子能令母实，补水能让金实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，金实又克木使木虚，从而实现泻木实金的目的；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112045-b3o4zcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112045-b3o4zcs","updated":"20231017112130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.2、子能令母实（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"），母能令子虚（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗法则"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112146-0ctdsot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112146-0ctdsot","updated":"20231017112358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以临床如遇肝癌肝病患者，肝已经肿大了，从实脾的角度切入作用很有限，这时用泻南补北的方法会更好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231128165207-c9s9pkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128165207-c9s9pkl","updated":"20231128170126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★63.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种认知错误"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：母能令子虚，如肝本来就虚，可能有人会认为强肾会让肝变得更虚，实际是不对的；因为肝是虚症时我们怎么会去强肾呢？所以肝实时才会补肾（泻南补北），肝虚不是病，肝实才是病，不能将其混为一谈；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以肝虚时补肾并不会让肝虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，是有实症才会虚掉；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112036-p4crmkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112036-p4crmkr","updated":"20231017112608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、病之起始也，可刺而已（病开始时可治），如果病很盛时，要等病衰落下来再进攻，不可着急（如没有胃口，则要等治到胃口好后再追击病症）；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112629-51qroel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112629-51qroel","updated":"20231017112801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、轻而扬之，重而减之（轻的病症用发表的方法，病重时则减少进攻，先巩固身体）；治病如作战；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112912-05ud2xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112912-05ud2xh","updated":"20231017113128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65.1、例：病在夏秋之间，夏末秋初交接前后一个礼拜，这时是脾脏的王时（脾气最旺，天地之间在养脾脏），这时下手治病不会伤到脾脏，所以趁机进攻，待过了这个时间节点，就立马收手；所以治病的时机很重要；"}]},{"ID":"20231017113349-2kvd9bu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017113349-2kvd9bu","updated":"20231017113434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65.2、对于重病，开进攻药不能过于频繁，多补少攻，稳步对治；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112810-wxui1kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112810-wxui1kk","updated":"20231017142432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、精不足者，开厚味药或温热药或灸；病在高者（如病在喉咙，靠近上焦位置），采取汗法吐法；病在下，引而竭之（攻下）；中满者，泻之于内（肚子胀满，攻下）；如其慓悍者，按而收之（有巨痛，病来速度快如痛风，采用按摩推拿的方式） ；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112812-ri588vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112812-ri588vm","updated":"20231017141633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景时代没有本草纲目，所以他的药方是根据神农本草经药性开的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231017141448-1g73sks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017141448-1g73sks","updated":"20231017144943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"审其阴阳，以别刚柔；阳病治阴，阴病治阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（阳有问题要顾阴，阴有问题要固阳，这样病就不会进了）"}]},{"ID":"20231017143552-8ssxiyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017143552-8ssxiyz","updated":"20231017145048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68.1、例肝病的人便秘，先治他的便秘，这样他的病就不会再进了，肝病到后来大病都没了；"}]},{"ID":"20231017112038-mlz9lfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017112038-mlz9lfu","updated":"20231017145317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、定其血气，各守其香，血实宜决之（血实，手臂或腿上有青筋淤血，临床针灸遇到血实统统放掉）；"}]},{"ID":"20231017111424-y5bkjw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017111424-y5bkjw8","updated":"20231017152823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、太阳主开，少阳是门枢；阳明主阖；三阳如协调一致，统称为一阳；太阴为开，厥阴为合，少阴为枢（传导输送）；"}]},{"ID":"20231017150851-ahpup7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017150851-ahpup7r","updated":"20231017151422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"人身于自然界中间开的门户就是太阳；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"门的枢纽，运输，人身的阳气，营养在运行的时候因为有少阳，它才有开合，能够运输；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明：收阖，结束，到此为止"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231017151447-os8azwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017151447-os8azwz","updated":"20231018084555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70.2、情景：早上睁眼起来（太阳），洗脸刷牙做事（少阳），晚上合眼睡觉（阳明）；如治脸部中风，脸都好了，但眼睛合不上，这时在阳明经上治就好了，因为阳明主阖，反之睁不开为太阳症；"}]},{"ID":"20231017145358-a8phcly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017145358-a8phcly","updated":"20231017160246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、阴和阳都是一样，搏而勿沉（绝对不可以有东西沉积在里面）；西药容易在身体产生沉积几十年，中药很快就能排出；"}]},{"ID":"20231017154028-btyul6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017154028-btyul6f","updated":"20231211153138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、常脉：阳潜在阴里面的脉为常脉，即正常的脉（如坎卦）；五脏常脉皆带有‘缓’的特性；"}]},{"ID":"20231017161106-fc7u334","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017161106-fc7u334","updated":"20231211153155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231017161106-ldu5t9t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 154px;","style":"width: 144px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231211153154-9k2riu7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 144px;\" parent-style=\"width: 154px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231018140204-mddan4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018140204-mddan4g","updated":"20231018140227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72.1、所以阴之所以能和，是因为有阳在里面；"}]},{"ID":"20231017151717-6u9w51b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017151717-6u9w51b","updated":"20231017161441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、四经十二从；（四经为除脾经以外心肝肺肾四经应春夏秋冬四时，脾为长夏；十二经络，络十二个月，十二个月应十二条经脉）"}]},{"ID":"20231017161818-ju2ujg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017161818-ju2ujg7","updated":"20231017161841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、脉本身有分阴阳，滋阳者滋阴，滋阴者滋阳；"}]},{"ID":"20231017161841-m0crqq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017161841-m0crqq7","updated":"20231120172132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"男主气，女主血；左血右气；所以把脉女人左手脉大，男人右手脉大；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231017161852-l4oglyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017161852-l4oglyb","updated":"20231017165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、正常脉是一个呼吸跳五下；"}]},{"ID":"20231017170001-jpangde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017170001-jpangde","updated":"20231017170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、脾胃乃五谷之海，其他四脏的营养都来自脾胃，所以其他四脏是否正常可以根据右手‘关’部的脉为标准，由此对比其他四脏是否正常；"}]},{"ID":"20231017173620-si9ej3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231017173620-si9ej3e","updated":"20231018090613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、如果太阳病没治好，病进身体有两个选择，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病进阳明"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病进少阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（太阳有寒热，阳明只见热症，少阳忽冷忽热）"}]},{"ID":"20231018090343-ekuutma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018090343-ekuutma","updated":"20231018092701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病进阳明"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，热症，病将停，不会再进了；阳明无死症，久病不传经；"}]},{"ID":"20231018090348-9m3oecx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018090348-9m3oecx","updated":"20231018092737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病进少阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，就可能会病进阴经，会有阴症的出现；"}]},{"ID":"20231018093028-et47ehj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018093028-et47ehj","updated":"20231018093057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、息贲：用力地呼吸；"}]},{"ID":"20231018093054-nvtbdmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018093054-nvtbdmb","updated":"20231018153306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一阳为少阳，二阳为阳明，三阳为太阳；一阴厥阴，二阴少阴，三阴太阴；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231018093309-9hj1fs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018093309-9hj1fs7","updated":"20231018094110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、夜尿频：小肠冷，下焦寒，膀胱气化能力差，用热药对治或艾灸；，"}]},{"ID":"20231018093312-ah8dyvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018093312-ah8dyvi","updated":"20231018095947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、如冬伤于寒，春发温病时，不去里寒的话，吃中药当时有效，过几天症状又会倒回来；"}]},{"ID":"20231018095947-tnwfoo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018095947-tnwfoo9","updated":"20231018101420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、心脏搏动产热进入小肠，心包像心脏外膜把心脏包住，心包有水，能够让心脏不会过热；心包是跟胆是连到的，所以心脏搏动时会带到胆汁喷射到十二指肠，——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231018100414-j127ppt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018100414-j127ppt","updated":"20231018102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、胆汁相当于肝脏的代谢物，胆汁排量过多过少或胆结石，都会影响到心脏；少阳区块肿大，胆结石堵到人吞不下东西——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231018102239-74vv2hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018102239-74vv2hx","updated":"20231018102506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83.1、胆结石对治角度：一是用中药疏导+化石的药物配合；二是加快心脏搏动速度，将胆结石通道打通；"}]},{"ID":"20231018100156-uc3tp9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018100156-uc3tp9z","updated":"20231018102721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"发怒会伤到肝，而不是伤到肝人容易发怒；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231018102722-nap1gt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018102722-nap1gt9","updated":"20231018104107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、背痛善噫善欠，名曰风厥："}]},{"ID":"20231018113002-twm78hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018113002-twm78hx","updated":"20231018113851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、钩脉（心脏的脉）：鼓一阳曰钩；毛脉（肺的脉）：鼓一阴曰毛；弦脉（肝的脉）：鼓阳胜急曰弦；石脉（肾的脉）：鼓阳至曰石；（脾的脉）阴阳相过曰溜（脉在寸部或尺部忽大忽小，阴阳相过）；"}]},{"ID":"20231018104500-yycs93j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018104500-yycs93j","updated":"20231018113000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86.1、鼓脉：例如寸正常宽九分，而患者寸没有宽九分，只有两三分鼓起，称之为鼓脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231030155409-ppprf7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030155409-ppprf7w","updated":"20231030155502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86.2、钩脉：触感脉有点突起来的脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231031090631-yu474ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231031090631-yu474ma","updated":"20231031090750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86.3、毛脉：类似于摸鸡的羽毛，中间一根细细的硬硬的茎，周边是柔软的羽毛；"}]},{"ID":"20231101100625-jbfy1hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101100625-jbfy1hi","updated":"20231101100753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86.4、石脉：冬天的脉沉的比较深，要摸的比较里面才能摸到脉，这种脉就是石脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231101100753-wc8uiob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101100753-wc8uiob","updated":"20231101100836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86.5、正常情况下，就算是石脉，重按脉到骨边是摸不到脉的，如果摸得到，就是跗骨脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231018140007-qjsglym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018140007-qjsglym","updated":"20231018141123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、脏可满不可实，腑可实不可满；"}]},{"ID":"20231121152140-oiw69ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121152140-oiw69ox","updated":"20231121152230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.1、如脏如粮仓，可以装满东西，但不能受潮结块，方便能量出入流通；"}]},{"ID":"20231018141727-lrj8eow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018141727-lrj8eow","updated":"20231018141805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、有水肿时治脾，肾阳不固时也治脾（土克水）；"}]},{"ID":"20231018141858-dwx2d85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018141858-dwx2d85","updated":"20231018151238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、结阳：阳气被被封住了，阳结则肿四肢；结阴（肝心脾肺肾）：阴气被封住了，如阴结一脏则便血一升，再结二升，三结三升。"}]},{"ID":"20231018151239-9ugvbpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018151239-9ugvbpe","updated":"20231018151940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89.1、阴阳结斜，多阴少阳曰石水，少腹肿。二阳结谓之消，三阳结谓之隔，三阴结谓之水，一阴一阳结谓之喉痹。阴搏阳别，谓之有子（寸部摸到两条脉左右跳，就是有身孕了，男左女右，即左手摸到为男，右手摸到为女）。阴阳虚，肠辟死。阳加于阴谓之汗。阴虚阳搏谓之崩。"}]},{"ID":"20231018141945-p9tj6w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231018141945-p9tj6w4","updated":"20231019090849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、十二脏对应官位："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心者，君主之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，神明出焉（离卦，中空）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺者，相傅之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，治节出焉（身上所有的节制，各脏的职责，肺脏在管，肺脏在上像天幕）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝者，将军之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，谋虑出焉（如将军，打仗出谋略）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆者，中正之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，决断出焉（做决断，正常人有胆识胆气，不正常则犹豫不决）;"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心包，臣使之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，喜乐出焉；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾胃者，仓禀之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，五味出焉；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠者，传导之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，变化出焉；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小肠者，受盛之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，化物出焉；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾者，作强之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，伎巧之言（工艺医术方面）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦者，决渎之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，水道出焉；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱者，州都之官"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，津液藏焉；"}]},{"ID":"20231019085116-kmvgaow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019085116-kmvgaow","updated":"20231019093455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90.1、心藏神 ☲，心里面藏着一滴真水，源于肾脏；"}]},{"ID":"20231019091258-92vtwbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019091258-92vtwbe","updated":"20231019091635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90.2、三焦最早源生于两肾中央到关元穴的中间一带位置；"}]},{"ID":"20231019091702-jb9xjwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019091702-jb9xjwm","updated":"20231019093443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"上焦：横隔以上位置；中焦：横隔到肚脐中间位置；下焦：肚脐以下位置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231019091727-h6f15wn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019091727-h6f15wn","updated":"20231019093440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91.1、焦同膲，脏腑之间有很多油网联系到，这就是三焦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦的油源生于脾脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（有油，水代谢的快）；所以脾脏有问题的话，会影响到三焦油网，水道拥堵导致身肿；"}]},{"ID":"20231019091342-4o738jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019091342-4o738jz","updated":"20231019094437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、心脏出问题的话，会影响其他脏腑，使道闭塞而不通，形乃大伤；"}]},{"ID":"20231019094814-4qfl114","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019094814-4qfl114","updated":"20231019095123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"恍惚之数，生于毫厘，毫厘之数，起于度量，千之万之，可以益大，推之大之，其形乃制；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019094955-vkeicl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019094955-vkeicl1","updated":"20231019095127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93.1、所以任何领域，刚开始的根基很重要，所以如果第一步踏错了，后续就会一直错下去；"}]},{"ID":"20231019094913-xrxiknc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019094913-xrxiknc","updated":"20231019100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、 天以六六之节，以成一岁，地以九九制会，计人亦有三百六十五节以为天地，久矣；"}]},{"ID":"20231019100157-2uh2sl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019100157-2uh2sl5","updated":"20231019100249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94.1、六六之节为天的度数，九九制会为气的度数；天度者，所以制日月之行也；气数者，所以纪化生之用也。"}]},{"ID":"20231019100250-9dhj3v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019100250-9dhj3v5","updated":"20231019102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、天有五个生数（木火土金水）；人有三个气数（表、半表半里、里）；"}]},{"ID":"20231019102256-px4lhd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019102256-px4lhd5","updated":"20231019103222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、九分为九野，九野为九藏；(天地八方位加上中间共有九个方位），所以形藏四（头、手、足、身），神藏五（肝心脾肺肾），合为九脏，来应天地九个方位；"}]},{"ID":"20231019103223-9gtwafd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019103223-9gtwafd","updated":"20231019103317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、五日谓之候，三候谓之气，六气谓之时，四时谓之岁，而各从其主治焉。"}]},{"ID":"20231019104509-4969zfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019104509-4969zfl","updated":"20231019104916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97.1、5天为一候；三候即15天为一气，所以一年365天有24节气；六气即90天为一时，即季节；四时即360天为一年； "}]},{"ID":"20231019104820-diw1v9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019104820-diw1v9u","updated":"20231019105134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97.2、四季各从其主（肝心脾肺肾），由于五运相袭，而皆治之，终期之日，周而复始（一年轮转又开始循环）；所以不知四季节气盛衰虚实，不可为医；"}]},{"ID":"20231019103225-cyr2zca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019103225-cyr2zca","updated":"20231019105956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"春胜长夏，长夏胜冬，冬胜夏，夏胜秋，秋胜春；（木剋土，土剋水，水剋火，火剋金，金剋木）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019105742-eilykg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019105742-eilykg0","updated":"20231019110002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如脾脏有问题，我们知道春胜长夏，所以我们去治肝脏，就能让脾脏恢复；表面意义是肝气太旺，伤到脾脏，反过来说，如果脾脏有问题的时候，我们可以去治肝；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019110002-y7gw9p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019110002-y7gw9p8","updated":"20231019113229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"何以知其胜？求其至也，皆归始春，未至而至，此谓太过，则薄所不胜，而乘所胜也，命曰气淫。不分邪僻内生，工不能禁。至而不至，此谓不及，则所胜妄行，而所生受病，所不胜薄之也，命曰气迫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019112409-yy87xbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019112409-yy87xbk","updated":"20231019112437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99.1、不该至而至，谓之太过，该至而不至，谓之不及；"}]},{"ID":"20231019111748-fbs95w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019111748-fbs95w6","updated":"20231019112702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"举例：地球水就这么多，如冬行春令，开始温暖天上凝结的寒水提前降下，会影响到来年夏天，夏天的雨水就变少了，所以冬行春令时，夏天就会比较干旱；反之，如不及，即进入春天还是很冷，春行冬令，那夏天的雨水就会增多，可能闹洪灾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（过去天官就是以这个节气的过于不及，为来年做准备）"}]},{"ID":"20231019112751-ojly6im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019112751-ojly6im","updated":"20231019113459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99.3、举例：如春行冬令，该至不至，则"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所胜妄行，即春为木，木所胜就是金"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（‘胜’为剋，‘所胜’为被剋）即金胜木，金为肺，就会害到肺有问题， "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"而所生受病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，即木生火，火为心，心脏就会受病；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所不胜博之也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，木克土，脾脏的病则病的会比较轻；"}]},{"ID":"20231019112349-15aodao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019112349-15aodao","updated":"20231019114216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、寒热不过五（如冬天或夏天，有几天突然很冷或很热，连续的天数不会超过五）；如夏天连续极热五天，第六天一定会下雨——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231023142840-jm6wmq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023142840-jm6wmq0","updated":"20231023142903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100.1、如果一个地方持续冷或持续热超过五天，那这个地方不适合住人；"}]},{"ID":"20231019114256-xsgprlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019114256-xsgprlb","updated":"20231019114541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、五这个数很妙，如从树上刚摘下一个水果，木的味道还有，为酸，如放置五天，再吃就变甜味了（因为它的气一直在转变）；"}]},{"ID":"20231019114057-33c3h6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019114057-33c3h6u","updated":"20231019141300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心者，生之本，神之变也，其华在面，其充在血脉，为阳中之太阳，通于夏气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231019135349-23llyke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019135349-23llyke","updated":"20231019135624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.1、心的气色呈现在脸上；心的力量在血脉中，如静脉曲张之类的疾病，可从心脏对治；夏天属于心之王时，正常不应该有心之疾病的发生，如不会有人得心脏病死掉；"}]},{"ID":"20231019140241-33us3zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019140241-33us3zd","updated":"20231019141303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺者，气之本，魄之处也，其华在毛，其充在皮，为阳中之太阴，通于秋气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231019140259-6d5k5st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019140259-6d5k5st","updated":"20231107160256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102.1、皮肤毛孔都是肺脏在管，心主血，肺主气，肺是挨着心的，所以毛为心血之余；"}]},{"ID":"20231107160256-23cegc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107160256-23cegc8","updated":"20231107160315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102.3、毛为气之余；发为血之余；"}]},{"ID":"20231019141341-1hxwt8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019141341-1hxwt8l","updated":"20231019142330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾者，主蛰，封藏之本，精之处也，其华在发，其充在骨，为阴中之少阴，通于冬气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019142324-stv8z04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019142324-stv8z04","updated":"20231019143532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103.1、肾主收藏，人之组织由外到里为皮、肉、筋、血脉、骨，骨在最里面，跟肾脏的性是一致的；肾能管骨在于能生髓，髓是肾脏的‘阴津’，髓再生骨，所以骨头受伤治肾；肾藏志有两种解释，一种是志向，还有一种解释是通‘誌’，誌管记忆，所以肾藏记忆，髓向上在脑部集中，为髓海；肾脏在管头发的色泽；冬天是肾脏的王时，肾气当旺的时候；"}]},{"ID":"20231019112352-f7h9bmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019112352-f7h9bmy","updated":"20231019143836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝者，罢极之本，魂之居也，其华在爪，其充在筋，以生血气，其味酸，其色苍，此为阳中之少阳，通于春气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019142404-g8kv9lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019142404-g8kv9lf","updated":"20231019144017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104.1、筋从肝生成，到四肢末梢就生成爪，即筋之余为爪，其华在爪，所以可以根据指甲的状态判断肝是否有问题 ；其色苍，苍就是青色，正常的青色是青中带一点点微黄；肝脏在管头发的生长；"}]},{"ID":"20231019142411-4ffn6jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019142411-4ffn6jq","updated":"20231019143839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾、胃、大肠、小肠、三焦、膀胱者，仓廪之本，营之居也，名曰器，能化糟粕，转味而入出者也，其华在唇四白，其充在肌，其味甘，其色黄，此至阴之类，通于土气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019112344-m2bxk21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019112344-m2bxk21","updated":"20231019145212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105.1、 脾脏的状态呈现在唇口周围的气色；"}]},{"ID":"20231019145929-x4ojs1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019145929-x4ojs1p","updated":"20231019150008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、凡十一脏，取决于胆也（五脏六腑的正常与否都跟胆的契机密切相关）。"}]},{"ID":"20231019145056-ndedrmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019145056-ndedrmm","updated":"20231019151158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、故人迎一盛，病在少阳；二盛，病在太阳；三盛，病在阳明；四盛，已上为格阳。寸口一盛，病在厥阴；二盛，病在少阴；三盛，病在太阴；四盛，已上为关阴。人迎与寸口俱盛四倍以上为关格，关格之脉赢，不能极于天地之精气，则死矣。（一盛二盛三盛四盛指的是脉跳的频率的倍数，如一盛，快一倍）"}]},{"ID":"20231019150034-cvh66ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019150034-cvh66ld","updated":"20231019151027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107.1、溢脉为阴乘阳位，外关内格的状态；"}]},{"ID":"20231019151028-h1fip82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019151028-h1fip82","updated":"20231019151037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107.2、覆脉为阳乘阴位，内关外格的状态；"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231019163036-2wbsur5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019163036-2wbsur5","updated":"20231019163127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、五藏生成："}]},{"ID":"20231019163118-qaug232","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019163118-qaug232","updated":"20231019163436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\t\t心之合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也，其荣色也，其主肾也。\n\t\t肺之合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也，其荣毛也，其主心也。\n\t\t肝之合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"筋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也，其荣爪也，其主肺也。\n\t\t脾之合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也，其荣唇也，其主肝也。\n\t\t肾之合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也，其荣发也，其主脾也。"}]},{"ID":"20231019163321-7lm2ryu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019163321-7lm2ryu","updated":"20231019164159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108.1、是故多食咸，则脉凝泣而变色；多食苦，则皮槁而毛拔；多食辛，则筋急而爪枯；多食酸，则肉胝而唇揭（唇揭：嘴巴往上翘）；多食甘，则骨痛而发落，此五味之所伤也。故心欲苦，肺欲辛，肝欲酸，脾欲甘，肾欲咸，此五味之所合也。"}]},{"ID":"20231019163742-df3hbst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019163742-df3hbst","updated":"20231019164110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108.2、由上得多吃甜的东西容易导致掉头发秃头，如治疗骨痛，也要提醒患者少吃甜食；"}]},{"ID":"20231019163129-0tm05f4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019163129-0tm05f4","updated":"20231019164521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、五脏之气，故色见青如草兹者死，黄如枳实者死，黑如(火台)者死，赤如衃血者死，白如枯骨者死，此五色之见死也。\n110、五脏之气，青如翠羽者生，赤如鸡冠者生，黄如蟹腹者生，白如豕膏者生，黑如乌羽者生，此五色之见生也。"}]},{"ID":"20231019164529-skiryay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019164529-skiryay","updated":"20231019170005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、 眼白少的人聪明，多的人较愚笨； 瞳孔越小的人智慧越高，因为它越小越会收藏，同肾脏的性（要让瞳孔小，可以对治往外一圈的脾脏，土剋水，能让肾脏潜藏阳气）；"}]},{"ID":"20231019164534-pysqeck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019164534-pysqeck","updated":"20231019165633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、眼诊"}]},{"ID":"20231019170633-63q3ozc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019170633-63q3ozc","updated":"20231019170633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 521px;","style":"width: 511px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231019170633-5wegkeo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 511px;\" parent-style=\"width: 521px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231019165709-qw099l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019165709-qw099l0","updated":"20231019165752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112.1、瞳孔遇强光会收缩，说明肾阳还在；"}]},{"ID":"20231019165635-l86u6qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019165635-l86u6qf","updated":"20231019171232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"诸脉者，皆属于目；诸髓者，皆属于脑；诸筋者，皆属于节；诸血者，皆属于心；诸气者，皆属于肺，此四肢八溪之朝夕也。故人卧血归于肝，肝受血而能视，足受血而能步，掌受血而能握，指受血而能摄。卧出而风吹之，血凝于肤者为痹，凝于脉者为泣，凝于足者为厥，此三者，血行而不得反其空，故为痹厥也。人有大谷十二分，小溪三百五十四名，少十二俞，此皆卫气之所留止，邪气之所客也，针石缘而去之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231019171257-alcix02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019171257-alcix02","updated":"20231025095601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113.1、手指间共有八条缝如山谷，叫做八风，双脚间共有八条缝叫做八邪；因为所处位置处于末梢，所以吃药药性不容易达到那么远，我们在八风八邪可以治，直接疏通（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为这是阴阳交会之地，不讲究穴位，直接从指尖骨缝扎针进去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；例如扭伤手肿，针下下去后第二天肿能消去大半，如痛感仍在代表气还没通；（刺八风出针时要摇针，泄气）"}]},{"ID":"20231019170203-rkct5xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019170203-rkct5xd","updated":"20231019171255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113.2、诸血脉都与眼睛有密切联系；诸髓都由脑在管；诸筋都属于连着骨节；诸血都属于心；诸气都属于肺；同时，气血的运行则朝夕来往，不离于四肢八溪的部位。所以当人睡眠时，血归藏于肝，肝得血而濡养于目，则能视物；足得血之濡养，就能行走；手掌得血之濡，就能握物；手指得血之濡养就能拿取。如果刚刚睡醒就外出受风，血液的循环就要凝滞，凝于肌肤的，发生痹证；凝于经脉的，发生气血运行的滞涩；凝于足部的，该部发生厥冷。这三种情况，都是由于气血运行的不能返回组织间隙的孔穴之处，所以造成痹厥等症。全身有大谷十二处，小溪三百五十四处，这里面减除了十二脏腑各自的逾穴数目。这些都是卫气留止的地方，也是邪气客居之所。治病时，可循着这些部位施以针石，以祛除邪气。"}]},{"ID":"20231019171233-65z7fkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019171233-65z7fkv","updated":"20231020143841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、故人卧血归于肝，肝受血而能视，足受血而能步，掌受血而能握，指受血而能摄。卧出而风吹之，血凝于肤者为痹，凝于脉者为泣，凝于足者为厥，此三者，血行而不得反其空，故为痹厥也。"}]},{"ID":"20231023095541-nwtwq4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023095541-nwtwq4t","updated":"20231023095557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝受血而能视，足受血而能步，掌受血而能握，指受血而能摄；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231019170636-shvjsap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231019170636-shvjsap","updated":"20231023095519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 116、肝→厥阴→閤，一到三点睡不着，  血不归肝，有两种原因，一种是肝实，长东西，一种是虚症，血回流的力量不够；"}]},{"ID":"20231023092446-5uurnyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023092446-5uurnyf","updated":"20231023095521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116.1、肝主目，眼睛也分阴阳症，如阴症，就是视力有问题，眼睛退化了；阳症，就是代表本身力量没有问题，但看东西都是反过来的；"}]},{"ID":"20231023094012-wyafraq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023094012-wyafraq","updated":"20231023095523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116.2、左血右气，血比较沉，所以可以理解为平面，气是升，因此把左眼右眼并在一起看食物的话，就能看到三维空间；如果一只眼睛闭上，所看到的东西就变成平面的；"}]},{"ID":"20231023094012-xrwjp4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023094012-xrwjp4p","updated":"20231023094015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 435px;","style":"width: 425px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231023093303-wb100t4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 425px;\" parent-style=\"width: 435px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231023094018-jakjkvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023094018-jakjkvt","updated":"20231023095524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116.3、（阳症）例一个人看东西都是斜的，那可能是气斜了，就是气有问题；如果是血有问题，看到的平面则是会晃动，人会不断地调整姿势维持平衡；"}]},{"ID":"20231023092641-4ezr832","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023092641-4ezr832","updated":"20231023095526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、心脏之所以能造血，是因为有肾水来济火，即控制心脏的火不会过旺，能一直造血；"}]},{"ID":"20231023092809-5odbvuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023092809-5odbvuy","updated":"20231023095527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117.1、心脏和心包中间是一层清水，保护心脏不会过热；"}]},{"ID":"20231023092828-xmqp3cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023092828-xmqp3cz","updated":"20231023095528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝喜条达恶风（条达：畅达无阻），心喜寒恶热，脾喜燥恶湿，肺喜热恶寒，肾喜温恶寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231023094735-vw53rkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023094735-vw53rkd","updated":"20231023095530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、常年睡觉被子只盖身体，脚露在外面，对身体较好，不容易有静脉曲张，心脏功能强；"}]},{"ID":"20231023094332-ybfo9e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023094332-ybfo9e9","updated":"20231023095652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、肝主筋，如手掌脚掌腿脚无力，都是肝脏出问题，导致没有握的力量；"}]},{"ID":"20231023095430-fkwsmu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023095430-fkwsmu7","updated":"20231023100207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、五脉：肝→弦脉、心→洪脉、脾→缓脉、肺→浮脉、肾→沉脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231023100220-r5s7un6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023100220-r5s7un6","updated":"20231023100540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、肝脏为弦脉，如摸到一根细细的树枝；心脏为洪脉，摸起来较粗大有力；脾脏为缓脉，摸起来比较柔缓；肺脏为浮脉，摸在皮肤表面就能摸到脉，重按下去木头就沉下去（如按压沉不下去，说明病在皮毛）；肾脏为沉脉，按到骨边才能按到的脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231023093303-nkkyq10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023093303-nkkyq10","updated":"20231023104455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、上为阳，下为阴，阴阳合为央（央就是阴和阳交合的地方），中央是胃气所在，脾土；"}]},{"ID":"20231023104044-50gw66s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023104044-50gw66s","updated":"20231023104044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 201px;","style":"width: 191px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231023104044-0gw0489.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 191px;\" parent-style=\"width: 201px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231023104737-xdzma89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023104737-xdzma89","updated":"20231023104935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122.1、由于土与四脏相合，所以我们把脉时，正常人摸到的脉的特性是带有柔缓的特性，如肝脉为弦，弦中带缓属正常现象；"}]},{"ID":"20231023093443-pjf2c21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023093443-pjf2c21","updated":"20231023110517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、肺主肃降，如喘代表上虚下实，气没法肃降金生水，气就会回逆成喘的症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231023140258-zoyuc5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023140258-zoyuc5r","updated":"20231023140536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"‘心下’就是胃；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231023140537-8c89gko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023140537-8c89gko","updated":"20231023141708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、痹：麻木、风寒湿痹，造成有阻塞，气血不顺畅；"}]},{"ID":"20231023141746-3vud6oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023141746-3vud6oj","updated":"20231023141904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、凡相五色之奇脉，面黄目青，面黄目赤，面黄目白，面黄目黑者，皆不死也。面青目赤，面赤目白，面青目黑，面黑目白，面赤目青，皆死也。"}]},{"ID":"20231023141944-r7kzf6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023141944-r7kzf6b","updated":"20231023141958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.1、所以人胃气还在，就不会死；"}]},{"ID":"20231023141958-m2bfsuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023141958-m2bfsuo","updated":"20231023142442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.2、腑病（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，胆、小肠、胃、大肠、膀胱）时吃药一般在正中午的时候恢复，脏病（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肝、心、脾、肺、肾）时吃药一般在半夜2点多的时候胃气回来，表现的现象就是肚子饿；"}]},{"ID":"20231023142106-1auzdka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023142106-1auzdka","updated":"20231023150350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脑、髓、骨、脉、胆、女子胞，此六者，地气之所生也，皆藏于阴而象于地，故藏而不泻，名曰奇恒之府。夫胃、大肠、小肠、三焦、膀胱，此五者，天气之所生也，其气象天，故泻而不藏，此受五藏浊气，名曰传化之腑。此不能久留，输泻者也。魄门亦为五藏使（魄门：肛门），水谷不得久藏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所谓五脏者，藏精气而不泻也，故满而不能实。六府者，传化物而不藏，故实而不能满也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"。所以然者，水谷入口，则胃实而肠虚;食下，则肠实而胃虚，故曰实而不满，满而不实也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231023143147-one4kp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023143147-one4kp9","updated":"20231023143641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127.1、诊断思路：如脑、髓、骨、脉、胆、女子胞六者不藏（如长脑瘤营养输不进去，不藏），那就有问题，胃、大肠、小肠、三焦、膀胱五者不泻也有问题（如肚胀撒不出尿，不泻）；"}]},{"ID":"20231023143450-02kcz3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023143450-02kcz3j","updated":"20231023143924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、如出车祸重伤，男人头肿可以，脚肿不行，女人头肿不行，脚肿可以，如男人脚肿或女人头肿，说明大限要到了；"}]},{"ID":"20231023143940-s7xd6mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023143940-s7xd6mr","updated":"20231023144018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128.1、所以在医院能看到的脑积水存活率男的较高，脚肿存活率女的较高；"}]},{"ID":"20231023144330-uxz6gsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023144330-uxz6gsv","updated":"20231023144535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128.2、不仅消化的食物残渣，包括脏腑里的浊气都会累积到肠胃里排掉，所以不仅是腑，五脏的浊物浊气也会通过肠胃排出；"}]},{"ID":"20231023150443-c81gznh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023150443-c81gznh","updated":"20231023151035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128.3、五脏藏精能满不能实，精是精华的意思，如果实了，就说明其中的精华不纯净造成实症；六腑传化物而不藏，六腑传导转化能实不能满，浊物残渣即实物，不能满的意思是不能一直保存在体内，新东西取代旧东西，要将之宣泄掉；"}]},{"ID":"20231023144019-376takz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023144019-376takz","updated":"20231023150512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、肝上是肺，肝下是大肠，肝与大肠有一根血管连到（全身上下就这根血管没有少阳，就是没有瓣膜；瓣膜作用：让血只能往前不能倒流），肺与大肠相表里，肺吸气时金剋木，肺膨胀压肝使肝血注入大肠，大肠即有力量消化食物或排便；"}]},{"ID":"20231023145921-vtt2gss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023145921-vtt2gss","updated":"20231023150339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129.1、所以肝里面的浊物可以通过大肠排出，所以中医治症治肝，一定会去治大肠，因为不治大肠浊物无法代谢出来，浊物会往心脏跑；"}]},{"ID":"20231023150503-1ucit6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023150503-1ucit6o","updated":"20231023150503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231023150503-uzlsr9r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231023151252-icxgvq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023151252-icxgvq5","updated":"20231023153717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"气口何以独为五脏主？岐伯曰：胃者水谷之海，六腑之大源也。五味入口，藏于胃，以养五脏气。气口亦太阴也，是以五脏六腑之气味，皆出于胃，变见于气口。故五气入鼻，藏于心肺，心肺有病，而鼻为之不利也。凡治病必察其上下，适其脉，观其志意，与其病也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（为什么手上的脉可以侦测五脏？歧伯：胃脾是土，土生金，所以土的金气就会表现在肺的气脉上面；又由于肺的金气是由脾土胃气化生而来，所以它可以代表五脏的脏气所在及状态）"}]},{"ID":"20231023152657-ak96zcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023152657-ak96zcd","updated":"20231023152657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 264px;","style":"width: 254px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231023152657-ghvi8c2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 254px;\" parent-style=\"width: 264px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231023152523-bg18ld5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023152523-bg18ld5","updated":"20231023153121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130.1、气为阳，味为阴，五味即酸苦甘辛咸，五味藏入胃，以此营养涵养五脏之气，五脏脏气从这来的。气口也就是太阴，所以五脏六腑的气味源头皆来自胃；天气春夏秋冬节气，也藏于心肺中间，所以心肺有病，鼻子会呈现相应症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231023153223-dvwm47q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023153223-dvwm47q","updated":"20231023153340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130.2、所以给人看病要看他大小便如何、脉形如何，再观察病人的情志，由此治病；"}]},{"ID":"20231023152936-5wxi5wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023152936-5wxi5wu","updated":"20231023153716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"拘于鬼神者，不可与言至德，恶于针石者，不可与言至巧。病不许治者，病必不治，治之无功矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231023153727-x6u3spt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023153727-x6u3spt","updated":"20231023153901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131.1、如果病人迷信鬼神之道，决不可以跟他讲深奥的医道，对于反感针石术疗法的人，决不可以跟他讲医术技巧，对于不配合治疗或不愿意治疗的人，疾病必定无法救治，就算出手也只能落到劳而无功的下场；"}]},{"ID":"20231024094516-5lsuluo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024094516-5lsuluo","updated":"20231024094902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、鱼的性就是阴不足，阳有余，所以有人阴盛阳不足，可以让他吃鱼；"}]},{"ID":"20231024094903-drghii1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024094903-drghii1","updated":"20231024114414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、怎么做个好医生？看色脉，即望诊+脉诊，配合金木水火土五运，四时八风六合（春夏秋冬、东南西北及东南东北西南西北、上下前后左右），知道什么是正常的人并以此参照；"}]},{"ID":"20231023153901-qr6iogu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023153901-qr6iogu","updated":"20231024114919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、汤剂有外洗和内服两种；"}]},{"ID":"20231023151258-h5kwkxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231023151258-h5kwkxr","updated":"20231024115106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134.1、外洗两种情况：其一为病在皮肤或伤在皮肤；其二为汤药无法入口，喝不下去，故将汤药煮沸，用鼻子吸药气，让药气由毛孔透入；"}]},{"ID":"20231024115048-xp70smu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024115048-xp70smu","updated":"20231024115717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中古之治病，至而治之，汤液十日，以去八风五痹之病，十日不已，治以草苏草荄之枝，本末为助，标本已得，邪气乃服。暮世之治病也则不然，治不本四时，不知日月，不审逆从，病形已成，乃欲微针治其外，汤液治其内，粗工凶凶，以为可攻，故病未已，新病复起。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231024115349-o7hsnfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024115349-o7hsnfm","updated":"20231024115907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中古时期"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"治病，是受病了之后，先口服五谷粮食熬成的汤液对治十天，以去除八风五痹等病，十天没好的话，再根据情况用草药配伍治疗。由于明确病人是“根本”、医生和药物是“标”的道理，所以医生能掌握病情的变化，处理得当，疾病也就痊愈了。而"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"后世"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即现在的医师就不是这样了，诊病及治病不论四时的阴阳消长，不知道日月盈亏变化对人体影响，不能辨别什么样的色泽、脉象是顺证，预后良好，什么样的色泽、脉象是逆证，预后多凶险，又不懂得早期治疗的重要性，等到疾病已经发展到严重的程度，才想到用针刺的方法从外治疗，用口服汤液的方法从内治疗。如果再遇到医术浅薄、作风草率的医生，更不加详细诊断，不明白疾病的虚实，便盲目地使用攻泻的方法，以至于药不对证，不但旧病没治好，反而增加了新的疾病。"}]},{"ID":"20231024115131-fnu9656","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024115131-fnu9656","updated":"20231024142906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、治之要极，无失色脉，用之不惑，治之大则。逆从到行，标本不得，亡神失国。去故就新，乃得真人。"}]},{"ID":"20231024143340-z1zrjh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024143340-z1zrjh7","updated":"20231024143608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136.1、治疗的要则是不要偏离病人的色脉，不能被病人描述的病情干扰；把不正确的医学摒弃，留下精华；"}]},{"ID":"20231024145940-6qysdy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024145940-6qysdy9","updated":"20231113154044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"137、谬刺法\\缪刺法：再身上所有的井穴点刺放一滴血（12经的井穴），形体比较大的人，放两滴；及在静脉曲张的地方点刺放血；（该法能开鬼门，鬼门即是皮肤毛孔通通打开，洁净脏腑，让肠胃膀胱通畅，五脏气平）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；该法适用于精神方面阴阳隔绝的病如抑郁症；"}]},{"ID":"20231113154049-fxntugc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113154049-fxntugc","updated":"20231113155040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137.1、缪刺法常用于病在表面但不在经不在络的情况；"}]},{"ID":"20231024155227-ok77jp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024155227-ok77jp2","updated":"20231024160619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、人身上气血刚开始是从手太阴肺经走的，因为它是天气之始；（一年的初始是寅月，寅卯辰巳午未申酉戌亥子丑,身体的初始也是寅3:00-5:00）"}]},{"ID":"20231024160258-ggq3iny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024160258-ggq3iny","updated":"20231024161244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、五脏对应"}]},{"ID":"20231024160836-4q74quo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024160836-4q74quo","updated":"20231024161212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231024160836-i5zfmd6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231024161110-bp2s12n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 139px;","style":"width: 129px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231024161212-94s2gn3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 129px;\" parent-style=\"width: 139px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231024161357-mqf2r93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024161357-mqf2r93","updated":"20231024162538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"容色见上下左右，各在其要。\n其色见浅者，汤液主治，十日已。\n其见深者，必齐（剂的通假字）主治，二十一日已。\n其见大深者，醪酒主治，百日已；色夭面脱，不治，百日尽已。（病色深，用酒煮药，百日病才能好；如果脸上的油光都散落，如灰色发干，那没法治，百日之内死掉）\n脉短气绝死，病温虚甚死。（脉短：寸短于九分，尺短于一寸；详见18.3，如阴阳反逆，尺强寸微，病人呈现燥热口渴但不欲喝水症状，为死症）\n色见上下左右，各在其要。"}]},{"ID":"20231024160837-5rivu3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024160837-5rivu3a","updated":"20231024163202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140；整个脸的气色是由胃气主导的，如果胃气的方向是由下往上走（心肝脾肺肾气往上走），为凶，因为头是阳之极，阳极生阴，正常气是从头往下降的，气往上走则为逆气；反之，如果气是由上往下走的话，是好的现象；"}]},{"ID":"20231024163213-y3d8v1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024163213-y3d8v1d","updated":"20231024164010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、女子右为逆，左为从；男子左为逆，右为从；易，重阳死，重阴死。"}]},{"ID":"20231024163247-f4dqzcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024163247-f4dqzcg","updated":"20231024163624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、《揆度》和《奇恒》主要讲的就是天地间的阴阳平衡；"}]},{"ID":"20231024163624-nk5wdtk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024163624-nk5wdtk","updated":"20231024164913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、摸到虚脉代表里面没有长东西，实脉则是里面长东西，摸到虚脉比较好治，如果摸到实脉，我们把实脉治成虚脉，是好转的迹象；"}]},{"ID":"20231024164914-s2pmas6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231024164914-s2pmas6","updated":"20231025094018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、天气热的时候，下针下浅，天气冷的时候，下针可以下深；春夏针浅，秋冬针深；"}]},{"ID":"20231025093641-ltw18x3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025093641-ltw18x3","updated":"20231025093825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、神魂魄是一样的东西；心藏神，神分阴阳，阴为魄主静看肺，阳为魂主动看肝；"}]},{"ID":"20231025093905-wwjsfrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025093905-wwjsfrd","updated":"20231025093905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231025093905-wrueq2y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231025093906-cdyzcln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025093906-cdyzcln","updated":"20231025094117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡刺胸腹者，必避五脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231025094123-ziz3gaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025094123-ziz3gaf","updated":"20231025094323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.1、中心者环死（一天内死）；中肝，五日死；中脾，五日死，；中肾七日死；中肺五日死；中膈者皆为伤中，其病虽愈，不过一岁必死；"}]},{"ID":"20231025094324-rwrsv5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025094324-rwrsv5w","updated":"20231025095906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、刺到经络的病时不可以摇针，肿症可以用摇针（三皇穴，肿症摇针出水不出血），这是刺法的大要；"}]},{"ID":"20231025095920-jbx38ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025095920-jbx38ra","updated":"20231025095920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 219px;","style":"width: 209px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231025095920-x536n5b.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 209px;\" parent-style=\"width: 219px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025095923-ddwgpd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025095923-ddwgpd6","updated":"20231025100226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、十二脉气绝的症状："}]},{"ID":"20231025100226-ph9x6xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100226-ph9x6xb","updated":"20231025101530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳脉：太阳之脉，其终也，戴眼（翻白眼）、反折、瘛瘲，其色白，绝汗乃出，出则死矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025093744-0c3z3un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025093744-0c3z3un","updated":"20231025101531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳终者，耳聋，百节皆纵，目睘绝系。绝系一日半死，其死也，色先青，白乃死矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025093644-zzogu6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025093644-zzogu6y","updated":"20231025101533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明终者，口目动作，善惊妄言，色黄，其上下经盛，不仁则终矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025100341-mh373tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100341-mh373tu","updated":"20231025101535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴终者，面黑齿长而垢，腹胀闭，上下不通而终矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025100350-o5kr56f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100350-o5kr56f","updated":"20231025101539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阴终者，腹胀闭，不得息，善噫善呕，呕则逆，逆则面赤，不逆则上下不通，不通则面黑，皮毛焦而终矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025100354-sye8ewe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100354-sye8ewe","updated":"20231025101541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厥阴终者，中热嗌干，善溺心烦，甚则舌卷，卵上缩而终矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025100357-irrn9ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100357-irrn9ng","updated":"20231025103132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：翻白眼，整个人往后仰翻过去，面色苍白，油尽灯枯，身出油则死；"}]},{"ID":"20231025100620-2ac6pnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100620-2ac6pnb","updated":"20231025103133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：耳聋（虚症由内而发的耳聋），身上所有的筋都松开来，没法握拳抬手，眼睛没法转动，只能直视，一天半就会死，死之前面色先青后白再死；"}]},{"ID":"20231025100815-ku36kfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100815-ku36kfw","updated":"20231025103135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：（阳明经承泣四白眼睛也有络到，头维下关颊车承泣四白巨髎地仓）口和眼睛乱动，同时容易受到惊吓，面色发黄，在脉气将尽时会出现一时的盛大，等到手足发麻的时候死亡降临；"}]},{"ID":"20231025102255-d8zfs80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025102255-d8zfs80","updated":"20231025103136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：（少阴是肾脏，藏在肾脏的黑色浮现在表）脸色发黑，牙齿变长（变长是因为牙龈缩回去了），大小便就会不通（因为肾主大小便），大小便排不出来而死"}]},{"ID":"20231025102740-p0s6joi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025102740-p0s6joi","updated":"20231025103138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阴气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：腹部胀满，呼吸不畅，常常发噫气犯呕吐，呕吐严重时气逆往上升，病人会出现面色赤色的现象，如果呕吐浊物还停留在体内，一样造成大小便不通，最后面色黎黑无光，皮毛发焦而死"}]},{"ID":"20231025100815-s7022mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100815-s7022mt","updated":"20231025103733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厥阴气绝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：（肝经脉气绝）中焦发热，喉咙苦干，心情烦躁，严重时舌头会往上卷，睾丸会往上缩而死；"}]},{"ID":"20231025100812-niv4uuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025100812-niv4uuu","updated":"20231025101516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、根据同气相求，如耳朵遭受巨响治耳鸣如开枪导致，那这时要戴上耳罩，稍微露出耳朵，再开一枪，紧接而再将耳朵封紧些，再开一枪，持续重复让耳朵听到枪的声音越来越小，到最后耳鸣即恢复正常；"}]},{"ID":"20231025101516-da3yjli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025101516-da3yjli","updated":"20231025103300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、汗法、吐法、下法应用；"}]},{"ID":"20231025103251-o9e7102","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025103251-o9e7102","updated":"20231025103328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150.1、汗法：在体表；"}]},{"ID":"20231025103307-o56g1kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025103307-o56g1kg","updated":"20231025103320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150.2、吐法：在横膈上；"}]},{"ID":"20231025103309-akn4kbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025103309-akn4kbh","updated":"20231025103544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150.3、下法：在五脏之中；（如下法，看病人脸色，如脸色发黑则治肾对治；如面色红润，可能是阳明经问题）"}]},{"ID":"20231025103603-1ws353f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025103603-1ws353f","updated":"20231025111223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、 阳病好治，阴病难治；"}]},{"ID":"20231025111224-jqvztl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025111224-jqvztl0","updated":"20231025112655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、早上起来喝杯冷水，常年不生胃病（清晨散布到四肢的阳气会倒转回来去养胃）；"}]},{"ID":"20231025112338-1cy7pmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025112338-1cy7pmp","updated":"20231025112559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152.1、晚上备杯热水，放一小撮盐进去，床边放一瓶六味地黄丸，早上起来后用放凉的冷水配合六味地黄丸服用，阳气会回流胃按摩消化六味地黄丸药力，能提炼出精华；"}]},{"ID":"20231025112109-vvtivvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025112109-vvtivvh","updated":"20231025113806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、一呼二至，一吸二至，一停一至，所以正常情况人的一个呼吸脉动五下；"}]},{"ID":"20231025113808-htl5i3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025113808-htl5i3m","updated":"20231031084554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、代脉：不稳定、不规律的脉，时快时慢，时大时小，常常变更的脉象；"}]},{"ID":"20231025141201-3s4u6if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025141201-3s4u6if","updated":"20231025144000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、脉如果绷紧如弦，死脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231025144001-7u4wcq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025144001-7u4wcq5","updated":"20231025145053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、望诊之望眼：眼的神若在，哪怕身体虚弱也好治，眼的神若亡，身体看起来正常也不好治；"}]},{"ID":"20231025145054-r2m59q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025145054-r2m59q6","updated":"20231025151511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、汗尿同源；"}]},{"ID":"20231025151512-5rblrmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025151512-5rblrmx","updated":"20231025152540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"夫五脏者身之强也。头者精明之府，头倾视深精神将夺矣。背者胸中之府，背曲肩随，府将坏矣。腰者肾之府，转摇不能，肾将惫矣。膝者筋之府，屈伸不能，行则偻附，筋将惫矣。骨者髓之府，不能久立，行则振掉，骨将惫矣。得强则生，失强则死。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025152505-1r9us42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025152505-1r9us42","updated":"20231025154120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158.1、身体的正常得益于身体的强壮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"头，影射人的神智"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，头有个天柱穴，如果头歪下去了，天柱倾，这个人的‘神’将会离开了，痴呆，失忆；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"背，代表府的状态"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，背坨了，呼吸的时候要耸肩才能完整呼吸，代表人的府快坏了（府是消化系统，背为阳，胃、胆、小肠、大肠、膀胱）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"腰，为肾之腑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肾有阴阳所以腰部才会柔软能转动，腰部转动靠的肾，如肾气绝，腰将僵硬难以动弹；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖，为筋之府"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，如果一个人的膝盖屈伸不能，走路只能佝偻者背，说明筋将疲（膝盖旁边有个阳陵泉，筋会阳陵泉）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨，为髓的府"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，不能久站或站不住，脚没有力量，说明骨头有问题，要补骨；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以内脏要强，得强者生，失强者亡；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231025154038-035a97n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025154038-035a97n","updated":"20231025161225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、春脉弦，夏脉钩，秋脉⽑，冬脉石；"}]},{"ID":"20231025161226-pij8b94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161226-pij8b94","updated":"20231025161235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.1、春脉弦者，肝东方木也，万物始生，未有枝叶，故其脉之来，濡弱而长，故曰弦。"}]},{"ID":"20231025161239-52hhajt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161239-52hhajt","updated":"20231025161305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.2、夏脉钩者，心南方火也，万物之所茂，垂枝布叶，皆下曲如钩，故其脉之来疾去迟，故曰钩。"}]},{"ID":"20231025161118-3zops60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161118-3zops60","updated":"20231025161308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.3、秋脉毛者，肺西方金也，万物之所终，草木华叶，皆秋而落，其枝独在，若毫毛也。故其脉之来，轻虚以浮，故曰毛。"}]},{"ID":"20231025161257-w1isc9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161257-w1isc9g","updated":"20231025161312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.4、冬脉石者，肾北方水也，万物之所藏也，盛冬之时，水凝如石，故其脉之来，沉濡而滑，故曰石。此四时之脉也。"}]},{"ID":"20231026082135-p6yln3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026082135-p6yln3s","updated":"20231026082152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.5、春日浮，如鱼之游在波；夏日在肤，泛泛乎万物有余；秋日下肤，蛰虫将去；冬日在骨，蛰虫周密，君子居室。故曰：知内者按而纪之，知外者终而始之，此六者持脉之大法也。"}]},{"ID":"20231025161314-ovws2jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161314-ovws2jw","updated":"20231025161644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、甲（拆字为一个田字，下面长了根），乙（长得像根长开了变长了），甲乙为春；丙（发芽长出了两片叶子），丁（叶子长大了）；"}]},{"ID":"20231025161754-b5vcj2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025161754-b5vcj2y","updated":"20231025162418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、如何知死时（病态的脉：例春天发病，得到了相克的脉，如木克土，春天时脉是长夏的脉，死时就在长夏发生）"}]},{"ID":"20231025162501-xigua5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025162501-xigua5l","updated":"20231025162644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161.1、如脉一息四至五至比较标准，脉稍弦稍洪没有关系，死症一般是比较明显不正常的症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231025162657-pdzq9g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025162657-pdzq9g8","updated":"20231025162922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、常脉是浮动的，如夏至到冬至期间，寸部的脉的力量会慢慢降下去，等到冬至到底了，就又慢慢上升起来；"}]},{"ID":"20231025162821-7vujpn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025162821-7vujpn9","updated":"20231025162821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231025162821-5ie21o3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231025162924-gvu8s92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025162924-gvu8s92","updated":"20231025163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、从梦境看身体阴阳平衡：阴胜则梦涉大水，阳盛则梦大火灼烧，如果阴阳俱盛，则梦相杀毁伤；上盛则梦飞，下盛则梦堕，甚饱则梦予，甚饥则梦取；肝气盛则梦怒，肺气盛则梦哭。短虫多则梦聚众，长虫多则梦相击毁伤。"}]},{"ID":"20231025163233-j5zgv7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025163233-j5zgv7g","updated":"20231025163812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163.1、阴气盛则梦见渡大水而恐惧，阳气盛则梦见大火烧灼，阴阳俱盛则梦见相互残杀毁伤；上部盛则梦飞腾，下部盛则梦下堕；吃得过饱的时候，就会梦见送食物给人，饥饿时就会梦见去取食物；肝气盛，则做梦好发怒气，肺气盛则做梦悲哀啼哭；腹内短虫多，则梦众人集聚，腹内长虫多则梦打架损伤（有损伤，不是相杀）。"}]},{"ID":"20231025163311-zl0gau7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025163311-zl0gau7","updated":"20231025163732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163.2、十几岁时梦到从高处掉落是常态，因为当时在长身体，属下盛（女人二七十四天 葵至，男人二八十六）；"}]},{"ID":"20231025163722-gzn3yxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025163722-gzn3yxo","updated":"20231026081855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、脉对应，外为脏，内为腑"}]},{"ID":"20231026081811-n1ng03h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026081811-n1ng03h","updated":"20231026081811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231026081811-tdzth47.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231026081843-y8xht63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026081843-y8xht63","updated":"20231026084145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、心脉搏坚而长，当病舌卷不能言；其软而散者，当消渴自己。\n肺脉搏坚而长，当病唾血；其软而散者，当病灌汗，至今不复散发也。\n肝脉搏坚而长，色不青，当病坠若搏，因血在胁下，令人喘逆；其软而散色泽者，当病溢饮，溢饮者，渴暴多饮，而易入肌皮肠胃之外也。\n胃脉搏坚而长，其色赤，当病折髀⑧，其软而散者，当病食痹。\n脾脉搏坚而长，其色黄，当病少气；其软而散色不泽者，当病足骨行肿，若水状也。\n肾脉搏坚而长，其色黄而赤者，当病折腰；其软而散者，当病少血至今不复也。"}]},{"ID":"20231026084636-cszifuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026084636-cszifuo","updated":"20231026085117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165.1、当病人表虚，再用重发汗的药给病人发汗的话，病人津液没了，由于正常情况筋要润，筋上面也有津液，如果肌肉里面的汗都发掉了，又把筋上的津液发掉的话，人就会抽筋；"}]},{"ID":"20231026085117-771vpgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026085117-771vpgv","updated":"20231026085908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、人从高处摔落，不管是着地还是手或身体着地，一定伤到胸膈（因为肋骨在上，下面是骨盆，中间一根脊椎骨撑着，肋骨下面是横膈膜的地方，一剧烈震动，大部门是胸腔出血）；"}]},{"ID":"20231026090539-su5cikn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026090539-su5cikn","updated":"20231026092126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、摸到急脉，就是跳的很快的脉的时候，就说明身体里面积到堵到了；"}]},{"ID":"20231026092225-evrszbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026092225-evrszbo","updated":"20231026092439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167.1、心脉跳的很快，病名心疝，少腹一定有形即有呈现出形状（因为心跟小肠相表里，关元的位置）；"}]},{"ID":"20231026092513-5fdypx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026092513-5fdypx3","updated":"20231026092819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167.2、胃脉实则胀，虚则泄；（常人食物永远有五分之一食物停在胃的下方，五分之四消导下去；第二餐再吃的时候，则会留第二餐的五分之一，其他都消导下去，循环往复）"}]},{"ID":"20231026092546-a6vy3sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026092546-a6vy3sl","updated":"20231026100751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：病成而变何谓？岐伯曰：风成为寒热，瘅成为消中，厥成为巅疾，久风为飧泄，脉风成为疠。病之变化，不可胜数。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231026095512-xa0rioy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026095512-xa0rioy","updated":"20231026104136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168.1、黄帝问：病时怎么演变的？歧伯说：风邪会演变成寒热相关疾病；内热日久则会成为中焦的消渴（瘅是湿热，如晚餐以后又吃宵夜，睡觉后胃蠕动速度变慢，日久成瘅，再日久就变成中焦消渴即糖尿病，所以糖尿病也叫富贵病）；手脚长年冰冷，寒症时如果不治热下不去，就会反逆上头，产生巅疾；如果常常处在受风吹的环境，日久就会变成下泄，如果风停留在体内一直没有处理，久之变成疬病，皮肤粗糙，化脓；如果再将病的变化分的更细，病的变化不可胜数；"}]},{"ID":"20231026102930-39d88ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026102930-39d88ka","updated":"20231026103536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、一型糖尿病：从小开始发病，注射疫苗以后变成脑瘤、血癌，一型糖尿病；二型糖尿病：富贵病，吃太好导致；"}]},{"ID":"20231026104317-rrbpgqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026104317-rrbpgqm","updated":"20231026104713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：诸痈肿筋挛骨痛⑩，此皆安生？岐伯曰：此寒气之肿，八风之变也。帝曰：治之奈何？岐伯曰：比四时之病，以其胜治之愈也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231026104322-j416dz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026104322-j416dz6","updated":"20231026110705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170.1、黄帝问：所有痈肿筋挛骨痛，这些病是从何而来？歧伯说：这是寒气之肿，八风之变，寒气久居不去，还有四季风向异常变化而引起的；黄帝问：改怎么治呢？歧伯说：四季的病，以其胜来对治（例1：病人关节炎关节痛，平时不痛，只在冬天发病，这就是所谓四时的病，冬是水，土克水即土胜水，通过治土这病能好）（例2：春天花粉过敏打喷嚏，金克木，通过治肺对治）；"}]},{"ID":"20231026104819-hm5289l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026104819-hm5289l","updated":"20231026104843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、有些中医说的‘南方无伤寒’这样的说法是不对的；"}]},{"ID":"20231026104844-mdzg09n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026104844-mdzg09n","updated":"20231026111300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：有故病五脏发动，因伤脉色，各何以知其久暴至之病乎？岐伯曰：悉乎哉问也，征其脉小色不夺者，新病也；征其脉不夺其色夺者，此久病也；征其脉与五色俱夺者，此久病也；征其脉与五色俱不夺者，新病也。肝与肾脉并至，其色苍赤，当病毁伤不见血，已见血湿若中水也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231026111020-fbmv7hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026111020-fbmv7hw","updated":"20231026111902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172.1、黄帝问：久病五脏都会有影响，因此伤了脉的颜色，各自该怎么知道他是久病还是新病呢？歧伯说：你问得很详细啊！只要验看脉色就可以区别开来：如脉虽小而气色不失于正常的，是为新病；如脉不失于正常而色已失于正常的，乃是久病；如脉象与气色均失于正常状态的，也是久病；如脉象与面色都不失于正常的，乃是新病。脉见沉弦，是肝脉与肾脉并至（常人寸关尺的力量是有梯度的，寸\u0026gt;关\u0026gt;尺，对应肝为关，肾为尺，‘并至’代表关部和尺部力量一样强），若面现苍赤色的，是因为有毁伤淤血所致，而外部没有见血，或外部已见血，其经脉必滞，血气必凝，血凝经滞，形体必肿，有似乎因湿邪或水气中伤的现象，成为一种淤血肿胀。"}]},{"ID":"20231026111334-74fyej7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026111334-74fyej7","updated":"20231026111351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172.2、所有新病刚得到色不会变，久病色才会改变；"}]},{"ID":"20231026111302-tc4ik5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026111302-tc4ik5h","updated":"20231026112315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、不管内伤、外伤，忌洗冷水，要洗热水澡，最好是不洗澡，因为怕身体收到风邪；"}]},{"ID":"20231026113312-0m0013z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026113312-0m0013z","updated":"20231026113400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、跗骨脉：用力按，贴着骨头的脉，有积在里面，可能有肿瘤；"}]},{"ID":"20231026113815-iv9zm5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026113815-iv9zm5z","updated":"20231026113903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、尺脉两旁的内侧候于季胁部，外侧候于肾脏，中间候于腹部。尺肤部的中段、左臂的外侧候于肝脏，内侧候于膈部；右臂的外侧候于胃腑，内侧候于脾脏。尺肤部的上段，右臂外侧候于肺脏，内侧候于胸中；左臂外侧候于心脏，内侧候于膻中。尺肤部的前面，候身前即胸腹部；后面，候身后即背部。从尺肤上段直达鱼际处，主胸部与喉中的疾病；从尺肤部的下段直达肘横纹处，主少腹、腰、股、膝、胫、足等处的疾病。（讲的主要是寸关尺对应位置）"}]},{"ID":"20231026113845-ku1fc4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026113845-ku1fc4c","updated":"20231026113845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231026113845-hrublgm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231026113906-fuyq4mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026113906-fuyq4mv","updated":"20231026115843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"粗大者，阴不足阳有余，为热中也。来疾去徐，上实下虚，为厥巅疾。来徐去疾，上虚下实，为恶风也。故中恶风者，阳气受也。有脉俱沉细数者，少阴厥也；沉细数散者，寒热也；浮而散者为眗仆。诸浮不躁者，皆在阳，则为热；其有躁者在手，诸细而沉者，皆在阴，则为骨痛；其有静者在足。数动一代者，病在阳之脉也。泄及便脓血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231026114006-deqprdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026114006-deqprdf","updated":"20231027105459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176.1、脉象跳动剧烈粗大，寸关尺都很大但范围正常，阴不足阳有余，称之为热中；脉来的快去的慢，是上实下虚，头部会有问题；脉来的慢去得快（如果手重按时脉比较小，松开时脉比较快，可以说是寸弱尺强），上虚下实，胸阳不足（因为肺管胸阳），一般会恶风，患这种病的原因，是因为阳气虚而失去捍卫的功能，所以才感受邪气而发病；如果摸到脉细数的，沉到骨边，我们知道时少阴的问题（还有一种特殊的跗骨脉，是有积如有肿瘤，见174）；如果脉浮往上冲，阳气如要散掉一样，会造成人昏眩易晕倒；脉浮但不燥的人，病在阳，都是热导致（燥脉：如一吸三至，一呼三至，一停一至共七至，即为燥脉）；如果脉浮且燥的人，则病在手上；脉细而沉，病在阴，会有骨痛的症状，足部的脉会比较缓；如果脉正常跳动数次后脉突然变快或变慢一下，这种就是病在阳的脉，大便时会便脓血；"}]},{"ID":"20231026113957-nwch7nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231026113957-nwch7nk","updated":"20231026115812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176.2、虚实辩证：虚脉按到骨边没有了，实脉按到骨脉脉还在；"}]},{"ID":"20231027105644-xb1izeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027105644-xb1izeg","updated":"20231027105652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、诸过者切之，涩者阳气有余也，滑者阴气有余也；阳气有余为身热无汗，阴气有余为多汗身寒，阴阳有余则无汗而寒。"}]},{"ID":"20231027105653-fphgbfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027105653-fphgbfd","updated":"20231027110726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177.1、诊察到各种有病的脉象而切按时，如见涩脉是阳气有余；滑脉，为阴气有余。阳热有余则身热而无汗（毛孔力量强，关住了所以无汗）；阴寒有余则多汗而身寒（毛孔力量弱，松弛所以出汗），阴气阳气均有余，则无汗而身寒。"}]},{"ID":"20231027105743-54hh3lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027105743-54hh3lg","updated":"20231027110018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177.2、涩脉：阴气不足，阳气有余（血不够，力量够）；例按脉到骨边，能感受到力量，但脉的位置不固定，会移动乱跑；"}]},{"ID":"20231027105925-3g5lxk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027105925-3g5lxk6","updated":"20231027110458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177.3、滑脉：阳气不足，阴气有余，气血流的非常顺畅，"}]},{"ID":"20231027110130-2y9z24r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027110130-2y9z24r","updated":"20231219100802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"望而知之为之神，闻而知之为之圣，问而知之为之工，切而知之为之巧；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231027110221-v3rvxm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027110221-v3rvxm0","updated":"20231027112153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179、推而外之，内而不外，有心腹积也。推而内之，外而不内，身有热也。推而上之，上而不下，腰足清也。推而下之，下而不上，头项痛也。按之至骨，脉气少者，腰脊痛而身有痹也。"}]},{"ID":"20231027112155-zr9t8p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027112155-zr9t8p2","updated":"20231027113343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179.1、把脉时按住脉手指往外推，脉不会跟着你往外走，说明心腹部有积到东西；把脉时从外往内推，脉不会跟着往内走，说明身体有热；如果把脉时中指按到关部，脉跑到寸部去了，关部摸不到脉，说明下焦寒；如果把脉时中指按到关部，脉跑到尺部去了，关部摸不到脉，说明头项会痛；如果把脉按到骨边，脉气少的人，腰脊会痛四肢有疲麻木不仁的症状（诊脉以诊气为主，督脉是诸阳之会，阳即气，气脉少了当然会有督脉问题如腰背痛，四肢麻木不仁）；"}]},{"ID":"20231027113345-5m8aqfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027113345-5m8aqfg","updated":"20231030093255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、人一呼脉一动，一吸脉一动，曰少气。人一呼脉三动，一吸脉三动而躁，尺热曰病温，尺不热脉滑曰病风，脉涩曰痹。人一呼脉四动以上曰死，脉绝不至曰死，乍疏乍数曰死。"}]},{"ID":"20231030093310-nq0jv6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030093310-nq0jv6q","updated":"20231030093546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180.1、一呼一吸脉四动以上，算上中间一息，即九动以上，为死症，脉气渐绝代表着五脏精气枯竭，脉搏跳动忽快忽慢，此时阴阳已败乱，所以是死脉。"}]},{"ID":"20231030093548-gopd83p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030093548-gopd83p","updated":"20231030095356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、平人之常气禀于胃，胃者，平人之常气也，人无胃气曰逆，逆者死。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095350-9u5fkhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095350-9u5fkhr","updated":"20231030095350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"春胃微弦曰平，弦多胃少曰肝病，但弦无胃曰死；胃而有毛曰秋病，毛甚曰今病。脏真散于肝，肝藏筋膜之气也。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095350-wphfif0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095350-wphfif0","updated":"20231030095350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夏胃微钩曰平，钩多胃少曰心病，但钩无胃曰死，胃而有石曰冬病，石甚曰今病。脏真通于心，心藏血脉之气也。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095350-k1r1778","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095350-k1r1778","updated":"20231030095350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长夏胃微弱曰平，弱多胃少曰脾病，但代无胃曰死，软弱有石曰冬病，弱甚曰今病。脏真濡于脾，脾藏肌肉之气也。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095350-68m2j7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095350-68m2j7q","updated":"20231030095350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"秋胃微毛曰平，毛多胃少曰肺病，但毛无胃曰死，毛而有弦曰春病，弦甚曰今病。脏真高于肺，以行荣卫阴阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095350-9xxck03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095350-9xxck03","updated":"20231030095350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"冬胃微石曰平，石多胃少曰肾病，但石无胃曰死，石而有钩曰夏病，钩甚曰今病。脏真下于肾，肾藏骨髓之气也。"}]},{"ID":"20231027112932-nrxy2h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231027112932-nrxy2h2","updated":"20231030095359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181.1、"}]},{"ID":"20231030095411-dnopb81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095411-dnopb81","updated":"20231030095411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"春天时，脉象当弦，微弦的脉象中带有柔和的胃气就是平脉（正常脉象）。如果脉象中弦象多而胃气少，就是肝病；如果脉象中只有弦象没有胃气，就是死证了；如果脉象中有胃气但还有毛脉（秋令所主的脉象），预示着到了秋天就会生病，毛脉太盛的话马上就会发病。春天的脏之真气主要散布在肝，而肝是藏筋膜之气的。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095411-8o0sig0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095411-8o0sig0","updated":"20231030095411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夏天时，脉象当钩，微钩的脉象中带有柔和的胃气就是平脉。如果脉象中钩象多而胃气少，就是心病；如果脉象中只有钩象没有胃气，就是死证；如果脉象中有胃气但还有石脉（冬令所主的脉象），预示着到了冬天就会生病，石脉太盛的话马上就会发病。夏天的脏之真气与心相通，心是藏血脉之气的。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095411-fi0o3lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095411-fi0o3lp","updated":"20231030095411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长夏时，脉象微微软弱并带有柔和胃气的就是平脉。如果脉象中弱多而胃气少，就是脾病；如果脉搏在跳动时偶有歇止并没有胃气，就是死证；如果脉象有弱脉还有石脉，预示着到了冬天就会生病，如果弱脉太过马上就会发病。长夏的脏之真气充养在脾中，脾是藏肌肉之气的。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095411-luyfu44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095411-luyfu44","updated":"20231030095411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"秋天时，脉象当毛，微毛的脉象中带有柔和的胃气就是平脉。如果脉象中毛象多而胃气少，就是肺病；如果脉象中只有毛象没有胃气，就是死证；如果毛脉中还可见弦脉，预示到了春天就会生病，弦脉太盛的话马上就会发病。秋天的脏之真气主要分布在肺中，肺位在上焦，是运行营卫阴阳之气的。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095411-kb4enac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095411-kb4enac","updated":"20231030095411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"冬天时，脉象当石，微石的脉象中带有柔和的胃气就是平脉。如果脉象中石象多而胃气少，就是肾病；如果只有石脉而没有胃气，就是死证；如果石脉中还有钩象，预示到了夏天就会生病，钩象太盛的话马上就会发病。冬天的脏之真气下藏在肾中，肾是藏骨髓的。"}]},{"ID":"20231030095437-c9d7hev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030095437-c9d7hev","updated":"20231101100240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181.2、肝主筋，五脏六腑都有筋膜连到，所以可以从肝脉查到五脏六腑的状态；心主血，五脏都有血，所以可从心脏的脉侦测到其他内脏的问题；脾主肌肉，五脏各有五脏的肌肉，所以可以通过脾脏的脉侦测到其他脏的状态；肺主皮毛，是最高的脏，是相傅之官，总统所有气血，所以可通过气血查到五脏状态；"}]},{"ID":"20231030155259-cm4kk47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030155259-cm4kk47","updated":"20231101103527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181.3、胃气正常的情况是速度一个呼吸五至最标准，缓而有力；"}]},{"ID":"20231030155919-8ptgvpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231030155919-8ptgvpx","updated":"20231101105056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、胃之大络，名曰虚里，贯鬲络肺，出于左乳下，其动应衣，脉宗气也。盛喘数绝者，则病在中；结而横，有积矣；绝不至曰死。乳之下其动应衣，宗气泄也。"}]},{"ID":"20231101103530-gi7m0hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101103530-gi7m0hk","updated":"20231101105231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182.1、胃经的大络，叫做虚里。出于左乳下，贯隔而上络于肺，其脉搏动应衣，这是脉的宗气，胃气根的所在。倘若跳动极剧，并且极快，这是病在膻中的征象；若见跳动时止，位置横移的，主病有积块；倘若脉绝不至，就要死亡。如果乳下虚里处脉搏跳动剧烈振衣，是宗气外泄的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20231101105409-wl1y8fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101105409-wl1y8fj","updated":"20231101105458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182.2、喘的很厉害的人，如果宗气脉在，说明还有救，宗气脉没了，基本无法救治了；"}]},{"ID":"20231101104807-viqzqy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101104807-viqzqy9","updated":"20231101110425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、胃能消化食物，是因为位于心与小肠中间，靠两者的热力蒸化蠕动消化；胃的阳气如果不够的话，胃气就会沉降，胃会胀（中医叫胃寒，因为热力不够\t）；"}]},{"ID":"20231101103711-ahj12xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231101103711-ahj12xz","updated":"20231106142526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、肝病的人大部分遇到庚辛日死掉（金克木），心病的人见壬奎日死掉（水克火）；脾病见甲乙日死掉（木克土）；肺病见丙丁日死掉（火克金）；肾病见戊己日死掉（土克水）；"}]},{"ID":"20231106142102-i3ja6o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231106142102-i3ja6o1","updated":"20231106143600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"面肿曰风（脸肿是风邪导致的）；脚肿为水（脚肿是水病）；如面肿脚肿身肿为风水；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231106144328-1px6veo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231106144328-1px6veo","updated":"20231106144406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、太阳脉至，洪大以长。少阳脉至，乍数乍疏，乍短乍长。阳明脉至，浮大而短。"}]},{"ID":"20231106144408-z5v43r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231106144408-z5v43r9","updated":"20231107084115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、脉象：肝→弦脉，心→洪脉，脾→缓脉，肺→浮脉，肾→沉脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231107085235-kt1tuy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107085235-kt1tuy5","updated":"20231107091926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫做常人？阳能够守，阴才会归经，血才会在经脉中不会逆流；所以中医观念里，血无止法（咳血、吐血），心里不要想着去止血，只要把他阳调回来，血自然回来；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231107091211-1sq83gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107091211-1sq83gz","updated":"20231107091928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"血管容易破裂，是因为寒（如北方冬天晚上用水管忘把里面水放掉，隔天水管就变脆，容易破裂）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231107091818-foykazz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107091818-foykazz","updated":"20231107091852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189.1、如因为里寒导致出血不止，用热药把血管热起来后，血不会流的更多，反而会止血；"}]},{"ID":"20231107091803-6auufrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107091803-6auufrd","updated":"20231107100741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、帝曰：夫子言脾为孤藏，中央土，以灌四旁，其太过与不及，其病皆何如？岐伯曰：太过则令人四肢不举，其不及则令人九窍不通，名曰重强。"}]},{"ID":"20231107100743-u9fd7vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107100743-u9fd7vk","updated":"20231107101004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.1、脾主中央，如果脾脏一虚，四个脏会一起压下来，重重压力，称之为重强，这个时候九窍不通；"}]},{"ID":"20231107100939-neo8yl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107100939-neo8yl7","updated":"20231107100939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231107100939-8glb370.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231107100922-yl1do7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107100922-yl1do7t","updated":"20231107102807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、肝受气于心，传之于脾，气舍于肾，至肺而死。\n心受气于脾，传之于肺，气舍于肝，至肾而死。\n脾受气于肺，传之于肾，气舍于心，至肝而死。\n肺受气于肾，传之于肝，气舍于脾，至心而死。\n肾受气于肝，传之于心，气舍于肺，至脾而死。\n此皆逆死也，一日一夜，五分之，此所以占死生之早暮也。"}]},{"ID":"20231107102812-6pd1s96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107102812-6pd1s96","updated":"20231107103234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191.1、‘一日一夜，五分之，此所以占死生之早暮也’：该法可用于断生死之时，五分之，即将天干、地支都用五分法分成五份，见191.2；"}]},{"ID":"20231107103008-0jn7qqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107103008-0jn7qqe","updated":"20231107103227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191.2、天干五分（甲乙木、丙丁火、戊己土、庚辛金、壬葵水）；地支五分（寅卯木、巳午火，丑辰未戌土、申酉金、亥子水）"}]},{"ID":"20231107103240-hxn4iqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107103240-hxn4iqa","updated":"20231107104358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、"}]},{"ID":"20231107104400-5iqdwqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107104400-5iqdwqt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝曰：五脏相通，移皆有次。\n五脏有病，则各传其所胜。\n不治，法三月，若六月，若三日，若六日，传五脏而当死，是顺传所胜之次。\n故曰：“别于阳者，知病从来；别于阴者，知死生之期。"}]},{"ID":"20231107104457-gtopbxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107104457-gtopbxc","updated":"20231107104457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 158px;","style":"width: 148px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231107104457-6jrl3vv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 148px;\" parent-style=\"width: 158px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231107104404-xjk9y1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107104404-xjk9y1i","updated":"20231107104551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192.1、如肝有病，则会克到土，土再克水，水再克火，火再克金，金再克木，人就死掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20231107104551-nf84e88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107104551-nf84e88","updated":"20231107104922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192.2、我们可以通过查身体阳气的变化，知道病从何而生，可以通过查阴气的变化，知道人什么是死什么时候生；"}]},{"ID":"20231107104838-j6w6eam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107104838-j6w6eam","updated":"20231107152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、是故风者，百病之长也。\n今风寒客于人，使人毫毛毕直，皮肤闭而为热。\n当是之时，可汗而发也。\n或痹不仁肿痛，当是之时，可汤熨及火灸刺而去之。\n弗治，病入舍于肺，名曰肺痹，发咳上气。\n弗治，肺即传而行之肝，病名曰肝痹，一名曰厥，胁痛出食，当是之时，可按若刺耳。\n弗治，肝传之脾，病名曰脾风，发瘅，腹中热，烦心，出黄，当此之时，可按、可药、可浴。\n弗治，脾传之肾，病名曰疝瘕，少腹冤热而痛，出白，一名曰蛊，当此之时，可按、可药。\n弗治，肾传之心，病筋脉相引而急，病名曰瘈，当此之时，可灸、可药。\n弗治，满十日，法当死。肾因传之心，心即复反传而行之肺，发寒热，法当三岁死，此病之次也。"}]},{"ID":"20231107103229-fd7rcbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107103229-fd7rcbi","updated":"20231107163359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"从古代角度，胃的地方，古代讲的是心下，真正讲胃的地方，他讲的是小肠；小肠募穴是关元，关元又名丹田，道家练气意会丹田，让其加热，所以小肠是人生命中枢；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231107160925-3mhlgrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107160925-3mhlgrj","updated":"20231107162942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195、黄帝曰：见真脏曰死，何也？岐伯曰：五脏者，皆禀气于胃，胃者五脏之本也。藏气者，不能自致于手太阴，必因于胃气，乃至于手太阴也。故五脏各以其时，自为而至于手太阴也。故邪气胜者，精气衰也。故病甚者，胃气不能与之俱至于手太阴，故真脏之气独见。独见者，病胜脏也，故曰死。"}]},{"ID":"20231107094300-kh53ka4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107094300-kh53ka4","updated":"20231107163335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195.1、黄帝道：见到真脏脉象，就要死亡，是什么道理?岐伯道：五脏的营养，都赖于胃腑水谷之精微，因此胃是五脏的根本。故五脏之脏脉气，不能自行到达于手太阴寸口，必须赖借胃气的敷布，才能达于手太阴。所以五脏之气能够在其所主之时，出现于手太阴寸口，就是有了胃气。如果邪气胜，必定使精气衰。所以病气严重时，胃气就不能与五脏之气一起到达手太阴，胃气阻绝，没办法去供应病脏，所以真脏独见在手上看到，是邪气胜而脏气伤，所以说是要死亡的。"}]},{"ID":"20231107163121-d57txiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231107163121-d57txiu","updated":"20231110090241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三部九侯，人身有上中下三部，三部给有天地人三候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231109095918-ui7t9hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231109095918-ui7t9hz","updated":"20231109100009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196.1、上部天，两额之动脉；上部地，两颊之动脉；上部人，耳前之动脉；上部天，即两额太陽脉处动脉；上部地，即两颊大迎穴处动脉；上部人，即耳前耳门穴处动脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231109100010-dvtpk36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231109100010-dvtpk36","updated":"20231109134033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196.2、中部天，手太陰也；中部地，手陽明也；中部人，手少陰也；中部天，即两手太陰气口、经渠穴处动脉；中部地，即两手陰明经合谷处动脉；中部人，即两手少陰经神门处动脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231109134034-7ofqhzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231109134034-7ofqhzn","updated":"20231109134049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196.3、下部天，足厥陰也；下部地，足少陰也；下部人，足太陰也；下部天，即足厥陰经五里穴或太冲穴处动脉；下部地，即足少陰经太溪穴处动脉；下部人，即足太陰经箕门穴处动脉。"}]},{"ID":"20231109134049-rxax0ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231109134049-rxax0ix","updated":"20231110090252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196.4、故下部之天以候肝，地以候肾，人以候脾胃之气。中部亦有天，亦有地，亦有人，天以候肺，地以候胸中之气，人以候心；上部亦有天，亦有地，亦有人。天以候头角之气，地以候口齿之气，人以候耳目之气。"}]},{"ID":"20231110090259-tiha23x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231110090259-tiha23x","updated":"20231110105743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"197、怎样决断死生？岐伯说：形体盛，脉反细，气短，呼吸困难，危险；如形体瘦弱，脉反大，胸中喘满而多气的是死亡之症。一般而论；形体与脉一致的主生；若脉来三五不调者主病，三部九侯之脉与疾病完全不相适应的，主死；上下左右之脉，相应鼓指如春杵捣谷，参差不齐，病必严重；若见上下之脉相差甚大，而又息数错乱不可计数的，是死亡征候；中部之脉虽然独自调匀，而与其他众脏不相协调的，也是死侯；目内陷的为正气衰竭现象，也是死侯，因为胃气没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20231110100905-vdu28gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231110100905-vdu28gg","updated":"20231113160853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"198、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"夜行则喘出于肾，淫气病肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（夜间运动，如偷东西，跑步，行房的气喘出于肾，会伤肺）"}]},{"ID":"20231113160720-bfnmbjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113160720-bfnmbjm","updated":"20231113170006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199、有所堕恐，喘出于肝，淫气害脾。（从高处坠落或受到恐吓，发出的气喘出于肝，会伤脾）；"}]},{"ID":"20231113170006-gubip3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113170006-gubip3z","updated":"20231113170608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"200、有所惊恐，喘出于肺，淫气伤心；（一个人随时很害怕，惊恐惧怕，这个喘出于肺，会伤心；肺气一离开就会肺虚，由土生金，火生土，就会伤到心脏）"}]},{"ID":"20231113160904-fdzwdrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113160904-fdzwdrd","updated":"20231113171000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"201、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"渡水跌仆，喘出于肾与骨。当是之时，勇者气行则已，怯者则著而为病也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231113170829-scprksz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113170829-scprksz","updated":"20231113171012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"201.1、水浸跌倒后发出的喘出于肾与骨；这种情况，不管是惊恐亦或意外发生导致的，勇敢即胆子大的人气行得开则到此为止不会留下病根，唯唯诺诺怯弱胆小的人就可能因此落下病来；"}]},{"ID":"20231113152841-4hh522v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113152841-4hh522v","updated":"20231113171429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"b strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"故曰：诊病之道，观人勇怯，骨肉皮肤，能知其情，以为诊法也。故饮食饱甚，汗出于胃。惊而夺精，汗出于心。持重远行，汗出于肾。疾走恐惧，汗出于肝。摇体劳苦，汗出于脾。故春秋冬夏，四时阴阳，生病起于过用，此为常也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231113171127-8v12w5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113171127-8v12w5t","updated":"20231113172243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202.1、诊病之道，看人是勇敢还是胆小，从骨肉皮肤的状态了解这个人的性情（如骨肉大之人胆大，皮肤坚实，胆小之人骨肉皮瘦软），以此症状诊治；一个人吃饭吃饱了，流的汗源于胃（古之胃，今之小肠）；（饮水入胃，流的汗则源于心下）；人收到惊吓时，汗源于心；负重抗着重物走路，汗源于肾；如被人追杀，惊恐地跑，汗出于肝；如艺妓歌姬农民唱歌舞蹈锄地工作流的汗，源于脾；所以春夏秋冬四季，四季阴阳平衡，生病都是源于用之太过或完全不用（一阴一阳之谓道），这是常理；"}]},{"ID":"20231113171734-gjwkum2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113171734-gjwkum2","updated":"20231113171808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202.2、所以胆气旺之人无惧，所以要让一个人无惧，要温胆；"}]},{"ID":"20231113172421-s2md8iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113172421-s2md8iy","updated":"20231113172434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203、食气入胃，散精于肝，把胃改成小肠，食气入小肠，散精于肝，淫气于精。精要改掉，要改成筋，因为肝主筋。"}]},{"ID":"20231113172445-ehvgkce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113172445-ehvgkce","updated":"20231113172541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.1、食气入小肠，浊气归心，浊气就是水气，淫精于脉，浊气就是血气，看到是深色的，血气，吃东西吃到小肠里面去以后，小肠里面化成食物，再化成血，血再回到心里面去，心血就会照顾全身的血脉。这个时候脉、脉气流经，经气归于肺，肺朝百脉，输精于皮毛。毛脉合精，行气于府。府精神明，留于四脏，气归于权衡。权衡以平，那这一段呢，用简单的方式来讲，我们人呢，气跟血是相辅相成的，血是来自饮食进入小肠，消化以后变成血，进入了心脏。"}]},{"ID":"20231113172546-an05zjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113172546-an05zjy","updated":"20231113172647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.2、我们有气，气也是来自于饮水，也是跟食物有关系，但是是来自饮水，还有来自我们平常的食物的精华。进入肺部的都是气，进入心脏的都是血。所以，我们人身上到处都有血脉，血会到我们身上所有的地方。肺呢？像皮毛像华盖，气把全身包主。所以，气和血，就是我们的心和肺，两个都是阳在上。我们可以利用心和肺，利用胸阳来决定，看一个人的生死。"}]},{"ID":"20231113172737-3az7o0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231113172737-3az7o0m","updated":"20231114095332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"饮入于胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，这个就是喝水了，喝水跑到胃里面去，这个胃不要改，喝水跑到胃里面去，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"游溢精气，上输于脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，所以，我前面讲过，食物到小肠，喝水到胃里面去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾气散精，上归于肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，脾是土嘛，上过于肺，土生金。这个时候，脾脏"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"通调水道，下输膀胱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，水精四布，五经并行，所以，这个是正常的。所以，脾脏呢，是土，但是它在治水，管水。你除了治水以外，不单单要想这个治，同时还要像水利局一样治水，有脾脏在就不会有这种现象。"}]},{"ID":"20231114094925-cs080vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114094925-cs080vi","updated":"20231114102343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.4、最主要有一个重点要了解到，人体中间横膈是到这个地方，这个膈一再跟诸位强调，这个膈就是我们中医认为是分清浊的位置。所以，清气会上升，进入肺，浊气会下来，所以，五谷杂粮吃的浊物，统统从下面排，大小便会排掉，清气会上升到肺里面去。所以，我们流出来的汗是清的，这是我们的膈，横膈的功能是在这边。所以，水道、排水的系统统统是它来管。前面有介绍过，三焦是决渎之官，这个决渎之官就是管水，我们的脾脏、三焦跟脾脏，源生于脾脏，因为脾脏有很多油脂的东西，所以，从脾脏生出来之后，长了全身的内脏之间，脏腑、肠胃之间，统统有网联到。就是因为有油在里面，所以利水（水在身上走的时候应该是热气，不应该是冷水）；"}]},{"ID":"20231114102136-elavbfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114102136-elavbfe","updated":"20231114102243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"下输膀胱。水精四布，五经并行。合于四时五脏，阴阳揆度，以为常也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；这是正常人应该要的，我们的脾脏在管我们的水道。所以，记得凡是出现水的问题，统统要用去治脾脏。"}]},{"ID":"20231114101940-mu8cmnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114101940-mu8cmnm","updated":"20231123085843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"204、传病（传经）过程：太阳→阳明（止）；太阳→少阳→太阴→少阴→厥阴（阴之尽，所以肝脏是人身上最后的脏）；"}]},{"ID":"20231114115154-kmj59fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114115154-kmj59fl","updated":"20231114142704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205、太阳脉浮且寒（三阳），少阳脉华而不实往来寒热（一阳），阳明脉大而浮但热不寒（二阳）；太阴藏搏脉微弱（三阴），少阴脉沉而不浮（二阴），厥阴脉脉时大时小（一阴）；"}]},{"ID":"20231114113932-ayh65b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114113932-ayh65b1","updated":"20231114145133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝主春，足厥阴少阳主治，其日甲乙，肝苦急，急食甘以缓之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（抽筋，可以吃甜的如蔗糖缓解）"}]},{"ID":"20231114145105-o45xtnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114145105-o45xtnq","updated":"20231114145606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心主夏，手少阴太阳主治，其日丙丁，心苦缓，急食酸以收之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（心脏跳的慢，可以吃酸味以收之，所以酸有收敛作用）"}]},{"ID":"20231114145612-gbk0pu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114145612-gbk0pu4","updated":"20231114145812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207.1、如有人睡觉晚上梦游，魂不守，可以用酸味药将之收回来；如血不归肝，梦多，神不守，可以用酸味药收之；"}]},{"ID":"20231114145135-k1gn4go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114145135-k1gn4go","updated":"20231114150116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"208、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾主长夏，足太阴阳明主治，其日戊己，脾苦湿，急食苦以燥之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（脾主湿，喜燥恶湿，如湿邪缠身，可以吃苦味燥之）"}]},{"ID":"20231114145148-o0w8mvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114145148-o0w8mvr","updated":"20231114150617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"209、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺主秋，手太阴阳明主治，其日庚辛，肺苦气上逆，急食苦以泄之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肺有气逆，用苦味药能将逆气泄之）"}]},{"ID":"20231114145229-ci9a2en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114145229-ci9a2en","updated":"20231114150946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"210、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主冬，足少阴太阳主治 ，其日壬癸，肾苦燥，急食辛以润之，开腠理，致津液，通气也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肾恶燥，吃辛辣的药可润之，辛能润燥）"}]},{"ID":"20231114150955-ap48f0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114150955-ap48f0v","updated":"20231114160623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"咸能软坚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；辛甘得阳，酸苦涌泄为阴；"}]},{"ID":"20231114151033-vyl77r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114151033-vyl77r6","updated":"20231114151052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211.1、如肿瘤硬块，也属于坚；"}]},{"ID":"20231114151005-igq2c9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114151005-igq2c9b","updated":"20231114160955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"212、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在肝，愈于夏，夏不愈，甚于秋，秋不死，持于冬，起于春，禁当风。肝病者，愈在丙丁，丙丁不愈，加于庚辛，庚辛不死，持于壬癸，起于甲乙。肝病者，平旦慧，下晡甚，夜半静。肝欲散，急食辛以散之，用辛补之，酸写之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231114160909-62m5dc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114160909-62m5dc8","updated":"20231114164116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"212.1、肝病，会在夏天痊愈；夏天没好，到秋天就会变严重（金克木），如果秋天还没死，那么到冬天病情不会延伸；因为肝病起于春，所以肝病的人不能吹风，易致病情严重；以此相推，肝病的人会在丙丁时痊愈，庚辛时严重，如果庚辛日不死，壬奎日病情就会比较稳定，回到甲乙时病情就又开始恶化，因为病起甲乙时；从一日来看，肝病者早上清晨的时候病症最清楚，因为平旦是寅卯时（木），病起于木，肝病到了下午就变严重了（申酉金），到晚上就稍微平静些（亥子水）； "}]},{"ID":"20231114160747-uw6ms5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114160747-uw6ms5w","updated":"20231114160958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在心，愈在长夏，长夏不愈，甚于冬，冬不死，持于春，起于夏，禁温食热衣。心病者，愈在戊己，戊己不愈，加于壬癸，壬癸不死，持于甲乙，起于丙丁。心病者，日中慧，夜半甚，平旦静。心欲软，急食咸以软之，用咸补之，甘写之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231114164608-g06mcyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114164608-g06mcyq","updated":"20231114171748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213.1、心病，会在长夏痊愈，长夏不痊愈，冬天就会变严重，如果冬天没死，春天病情就不会延伸，到夏天又开始发一次周期的心脏病；心病的人禁止吃热性的食物，衣服少穿点，以此相推，心脏病的人，会在戊己痊愈（土），戊己不痊愈，壬奎变严重（水），壬奎没死的话，甲乙稍微平稳（木），到丙丁时又开始了（火）；从一日来看，心病之人中午时病症最清楚（巳午火），半夜时发心脏病最严重（亥子水），早上时病症会比较平静（寅卯木）；心欲软，吃咸的东西补到肾，水克火让其软~"}]},{"ID":"20231114165758-651d04r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114165758-651d04r","updated":"20231114170108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213.2、洗冷水的人没有心脏病；"}]},{"ID":"20231114170047-zgqs315","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114170047-zgqs315","updated":"20231114171005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213.3、心脏病的人在冬天少穿衣，洗冷水，中午多吃食，不服药，光是养成这样的习惯心脏病就好很多；"}]},{"ID":"20231114171541-46gdchz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114171541-46gdchz","updated":"20231114171640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213.4、西医说肾脏病不能吃盐（这里指精炼盐），实际上海盐粗盐最好；"}]},{"ID":"20231114160758-0cy5xtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114160758-0cy5xtx","updated":"20231114161000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在脾，愈在秋，秋不愈，甚于春，春不死，持于夏，起于长夏，禁温食饱食湿地濡衣。脾病者，愈在庚辛，庚辛不愈，加于甲乙，甲乙不死，持于丙丁 ，起于戊己。脾病者，日昳慧，日出甚，下晡静。脾欲缓，急食甘以缓之，用苦写之，甘补之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231114171810-rylepaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114171810-rylepaa","updated":"20231115092544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214.1、脾病，痊愈在秋天，秋天不好，会在春天变严重，春天没死的话，夏天病情就不会延伸，到长夏季又开始一轮周期脾病；脾病禁止吃东西吃太饱吃太热，可以吃点凉食如凉面凉稀饭，不要穿湿的衣服，避开湿气比较重的环境；以此相推，脾病的人，痊愈在庚辛时日，庚辛不愈，甲乙加重，甲乙时日不死的话，丙丁时稍微平稳，到戊己时日又开始发病；从一日来看，在午后未时，就会感到好些（火），清晨的时候最为严重（木），到了黄昏的时候会比较平静；脾喜欢缓，吃甜味的药缓之，用苦味药泻之，甘味药补之；"}]},{"ID":"20231114160822-4x6bj1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114160822-4x6bj1p","updated":"20231114161002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在肺，愈在冬，冬不愈，甚于夏，夏不死，持于长夏，起于秋，禁寒饮食寒衣。肺病者，愈在壬癸，壬癸不愈，加于丙丁，丙丁不死，持于戊己，起于庚辛。肺病者，下晡慧，日中甚，夜半静。肺欲收，急食酸以收之，用酸补之，辛写之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115085215-c2h4rov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115085215-c2h4rov","updated":"20231115093048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215.1、肺病，痊愈在冬天，冬天不好，会在夏天变严重，夏天没死的话，长夏季病情就不会延伸，到秋天又开始一轮周期肺病；肺病禁止吃冷饮冷食穿衣单薄；肺病者，痊愈在壬奎时日，壬奎不痊愈（水），丙丁时日加重（火），戊己时日稍微平稳（土），到庚辛时日时日又开始发病；从一日来看，黄昏的时候最为明显（申酉为金），中午的时候最为严重（巳午为火），晚上的时候就会安静下来（亥子为水）；肺喜欢收，吃酸味可以将之收，用酸味补之，辛味泻之；"}]},{"ID":"20231114160836-z7d9qbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231114160836-z7d9qbg","updated":"20231114161004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在肾，愈在春，春不愈，甚于长夏，长夏不死，持于秋，起于冬，禁犯焠（火矣） 热食温灸衣。肾病者，愈在甲乙，甲乙不愈，甚于戊己，戊己不死，持于庚辛，起于壬癸。肾病者，夜半慧，四季甚，下晡静。肾欲坚，急食苦以坚之，用苦补之，咸写之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115093221-6ocw10v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115093221-6ocw10v","updated":"20231115094335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216.1、肾病，痊愈在春天，春天不好，长夏季变严重，长夏没死的话，秋季病情不会延伸，到冬天又开始一轮周期肾病；肾病禁止热性或过热的食物如烧烤麻辣烫火锅，穿的衣服也不能被火烤过，肾病者，痊愈在甲乙时日，甲乙不痊愈的话，戊己时日加重，戊己不死的话，庚辛时日稍微平稳，到壬奎时日又开始发病；从一日来看，半夜的时候最清楚（亥子为水），在辰戌丑未交接的时候病情最严重，到了黄昏的时候就稍微平静些（申酉金 ）；肾喜欢坚，吃苦的东西能坚肾，用苦味药补肾，咸味药泻肾；"}]},{"ID":"20231115094349-u1f7ld3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115094349-u1f7ld3","updated":"20231115094513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216.2、苦味能清肾脏，咸味能强化肾脏功能；吃过咸就会伤到血，血会变粘稠；"}]},{"ID":"20231115094526-epwh00t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115094526-epwh00t","updated":"20231115094720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216.3、根据苦能补肾，如果遇到尿毒患者（尿跑到血里导致水克火），根据苦味入心，所以本草中黄连解毒，可解尿毒；"}]},{"ID":"20231115094409-x756g3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115094409-x756g3y","updated":"20231115111352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝病者，两胁下痛引少腹，令人善怒，虚则目（目巟）（目巟）无所见，耳无所闻，善恐，如人将捕之，取其经，厥阴与少阳，气逆，则头痛耳聋不聪颊肿 。取血者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肝气开窍在眼，如果头痛位置是眼睛后面痛，说明就是肝病，肝气上逆，头顶百会穴痛，肝气上逆）"}]},{"ID":"20231115101542-ilczjsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115101542-ilczjsi","updated":"20231115111354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心病者，胸中痛，胁支满，胁下痛，膺背肩甲间痛，两臂内痛；虚则胸腹大，胁下与腰相引而痛，取其经，少阴太阳，舌下血者。其变病，刺郄中血者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（治心病，取经络手少阴手太阳，或舌头下的金津穴和玉液穴两个经外奇穴扎洞放血，变化延伸的病，可以刺阴郄穴养老穴这种放血；中指无名指尖放血都可以）"}]},{"ID":"20231115101553-exnudv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115101553-exnudv8","updated":"20231115111549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾病者，身重善肌肉痿，足不收行，善瘈，脚下痛；虚则腹满肠鸣，飧泄食不化，取其经，太阴阳明少阴血者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（脾病时感觉身体沉重，肌肉萎缩，脾脏也是在肋骨附近，所以脾病可能胁下痛；脚没法控制行走，容易抽筋，脚下部会疼痛；脾虚肚子会肿胀，肠鸣且下痢，吃东西不消化；这时要取脾经对治，可以在太阴、阳明、少阴经取穴放血）"}]},{"ID":"20231115101556-t0o2mm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115101556-t0o2mm3","updated":"20231115115543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺病者，喘咳逆气，肩背痛，汗出，尻阴股膝髀（月耑）（骨行）足皆痛；虚则少气不能报息，耳聋嗌干，取其经，太阴足太阳之外厥阴内血者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肺病肩背无力或痛（阳不足），流汗，阴部、膝部大腿小腿足部位置也会痛；肺气虚时呼吸浅短，不能做深呼吸，同时兼带有耳聋、喉咙干燥的症状出现；这时取肺经对治，可以在太阴、足太阳脾经之外、厥阴经内放血）"}]},{"ID":"20231115101558-v238bdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115101558-v238bdc","updated":"20231115140752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾病者，腹大胫肿，喘咳身重，寝汗出，憎风；虚则胸中痛，大腹小腹痛，清厥意不乐，取其经，少阴太阳血者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肾病，腹部大，腿脚肿，肾主纳气，肺吸气气下降就是要进入肾脏，金生水，所以肾病会有喘咳现象；盗汗，恶风；肾虚时会感觉胸中疼痛，大腹小腹痛，四肢冰冷，情志郁闷不乐；这时取肾经对治，可以在少阴、太阳经放血）"}]},{"ID":"20231115102732-9ver6y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115102732-9ver6y1","updated":"20231115115956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"218、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"整本黄帝内经讲针灸比较多，讲药一般都是讲药的性味如酸甘苦辣咸，青赤黄白黑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；以前的人更贴切自然，所以只靠针灸就能治好大多数病，现在人欲望太多，要针药并施；"}]},{"ID":"20231115114325-fz1yrg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115114325-fz1yrg4","updated":"20231115115815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219、延伸用法：如一个人一天都正常，就中午身体不舒服，说明有心脏病；如一个人每天晚上亥子时身体很不舒服，说明肾有问题；"}]},{"ID":"20231115115638-qtr1fw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115115638-qtr1fw5","updated":"20231115145952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"220、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝色青，宜食甘"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，粳米牛肉枣葵皆甘。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心色赤，宜食酸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，小豆犬肉李韭皆酸。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺色白，宜食苦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，麦羊肉杏薤皆苦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾色黄，宜食咸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，大豆豕肉栗藿皆咸。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾色黑，宜食辛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，黄黍鸡肉桃葱皆辛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛散，酸收，甘缓，苦坚，咸软"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231115141929-w3454zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115141929-w3454zj","updated":"20231115144829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221、毒药攻邪，五谷为养，五果为助，五畜为益，五菜为充，气味合而服之，以补精益气。此五者，有辛酸甘苦咸，各有所利，或散，或收，或缓，或急，或坚，或软，四时五藏，病随五味所宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20231115144829-pv5jdox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115144829-pv5jdox","updated":"20231115145117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"222、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中药从四个方面下手，药的形，药的色，药的气，药的味；倪师加上‘药的象’、‘药的数’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231115145106-mjj4z3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115145106-mjj4z3o","updated":"20231115145850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"222.1、例‘八角’这味药，八是木的成数（天三生木，地八成之），所以入肝，吃起来辛辣，所以入肺，所以八角是肝与肺中间的药；如橘子切开，里面的饱满的果肉像心脏，绿色的柠檬切开亦是如此，虽然名字不一样，但形相像，所以柠檬酸入肝也入心，主收敛；"}]},{"ID":"20231115144940-lwo8c7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115144940-lwo8c7m","updated":"20231115150049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"223、毒药攻邪，五谷为养，五果为助，五畜为益，五菜为充，气味合而服之，以补精益气。此五者，有辛酸甘苦咸，各有所利，或散，或收，或缓，或急，或坚，或软，四时五藏，病随五味所宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20231115145349-w6t2i3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115145349-w6t2i3f","updated":"20231115150433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"223.1、用毒药攻邪，五谷养身，水果相助，厚味的五畜来增益身体，各类青菜充盈身体，吃符合身体状况的食物，以此补精益气；"}]},{"ID":"20231115150602-mrbz5za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115150602-mrbz5za","updated":"20231115165844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"★"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"224、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五气所病：心为噫，肺为咳，肝为语，脾为吞，肾为欠为嚏，胃为气逆，为哕为恐，大肠小肠为泄，下焦溢为水，膀胱不利为癃，不约为遗溺，胆为怒，是谓五病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115150708-d8kyot9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115150708-d8kyot9","updated":"20231115151921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"224.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五气所病，指的是五脏气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：闭嘴发出类似咳嗽的'嗯~'的声音；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：咳嗽；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：语即自言自语或重复讲话；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：常常有吞口水或吞的动作；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：哈欠、喷嚏；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃气有病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：打嗝、恐惧；大小肠气有病："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"下痢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；下焦气有病：有积水的现象；膀胱小便不顺畅可能里面有堵到如有结石，小便无法控制就会遗尿（寒症）；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆气有病："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"易怒；"}]},{"ID":"20231115151505-xz8ufnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115151505-xz8ufnc","updated":"20231115165841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"★"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五精所并：精气并于心则喜，并于肺则悲，并于肝则忧，并于脾则畏，并于肾则恐，是谓五并，虚而相并者也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115152104-82dkh9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152104-82dkh9w","updated":"20231115152230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.1、五脏中有一脏虚的时候，因为五脏时刻出于平衡的状态，所以一旦一脏虚，其余四脏的精气就会并过去，也可以理解为偏过去；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152233-0oqnbmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152233-0oqnbmh","updated":"20231115152315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.2、如果心气虚，其余四脏并于心，就会出现过喜的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152316-xnxxy45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152316-xnxxy45","updated":"20231115152347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.3、如果肺气虚，其余四脏并于肺，就会出现悲伤的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152347-bezn8o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152347-bezn8o0","updated":"20231115152432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.4、如果肝气虚，其余四脏并于肝，就会出现忧虑的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152433-t7z24vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152433-t7z24vc","updated":"20231115152507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.5、如果脾气虚，其余四脏并于脾，就会出现畏手畏脚的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152507-a0fq18g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152507-a0fq18g","updated":"20231115152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225.6、如果肾气虚，其余四脏并于肾，就会出现恐惧的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152530-pl5voqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152530-pl5voqb","updated":"20231115171427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五藏所恶：心恶热，肺恶寒，肝恶风，脾恶湿，肾恶燥，是谓五恶。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115152701-8y76762","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152701-8y76762","updated":"20231115152912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226.1、由五脏所恶反推五脏所喜：心喜寒，肺喜热，肝喜燥（燥热能胜风），脾喜燥，肾喜湿；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152940-q1h54an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152940-q1h54an","updated":"20231115153230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226.2、由此可得，热的环境伤心，寒的环境伤肺，风大的地方伤肝，湿的环境伤脾，燥热的环境伤肾；"}]},{"ID":"20231115152912-ync9iz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115152912-ync9iz6","updated":"20231115171427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五藏化液：心为汗，肺为涕，肝为泪，脾为涎，肾为唾，是谓五液。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115153311-zjfxutu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115153311-zjfxutu","updated":"20231115153515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227.1、心为汗，所以大部分汗药（发表的药），都是入心脏的药；"}]},{"ID":"20231115153531-rggf0yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115153531-rggf0yv","updated":"20231115163857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227.2、肝为泪，如眼干，就治肝；"}]},{"ID":"20231115163916-xjlhwyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115163916-xjlhwyp","updated":"20231115164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227.3、脾为涎，脾之阴精上布于口，则为涎，主要用来溶解食物，助消化。脾虚呈现恶心口水多现象，应温中健脾；胃火胜则口干涎少；"}]},{"ID":"20231115163923-pswxv96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115163923-pswxv96","updated":"20231115164045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227.4、肾为唾，口干消渴治肾；"}]},{"ID":"20231115164131-wikwuif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115164131-wikwuif","updated":"20231115164141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"228、舌头对应五脏"}]},{"ID":"20231115164142-ij2nsix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115164142-ij2nsix","updated":"20231115164142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 277px;","style":"width: 267px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231115164142-xishqq9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 267px;\" parent-style=\"width: 277px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231115164145-tykfuuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115164145-tykfuuz","updated":"20231115171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五味所禁：辛走气，气病无多食辛；咸走血，血病无多食咸；苦走骨，骨病无多食苦；甘走肉，肉病无多食甘；酸走筋，筋病无多食酸；是谓五禁，无令多食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（可以吃，不能过量）"}]},{"ID":"20231115164446-i5e3374","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115164446-i5e3374","updated":"20231115165549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.1、辛伤气，辛味发散，气有病时，由于气本来是发散的，所以吃辛辣的东西会让气走的更快；"}]},{"ID":"20231115164508-6txwv2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115164508-6txwv2j","updated":"20231115165532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.2、咸伤血，如有意外内伤撞伤或失血淤血贫血的情况，咸的不可吃太多；"}]},{"ID":"20231115165016-ycvpvvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165016-ycvpvvc","updated":"20231115165535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.3、苦伤骨，所以治疗骨病时不要吃太多苦味的食物；（如骨折、脱臼等骨病）；"}]},{"ID":"20231115165248-r2g4z80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165248-r2g4z80","updated":"20231115165517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.4、甜伤肉，肌肉出问题时（过胖或过瘦），甜的少吃；"}]},{"ID":"20231115165517-5mjxmq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165517-5mjxmq6","updated":"20231115165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.5、酸伤筋，筋出问题不能吃太多酸味的食物；（如抽筋、腿不能伸曲）"}]},{"ID":"20231115165757-k4u6tmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165757-k4u6tmb","updated":"20231115171431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五病所发：阴病发于骨，阳病发于血，阴病发于肉，阳病发于冬，阴病发于夏，是谓五发。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115165904-my3ukfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165904-my3ukfl","updated":"20231115170138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230.1、发在骨上面的都是阴病，发在血上面的是阳病；发在肉上的是阴病（层层参差交接，骨是阴，血就是阳，肌肉是阴，皮肤表面就是阳）；"}]},{"ID":"20231115170152-cr75q2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115170152-cr75q2c","updated":"20231115170537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230.2、冬（阳潜藏，阳内阴外），夏（阳生发，阳外阴内）；生病即违背自然规律，所以冬天发病为阳病，夏天发病为阴病；"}]},{"ID":"20231115170456-vqymrlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115170456-vqymrlb","updated":"20231115171432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五邪所乱：邪入于阳则狂，邪入于阴则痹，搏阳则为巅疾，搏阴则为瘖，阳入之阴则静，阴出之阳则怒，是谓五乱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115165856-wejh0pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115165856-wejh0pe","updated":"20231115170800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231.1、头是六阳之首，所以邪气入阳经会产生阳亢，病人会有发狂的现象；邪入阴，则身体容易麻痹；"}]},{"ID":"20231115170847-cnfes5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115170847-cnfes5j","updated":"20231115171531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231.2、阳为动，阴为静，所以邪入于阳，阳相搏阳亢会导致巅疾，邪入于阴，阴相搏人就会失声；正常情况都是阳入于阴，如果阴出之阳就会发怒；"}]},{"ID":"20231115171124-wuifbto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115171124-wuifbto","updated":"20231115171741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"何谓阴出之阳，五邪所见：春得秋脉，夏得冬脉，长夏得春脉，秋得夏脉，冬得长夏脉，名曰阴出之阳，病善怒不治，是谓五邪。皆同命，死不治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115171630-ktoxset","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115171630-ktoxset","updated":"20231115171959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"232、为什么病到后来善怒？因为肝气虚，从情志来看，会呈现怒的情绪；"}]},{"ID":"20231115172000-dcloauy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172000-dcloauy","updated":"20231115172544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"★"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五藏所藏：心藏神，肺藏魄，肝藏魂，脾藏意，肾藏志，是谓五藏所藏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115172147-6kqeal2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172147-6kqeal2","updated":"20231115172249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.1、例心藏神，正常神收纳于心，如神不守，人就会心智不稳定，烦心；"}]},{"ID":"20231115172252-6nbdr6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172252-6nbdr6w","updated":"20231115172550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.2、例肺藏魄，魄主静，如魄不守人就容易好动；"}]},{"ID":"20231115172333-9cvz5al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172333-9cvz5al","updated":"20231115172503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.3、例肝藏魂，正常魂藏于血中，晚上睡觉应该归肝，如不归肝，就会出现梦游的症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231115172336-9vrq74a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172336-9vrq74a","updated":"20231115172705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.4、例脾藏意，意念，如意不守，人就容易迷糊，做事不专一，糊涂懵懂； "}]},{"ID":"20231115172356-ro16r9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172356-ro16r9r","updated":"20231115172840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233.5、例肾藏志，志气、野心、志向，如志不守，人就容易失忆、没志气，毫无斗志；"}]},{"ID":"20231115172042-i8cx8rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172042-i8cx8rj","updated":"20231115172106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"234、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五藏所主：心主脉，肺主皮，肝主筋，脾主肉，肾主骨，是谓五主。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115172106-i6q0yd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115172106-i6q0yd2","updated":"20231115173643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"235、五劳所伤：久视伤血，久卧伤气，久坐伤肉，久立伤骨，久行伤筋，是谓五劳所伤。"}]},{"ID":"20231115173046-bpzz8ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115173046-bpzz8ix","updated":"20231115173553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"235.1、反推得一个人目不能视，肝有问题；不能坐，脾有问题；不能卧，肺有问题；不能站，骨有问题；腿不能屈伸，也是肝有问题；"}]},{"ID":"20231115173124-uoihs0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115173124-uoihs0x","updated":"20231115173656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"236、五脉应象：肝脉弦，心脉钩，脾脉代，肺脉毛，肾脉石，是谓五藏之脉。"}]},{"ID":"20231115173657-b2ip105","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115173657-b2ip105","updated":"20231115180651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"237、太阳经多血少气、少阳经少血多气、阳明经多气多血、少阴经少血多气、厥阴经多血少气、太阴经多气少血；"}]},{"ID":"20231115180651-k0pml2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115180651-k0pml2c","updated":"20231115181130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"237.1、太阳经多血少气，所以足太阳经上面找不到气脉，也是三部九侯少了足太阳的原因；所以三部九侯有气脉的来源，是因为该经经脉多气；"}]},{"ID":"20231115181130-gdy4x4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115181130-gdy4x4m","updated":"20231115181309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"238、唐容川血证论：治病要先去血，一定要把淤血去掉；"}]},{"ID":"20231115181425-d19tuh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115181425-d19tuh7","updated":"20231115181935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"★"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"239、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治经脉时，做十二经气时，就有‘实则泻其子，虚则补其母’的思路，这是用于经脉的气；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115181702-dxx8eia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115181702-dxx8eia","updated":"20231115181938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"239.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当讲五脏气时，才用‘泻南补北’，‘子能令母实，母能令子虚’的思路；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231115181912-wv8vzw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231115181912-wv8vzw5","updated":"20231116100034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240、汗流不止、声音变了、打嗝，说明坏府，胃气绝了，病人没法治了；这时给病人针灸吃药只会伤到皮肉伤血；"}]},{"ID":"20231116081051-7xv0a88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116081051-7xv0a88","updated":"20231116100804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"241、人生病会死，都是病人本身违反天地规律导致的，跟医生没有关系，所以作为医生不要对不能救助病人或被病人非议而感到难过；"}]},{"ID":"20231116100452-sdnobo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116100452-sdnobo0","updated":"20231116113503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"242、凡刺之真，必先治神，五藏已定，九候已备，后乃存针，众脉不见，众凶弗闻，外内相得，无以形先，可玩往来，乃施于人。人有虚实，五虚勿近，五实勿远，至其当发，间不容瞚。手动若务，针耀而匀，静意视义，观适之变，是谓冥冥，莫知其形，见其乌乌，见其稷稷，从见其飞，不知其谁，伏如横弩，起如发机。"}]},{"ID":"20231116113501-q6m5dbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116113501-q6m5dbk","updated":"20231116114525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"242.1、刺的精神，道理是什么？被施针的人和施针者都要心平气和，神要到才能开始施针；扎针时静若处子动若脱兔，眼到手到；"}]},{"ID":"20231116113705-ia0l6m1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116113705-ia0l6m1","updated":"20231116114105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"243、五实：脉盛、皮热、腹胀、前后不通、闷瞀（心胸满闷烦乱），此谓五实；"}]},{"ID":"20231116113939-y40eohg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116113939-y40eohg","updated":"20231116114023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"243.1、五虚：脉细、皮寒、气少、泄利前后、饮食不入，此谓五虚"}]},{"ID":"20231116114024-xn7nbu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116114024-xn7nbu4","updated":"20231116114043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"243.2、五实死，五虚死；"}]},{"ID":"20231116115322-p5mvxdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116115322-p5mvxdl","updated":"20231116115416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"244、帝曰：何如而虚？何如而实？岐伯曰：刺虚者须其实，刺实者须其虚，经气已至，慎守勿失，深浅在志，远近若一，如临深渊，手如握虎，神无营于众物 。"}]},{"ID":"20231116115417-fm63xsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116115417-fm63xsx","updated":"20231116171602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"244.1、如病人是虚症，针灸要让他到实症为止，经气回来为止，如病人是实症，则让他经气虚掉，实症虚掉为止；等经气到时，要谨慎对待，深浅由你自己决定，远近若一（远取穴、近取穴 一导一引配合同时进行，此谓针灸导引法），全神贯注关注不到外界的变化；"}]},{"ID":"20231116171603-89b5sv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116171603-89b5sv4","updated":"20231117102602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"245、针灸要配合天时地利的时机，如随意下针，可能卸掉本来的元气；"}]},{"ID":"20231117102604-cea1stx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231117102604-cea1stx","updated":"20231117111838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡刺之法，必候日月星辰四时八正之气，气定乃刺之。是故天温日明，则人血淖液而卫气浮，故血易写，气易行；天寒日阴，则人血凝泣，而卫气沉。月始生，则血气始精，卫气始行；月郭满，则血气实，肌肉坚；月郭空，则肌肉减，经络虚，卫气去，形独居。是以因天时而调血气也 。是以天寒无刺，天温无疑。月生无写，月满无补，月郭空无治，是谓得时而调之 。因天之序，盛虚之时，移光定位，正立而待之。故日月生而写，是谓藏虚；月满而补，血气扬溢，络有留血，命曰重实；月郭空而治，是谓乱经。阴阳相错，真邪不别，沉以留止，外虚内乱，淫邪乃起。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231116170948-wro9jsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231116170948-wro9jsu","updated":"20231117113611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246.1、凡是针灸之法，必定要对应日月星辰四时八正之气，气到了合适的时宜才下针；如天气温和太阳高照的时候血流动如水，卫气浮，所以血易泻，气易行；反之，天气寒冷日光阴暗，血流较缓，卫气较沉。月初时血气刚才开始生长充实行走，月满，血气充盈肌肉坚实，月黑无光时，肌肉减弱，经络空虚，卫气往里藏，肉身独居其外；所以人体内血气会根据天时月相调整；所以天冷的时候不下针，天气温和的时候没有问题；月刚出生时不要泻之，满月时不要补之；月黑无光时，就干脆不要进行治疗。这就是依据天气时令调节气血的原则。因为天体运行有一定规律，所以月亮有盈亏盛虚，观察日影长短，可以定四时八正之气。所以说月牙初生时用泻法，就会使内脏虚弱，月满时用补法，会让血气充溢于体表，以致络脉中血液滞留，这叫做重实；月黑无光的时候用针刺，就会扰乱经气，叫做乱经。这样的治法必然引起阴阳相错，真气邪气不分，使病变反而深入，致卫外的阳气虚竭，内守的阴气紊乱，淫邪就要发生了；"}]},{"ID":"20231117111838-25qztj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231117111838-25qztj0","updated":"20231117114621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"247、四时风向，应四季风向的风为正风，如春夏交接，吹东南风就为正风"}]},{"ID":"20231117114334-80vxpla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231117114334-80vxpla","updated":"20231117114334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231117114334-blloyhw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231117114628-7s5jihz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231117114628-7s5jihz","updated":"20231117114806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"247.1、相应的为正风，当风不正即不相应时，这时人会受病，而且这种不正的风，一吹到身体就入脏；"}]},{"ID":"20231206093737-anzvnar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206093737-anzvnar","updated":"20231206093739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"247.2、以春甲乙伤于风者为肝风，以夏丙丁伤于风者为心风，以季夏戊己伤于邪者为脾风，以秋庚辛中于邪者为肺风，以冬壬癸中于邪者为肾风。"}]},{"ID":"20231120100447-y9e2n2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120100447-y9e2n2v","updated":"20231120101755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"248、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：余闻补写，未得其意。岐伯曰：写必用方，方者，以气方盛也，以月方满也，以日方温也，，以息方吸而内针，乃复候其方吸而转针，乃复候其方呼而徐引针，故曰写必用方，其气而行焉。补必用员，员者行也，行者移也，刺必中其荣，复以吸排针也。故员与方，非针也。故养神者，必知形之肥瘦，荣卫血气之盛衰。血气者 ，人之神，不可不谨养。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231120084759-ci6kjru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120084759-ci6kjru","updated":"20231120102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"248.1、补泻之法如何？泻必注重时机方法，气盛、月满、温度适宜时，身体安定时，让病人呼吸，吸气时把针刺入，刺入过程捻针，等呼吸又提针；所以泄一定要等到合适的时机，才能发挥泻的作用使邪气泻去而正气运行；补法，讲究一个‘圆’字，所谓圆就是行气。行气就是导移其气到病的所在，刺必要中其荣穴（针要下的比较深的意思），还要在病人吸气时提针。所谓‘圆’与‘方’，并不是指针的形状；所以如果要调理人体的经气，必须明了病人形体的肥瘦，荣卫血气的盛衰。因为血气是人的神的物质基础，不可不谨慎地保养；"}]},{"ID":"20231120102242-ozoe9vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120102242-ozoe9vk","updated":"20231120164205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"249、 下针时要先揉按穴位，让肌肉放松；扪而循之，切而散之，推而按之，弹而怒之，抓而下之，通而取之，外引其门，以闭其神。"}]},{"ID":"20231120164206-cqs2g70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120164206-cqs2g70","updated":"20231120165727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"250、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"呼尽内针，静以久留，以气至为故，如待所贵，不知日暮，其气以至，适而自护，候吸引针，气不得出，各在其处，推阖其门，令神气存，大气留止，故命曰补。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231120164730-bcbtnqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120164730-bcbtnqe","updated":"20231120165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"250.1、气至时，下针处会有一圈粉红色，粉红色块大，代表气来的越大，色块小，代表气来的小，身体已经很虚了；气到了之后，要像接待贵人一样对待它；忘掉时间的早晚，当得气时，要好好保护，等病人吸气时候，拔出其针，那末气就不至外出了；出针以后，应在其孔穴上揉按，使针孔关闭，真气存内，大经之气留于营卫而不泄，这便叫做补。"}]},{"ID":"20231120164735-gtw39qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120164735-gtw39qg","updated":"20231120171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"251、不可挂以发者，待邪之至时而发针写矣，若先若后者，血气已尽，其病不可下，故曰知其可取如发机，不知其取如扣椎，故曰知机道者不可挂以发，不知机者扣之不发，此之谓也。"}]},{"ID":"20231120171616-162tmnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120171616-162tmnz","updated":"20231120171744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"251.1、下针时，要在病人方其来的时候下针最好（如痛在胆经，在不痛的时候下针的话效果有限，等到开始痛了再下针，效果显著）；过早或过晚给它治时，时机就跑掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20231120171745-ofp9f33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120171745-ofp9f33","updated":"20231120171809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"251.2、用针和用药是一样的，等待病发再用药，效果会比较好；"}]},{"ID":"20231120102245-lzhk78i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120102245-lzhk78i","updated":"20231120171923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"252、淤血堵到，要把血放掉，可用火罐抽；"}]},{"ID":"20231120171924-ojbkeiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231120171924-ojbkeiu","updated":"20231120172504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"253、手上的脉察不到时，就察三部九侯的脉（悬厘、角孙、耳前、人迎脉... ），头面上的脉跟手脚脉速度一致称之为正常，如不一致，忽大忽小，说明该经出问题了；"}]},{"ID":"20231121082148-1t1gcdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121082148-1t1gcdw","updated":"20231121085042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"254、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"何谓虚实？岐伯对曰：邪气盛则实，精气夺则虚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121085037-ttw69ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121085037-ttw69ry","updated":"20231121103851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"255、身体末梢是阴阳交汇的地方，如手指尖脚趾尖，所以人体一有病就能在四肢末梢呈现，如人一感冒，脚就冷了（阳气缩回体内对抗病邪）；"}]},{"ID":"20231121103449-zhcmagj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121103449-zhcmagj","updated":"20231121103614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"255.1、四肢末梢开始冷只是初症，如是冰冷的感觉透入骨中，说明病越来越重；如肾脏病、摄护腺肥大、摄护腺癌患者最后能感觉到冰冷的感觉是从骨头中散发出来的；"}]},{"ID":"20231121103531-ucd8frc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121103531-ucd8frc","updated":"20231121112605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚实何如？岐伯曰：气虚者肺虚也，气逆者足寒也，非其时则生，当其时则死。余藏皆如此。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121103835-rbeoxgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121103835-rbeoxgh","updated":"20231121104027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.1、气虚者代表肺虚，气逆了脚就冷了，由金生水，肺病会在冬天好，由火克金，肺病会在夏天死，其他脏也是这样的规律；"}]},{"ID":"20231121104027-yy9ktbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121104027-yy9ktbj","updated":"20231121112549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病之生死：例肝病，逢甲乙碰寅卯（木，甲寅、甲卯、乙寅、乙卯）时病势起来，病会比较甚；逢巳午碰丙丁时痊愈（木生火），这里看的是痊愈的‘日’，如需看‘时’，则在当日火之时即‘巳午’时辰痊愈；逢庚辛碰申酉时即死亡时间点；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121111334-6v5th8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121111334-6v5th8m","updated":"20231121112556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256.3、十天干与十二地支两者相互组合，最小公倍数为60，一个甲子60年；"}]},{"ID":"20231121111117-bgph0vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121111117-bgph0vd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 391px;","style":"width: 381px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231121111042-pru9f3p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 381px;\" parent-style=\"width: 391px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 263px;","style":"width: 253px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231121111021-0wmyto4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 253px;\" parent-style=\"width: 263px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231121111126-9w3bjob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121111126-9w3bjob","updated":"20231121144135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"258、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：何谓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"重实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"？岐伯曰：所谓重实者，言大热病，气热脉满，是谓重实。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121112957-i5cblqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121112957-i5cblqo","updated":"20231121113123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"258.1、什么是重实症？重实症，就是身有大热病，气热脉满；（经脉本身有热病，再加上表症进来是热，两者叠加）"}]},{"ID":"20231121113057-9coee6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121113057-9coee6q","updated":"20231121135547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"259、把脉是能把到血液的流动，如果脉滑，代表血实顺着经络走，属正常，如是脉涩，则代表血液不流畅，重病；"}]},{"ID":"20231121112945-s3pflu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121112945-s3pflu1","updated":"20231121135822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"260、帝曰：络气不足，经气有余，何如？岐伯曰：络气不足，经气有余者，脉口热而尺寒也，秋冬为逆，春夏为从，治主病者。"}]},{"ID":"20231121135824-8c7d5ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121135824-8c7d5ay","updated":"20231121140203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"260.1、络气不足，经气有余是什么样的状态？两者以阴阳论，经气为阳，络气为阴，所以寸部为阳脉大，尺部为阴脉小；秋冬之时见到这样现象的，为逆；而在春夏之时，就为顺了。需要治疗的是那种主病的逆象。"}]},{"ID":"20231121140204-yp1wij6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121140204-yp1wij6","updated":"20231121140224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"261、帝曰：经虚络满，何如？岐伯曰：经虚络满者，尺热满，脉口寒涩也，此春夏死秋冬生也。"}]},{"ID":"20231121140229-y9ut3j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121140229-y9ut3j9","updated":"20231121140442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"261.1、经气虚，络气满，是怎么样的情况？所谓经虚络实，是指尺脉热满浮大而寸脉寒涩低沉，这种现象，若在春夏则死，若在秋冬则生。这是较为严重的情况了；"}]},{"ID":"20231121140312-tv8u8f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121140312-tv8u8f7","updated":"20231121143456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"262、络实经虚和经实络虚分别应该怎么治？络实经虚，灸阴刺阳；经实络虚，刺阴灸阳。 "}]},{"ID":"20231121143309-e1wtypi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121143309-e1wtypi","updated":"20231121144052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"262.1、灸阴刺阳，灸有强固作用，刺则守阳，固他的阴，让阳气不往外走；刺阴灸阳，导阳（引阳入阴），把阳导入到阴里面去；"}]},{"ID":"20231121144135-us2hqbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121144135-us2hqbt","updated":"20231121144256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"263、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：何谓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"重虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"？岐伯曰：脉气上虚尺虚，是谓重虚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121144158-uizj34s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121144158-uizj34s","updated":"20231121144242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"263.1、什么重虚？寸脉和尺脉加重的沉弱，叠加在一起，就是重虚；"}]},{"ID":"20231121144242-6kuwo3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121144242-6kuwo3d","updated":"20231121144743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"264、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"所谓气虚者，言无常也。尺虚者，行步恇然。脉虚者，不象阴也。如此者，滑则生，涩则死也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121144406-58j75tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121144406-58j75tp","updated":"20231121144640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"264.1、气虚的人，讲话没有逻辑，一会讲这个一会讲那个；尺脉虚即下焦虚的人，步履蹒跚，下面阳虚了；脉虚的人，都是阳虚；这样的人，脉滑则生，脉涩则死；"}]},{"ID":"20231121144733-rtwnzlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121144733-rtwnzlq","updated":"20231121145123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"264.2、气虚、脉虚即阳虚的人，补阳即可，补阳后阴自然回来；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景的观念中，除非是大虚之人且阳还在，否则不会先滋阴；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121145014-se42q78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121145014-se42q78","updated":"20231121145304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"265、帝曰：寒气暴上，脉满而实何如？岐伯曰：实而滑则生，实而逆则死。"}]},{"ID":"20231121145305-teu6srj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121145305-teu6srj","updated":"20231121145430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"265.1、寒气上逆头面，脉满而实的情况有什么说法？脉实而滑则生（顺着肺气走），脉实而逆则死（逆着肺气走）；"}]},{"ID":"20231121145955-sqgix99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121145955-sqgix99","updated":"20231121150134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"266、常人头面身体是冷的，手脚是热的；如是手脚冰冷，头面身体是热的，阴阳是反的，"}]},{"ID":"20231121152859-ukin2or","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121152859-ukin2or","updated":"20231121154614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"267、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：其形尽满何如？岐伯曰：其形尽满者，脉急大坚，尺涩而不应也，如是者，故从则生，逆则死。帝曰：何谓从则生，逆则死？岐伯曰：所谓从者，手足温也；所谓逆者，手足寒也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121153533-5h46ibu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121153533-5h46ibu","updated":"20231121153557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"267.1、身形虚浮肿胀的情况怎样？所谓身形虚浮肿胀，是指脉口急大而坚，尺脉却反涩滞，像这样，顺就可生，逆就会死。黄帝问：怎样叫顺则生、逆则死？岐伯说：所谓顺，就是手足温和；所谓逆，就是手足寒冷。"}]},{"ID":"20231121153917-l53gaxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121153917-l53gaxc","updated":"20231121155356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：乳子而病热，脉悬小者何如？岐伯曰：手足温则生，寒则死。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121154652-bmdlrx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121154652-bmdlrx3","updated":"20231121155013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268.1、还没断奶的小孩子得了热病，脉悬小怎么样？（所谓脉症合，热病脉本洪，这里脉悬小）歧伯说：手足如果是温热的则生，寒冷的则死；"}]},{"ID":"20231121154836-dwf2u35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121154836-dwf2u35","updated":"20231121155354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：乳子中风热，喘鸣肩息者，脉何如？岐伯曰：喘鸣肩息者，脉实大也，缓则生，急则死。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231121155000-wope4hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121155000-wope4hy","updated":"20231121155300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269.1、还没断奶的小孩子中风发热，耸肩呼吸（肺气闭守住，要靠肩膀动作才能吸气），脉象如何？歧伯说：脉实大，但速度平缓的能生，脉实大，速度急的则死；"}]},{"ID":"20231121155300-fi03h66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121155300-fi03h66","updated":"20231121155343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270、帝曰：肠澼便血何如？岐伯曰：身热则死，寒则生。帝曰：肠澼下白沫何如？岐伯曰：脉沉则生，脉浮则死。帝曰：肠下脓血何如？岐伯曰：脉悬绝则死 ，滑大则生。帝曰：肠澼之属，身不热，脉不悬绝何如？岐伯曰：滑大者曰生，悬涩者曰死，以藏期之。"}]},{"ID":"20231121155346-wp5xr49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121155346-wp5xr49","updated":"20231121160039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270.1、如果下痢大便有血该怎么办？歧伯说：身体热的则死，身体寒则生；黄帝说：下痢时带有白沫怎么办？歧伯说：脉沉则生，脉浮则死（带白沫就是阴虚掉了）；黄帝说：下痢脓血怎么看生死？歧伯说：脉悬绝则死，脉滑大则生；黄帝说：如果下痢，身不热，脉不悬绝呢？歧伯说：脉滑大者生，脉悬涩者死，可以按照真脏脉来判断死期；"}]},{"ID":"20231121155951-nenm1lq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121155951-nenm1lq","updated":"20231121160014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270.2、所有下痢症，有胃气则生，脉滑大就是有胃脉；"}]},{"ID":"20231121160041-m5flpeq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121160041-m5flpeq","updated":"20231121160109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"271、帝曰：癫疾何如？岐伯曰：脉搏大滑，久自已；脉小坚急，死不治。帝曰：癫疾之脉，虚实何如？岐伯曰：虚则可治，实则死。"}]},{"ID":"20231121160055-n501394","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121160055-n501394","updated":"20231121160313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"271.1、癫痫类的疾病怎么看生死呢？歧伯说：脉搏大而滑的，一段时间就会自己好；脉如果小而坚又急，那就没法治了；黄帝问：癫痫类的疾病的脉，怎么看能否治愈？歧伯说：脉虚则可治，脉实则死；"}]},{"ID":"20231121160816-dbb2ays","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121160816-dbb2ays","updated":"20231121160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"272、帝曰：消瘅虚实何如？岐伯曰：脉实大，病久可治；脉悬小坚，病久不可治。"}]},{"ID":"20231121160825-o1a606j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121160825-o1a606j","updated":"20231121161303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"272.1、消渴、黄疸虚实怎么样呢？歧伯说：脉实大的， 病再久都可以治（也可以理解治久点能治好）；脉悬小坚的，病久者不可治（也可以理解为治再久也治不好了）；"}]},{"ID":"20231121160855-qz7dd8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121160855-qz7dd8o","updated":"20231121161148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"272.2、三阳结：阳结的全热症就是所谓的消中、糖尿病；（究其原因是阳结住了）"}]},{"ID":"20231121170220-a6i1u24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121170220-a6i1u24","updated":"20231121170914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"273、怎么看体内有化脓？化脓的地方摸上去是热的，所以摸皮肤表面，里面热，周边凉，说明热的皮肤之下化脓；（对治可以在手太阴经上找穴；也可以从胃经、肺经阿是穴上找）"}]},{"ID":"20231121170315-k7pp0nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231121170315-k7pp0nv","updated":"20231122092208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"274、腹暴满，按之不下，取手太阳经络者，胃之募也，少阴俞去脊椎三寸傍五，用员利针。霍乱，刺俞傍五，足阳明及上傍三。刺痫惊脉五，针手太阴各五，刺经太阳五，刺手少阴经络傍者一，足阳明一，上踝五寸刺三针。"}]},{"ID":"20231122092210-z46kq2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122092210-z46kq2b","updated":"20231122092222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"274.1、腹部突然胀痛，按之胀痛不减的，应该取手太阳经的络穴，就是胃的募穴和少阴肾腧穴五次，用员利针。霍乱，应针肾腧两旁的志室穴五次，足阳明胃腧及肾腧外两傍胃仓穴，刺三次。惊痫的刺法有五点：针手太阴经的经渠穴五次；刺手太阳小肠经的阳谷穴五次；刺手少阴经络傍的支正穴一次；刺足阳明经解谿穴一次；刺足踝上五寸的筑宾穴三次。"}]},{"ID":"20231122092224-m0ab6fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122092224-m0ab6fl","updated":"20231122094244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275、凡治消瘅、仆击、偏枯、痿厥、气满发逆，肥贵人，则高梁之疾也。隔塞闭绝，上下不通，则暴忧之疾也。暴厥而聋，偏塞闭不通，内气暴薄也。不从内 ，外中风之病，故瘦留著也。蹠跛，寒风湿之病也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122094246-wktwamb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122094246-wktwamb","updated":"20231122094501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275.1、凡诊治消瘅、突然跌倒、半身不遂、气逆、气满等病需分清肥丰的贵人，是吃肉类精米太多所造成的。隔噎就会气闭不行，上下不通，那是暴怒或忧虑所引起的病。突然厥逆，不知人事，耳聋，大小便不通，那是内气上迫引起的病（内发的病）。有的病，不从内起，外中风寒，因为风邪留滞，久之化热，肌肉消瘦，是极其明显的。有的人行走偏跛，那是因为着寒或是风湿而形成的病。"}]},{"ID":"20231122094624-eicmm9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122094624-eicmm9a","updated":"20231122094627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276、黄帝曰：黄疸暴痛，癫疾厥狂，久逆之所生也。五藏不平，六府闭塞之所生也。头痛耳鸣，九窍不利，肠胃之所生也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122094629-6dujb0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122094629-6dujb0h","updated":"20231122094922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276.1、黄帝道：黄疸、突然发生剧痛、癫狂、气逆等症，是长久生病，由于经脉之气，久逆于上所造成的。五脏不和，是由于六腑闭塞所造成的（脏腑靠三焦联通，相辅相成，脏有问题，说明腑有闭塞，治脏常常治腑）。头痛、耳鸣、九窍不利，是由于肠胃病变所造成的。"}]},{"ID":"20231122095035-okebed0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122095035-okebed0","updated":"20231122095441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276.2、常人胃口正常，大小便通畅，睡眠质量好，那这个人腑没有问题，也没脏病；如果一个人便秘三四年，虽然三四年并未生病，但腑病一直不解，之后一定会影响到脏；（临床上，看到病人头痛耳鸣、九窍不利、大小便不通等症状，都是肠胃所成，所以常常在治疗头痛等症时，下胃经中脘穴）"}]},{"ID":"20231122095234-a36n8b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122095234-a36n8b7","updated":"20231122103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"277、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳道实，阴道虚。故犯贼风虚邪者阳受之，食饮不节，起居不时者，阴受之。阳受之则入六腑，阴受之则入五脏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122103202-wkk9nkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122103202-wkk9nkp","updated":"20231218091510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"278、阳明就是指腑，分有二，一个是经热，一个是腑热；"}]},{"ID":"20231122103405-skschvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122103405-skschvc","updated":"20231122103857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"279、阳明和太阴相表里，太阴病由内受如饮食进来，阳明病由外受如外邪进来的；"}]},{"ID":"20231122103732-vtu1nk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122103732-vtu1nk5","updated":"20231122143252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"280、脾脏在帮小肠行津液；"}]},{"ID":"20231122143252-xm045i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122143252-xm045i8","updated":"20231122144137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"281、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"内经里，是以18天作为一个节气即长夏季长度是18天（例立冬的前9天加后9天）；而在算命中，为了准确度，是以2周即14天作为一个节气（例立冬前7天后7天）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122143708-epbkj81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122143708-epbkj81","updated":"20231122150332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"282、汗尿同源，如冬天吃解表药没有发汗，是正常的情况，因为冬天毛孔闭塞，会从汗解变尿解；"}]},{"ID":"20231122150332-emdyd7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150332-emdyd7j","updated":"20231122151625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"283、横隔最主要的作用是分清浊，如果便秘或阳明病导致浊气穿过横隔上头，那人就会神志不清，发狂奔走；（如果只是阳亢上头则是发癫痫）"}]},{"ID":"20231122151513-c4mx65q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122151513-c4mx65q","updated":"20231123084220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"284、热病，最初是伤于寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231123084220-r54fcyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123084220-r54fcyr","updated":"20231123085959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"285、表伤于寒，经过传经寒邪通过少阳入里使阴经受病（如太阴、少阴、厥阴），这时表再伤于寒，人就难免于死亡了；"}]},{"ID":"20231123090000-ub3hule","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090000-ub3hule","updated":"20231123090202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"整个伤寒论的基础原则："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231123090143-wkt3hhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090143-wkt3hhm","updated":"20231123090629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"伤寒一日，巨阳受之，故头项痛腰脊强。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（伤寒病一日，为太阳经感受寒邪，足太阳经脉从头下项，侠脊抵腰中，所以头项痛，腰脊强直不舒。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090049-7ldmf7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090049-7ldmf7v","updated":"20231123090638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"二日阳明受之，阳明主肉，其脉侠鼻络于目，故身热目疼而鼻干，不得卧也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（二日，阳明经受病，阳明主肌肉，足阳明经脉挟鼻络于目，下行入腹，所以身热目痛而鼻干，不能安卧。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123084011-omb1dsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123084011-omb1dsz","updated":"20231123090646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阳经络皆受其病，而未入于藏者，故可汗而已。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（三日少阳受之，少阳主胆，其脉循胁络于耳，故胸胁痛而耳聋。三日，少阳经受病，少阳主骨，足少阳经脉，循胁肋而上络于耳，所以胸胁痛而耳聋。若三阳经络皆受病，尚未入里入阴的，都可以发汗而愈。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090106-ufrnwpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090106-ufrnwpl","updated":"20231123090653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四日太阴受之，太阴脉布胃中络于嗌，故腹满而嗌干。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（四日，太阴经受病，足太阴经脉散布于胃中，上络于咽，所以腹中胀满而咽干。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090110-49v91p1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090110-49v91p1","updated":"20231123090701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五日少阴受之，少阴脉贯肾络于肺，系舌本，故口燥舌干而喝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（五日，少阴经受病，足少阴经脉贯肾，络肺，上系舌本，所以口燥舌干而渴。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090114-b4hi45g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090114-b4hi45g","updated":"20231123090708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六日厥阴受之，厥阴脉循阴器而络于肝，故烦满而囊缩。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（六日，厥阴经受病，足厥阴经脉环阴器而络于肝，所以烦闷而阴囊收缩。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090551-6jqskf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090551-6jqskf7","updated":"20231123090714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阴三阳，五藏六府皆受病，荣卫不行 ，五藏不通则死矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（如果三阴三阳经脉和五脏六腑均受病，以致营卫不能运行，五脏之气不通，人就要死亡了。）"}]},{"ID":"20231123090131-2x2y81d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090131-2x2y81d","updated":"20231123093505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286.1、这里的一日，以现在的标准，倪师说是六天，古时标准应该是七天；"}]},{"ID":"20231123090313-ma4n4nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123090313-ma4n4nt","updated":"20231123091001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286.2、太阳→寒水之气，受病时摸皮肤或寒水都是冰的；"}]},{"ID":"20231123091001-pid3jas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123091001-pid3jas","updated":"20231123092426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286.3、如病在三阳，大小便正常的情况，可以通过汗解（如阳明腑热便秘则不可汗解）；"}]},{"ID":"20231123093819-99npa5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123093819-99npa5l","updated":"20231123093914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"287、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"其不两感于寒者，七日巨阳病衰，头痛少愈；八日阳明病衰，身热少愈；九日少阳病衰，耳聋微闻；十日太阴病衰，腹减如故，则思饮食；十一日少阴病衰，渴止不满，舌干已而嚏；十二日厥阴病衰，囊纵少腹微下，大气皆去，病日已矣。帝曰：治之奈何？岐伯曰：治之各通其藏脉，病日衰已矣。其未满三日者 ，可汗而已；其满三日者，可泄而已。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231123093824-gxqkp7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123093824-gxqkp7q","updated":"20231123093855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"287.1、如果病不是阴阳表里两感于寒邪的，则第七日，太阳病衰，头痛稍愈；八日，阳明病衰，身热稍退；九日，少阳病衰，耳聋将逐渐能听到声音；十日，太阴病衰，腹满已消，恢复正常，而欲饮食；十一日，少阴病衰，口不渴，不胀满，舌不干，能打喷嚏；十二日，厥阴病衰，阴囊松弛，渐从少腹下垂。至此，大邪之气已去，病也逐渐痊愈。黄帝说：怎么治疗呢？岐伯说：治疗时，应根据病在何脏何经，分别予以施治，病将日渐衰退而愈。对这类病的治疗原则，一般病未满三日，而邪犹在表的，可发汗而愈；病已满三日，邪已入里的，可以泄下而愈。"}]},{"ID":"20231123093857-tke9hks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123093857-tke9hks","updated":"20231123094820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"288、热病痊愈后还会重新发热的原因，是因为在发热较重的时候强行吃东西，导致饮食不化的热跟余热相协，重新发热；所以生病的时候要饮食清淡，尽量不食肉类；"}]},{"ID":"20231123094655-mgettp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123094655-mgettp8","updated":"20231123095852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"289、稻谷按照春夏秋冬四季节气走，所以是天地之间的精华；"}]},{"ID":"20231123093836-wuyg21w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123093836-wuyg21w","updated":"20231123100039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"290、黄帝说：病已发展至五脏已伤，六腑不通，营卫不行，像这样的病，要三天以后死亡，是什么道理呢？岐伯说：阳明为十二经之长，此经脉的气血最盛，所以病人容易神识昏迷。三天以后，阳明的气血已经竭尽，所以就要死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20231123100038-k75pe1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123100038-k75pe1l","updated":"20231123100214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"291、凡病伤寒而成温者，先夏至日者为病温，后夏至日者为病暑，暑当与汗皆出，勿止。"}]},{"ID":"20231123100205-mxjsgx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123100205-mxjsgx6","updated":"20231123100642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"291.1、凡夏至日之前得到的温病，都属于冬伤于寒，夏至日之后得到的温病，是中暑，暑病应该汗解，不要去止它（汗出，阳之极，阴液会自己回头；一切肉类不能吃，只能吃谷类蔬菜类）；"}]},{"ID":"20231123100758-nu1wmv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123100758-nu1wmv8","updated":"20231123100824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"292、肝经络阴器，小便黄，说明肝有热；"}]},{"ID":"20231123100818-7fbqoc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123100818-7fbqoc0","updated":"20231123101230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"293、八纲辨证用法（阴阳表里虚实寒热）：如便秘，分为寒实和热实（可从小便是清是黄辨别身体是寒是热）；寒则小肠不会蠕动不会痛，热则小肠蠕动会痛；"}]},{"ID":"20231123101230-hw4v4a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101230-hw4v4a1","updated":"20231123101621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"294、刺热篇："}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-nwan6lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-nwan6lk","updated":"20231123101630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝热病者，小便先黄，腹痛多卧身热，热争，则狂言及惊，胁满痛，手足躁，不得安卧；庚辛甚，甲乙大汗，气逆则庚辛死。刺足厥阴少阳。其逆则头痛员员，脉引冲头也。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-8wjk3h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-8wjk3h4","updated":"20231123101631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心热病者，先不乐，数日乃热，热争则卒心痛，烦闷善呕，头痛面赤，无汗；壬癸甚，丙丁大汗，气逆则壬癸死。刺手少阴太阳。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-7atgwo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-7atgwo3","updated":"20231123101631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾热病者，先头重颊痛，烦心颜青，欲呕身热，热争则腰痛不可用俛仰，腹满泄，两颔痛；甲乙甚，戊己大汗，气逆则甲乙死。刺足太阴阳明。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-efqhhhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-efqhhhh","updated":"20231123101632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺热病者，先淅然厥，起毫毛，恶风寒，舌上黄，身热。热争则喘欬，痛走胸膺背，不得大息，头痛不堪，汗出而寒；丙丁甚，庚辛大汗，气逆则丙丁死 。刺手太阴阳明，出血如大豆，立已。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-2blbe71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-2blbe71","updated":"20231123101633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾热病者，先腰痛（骨行）痠，苦喝数饮，身热，热争则项痛而强，（骨行 ）寒且痠，足下热，不欲言，其逆则项痛员员澹澹然；戊己甚，壬癸大汗，气逆则戊己死。刺足少阴太阳。诸汗者，至其所胜日汗出也。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101626-pheilkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101626-pheilkp","updated":"20231123101634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝热病者，左颊先赤；心热病者，颜先赤；脾热病者，鼻先赤；肺热病者，右颊先赤；肾热病者，颐先赤。病虽未发，见赤色者刺之，名曰治未病。热病从部所起者，至期而已；其刺之反者，三周而已；重逆则死。诸当汗者，至其所胜日，汗大出也。"}]},{"ID":"20231123101644-jpu6cdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123101644-jpu6cdc","updated":"20231123102227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"295、中医观念中，热跟火是两种概念；"}]},{"ID":"20231123102703-2h541sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123102703-2h541sa","updated":"20231123102714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"296、风为阳；"}]},{"ID":"20231123102714-0853r34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123102714-0853r34","updated":"20231123150048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"297、诸治热病，以饮之寒水，乃刺之；必寒衣之，居止寒处，身寒而止也。（治热病，要喝冷水，少穿衣，居寒处）"}]},{"ID":"20231123150049-44in11a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231123150049-44in11a","updated":"20231124090044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"298、热病气穴：三椎下间主胸中热，四椎下间主鬲中热，五椎下间主肝热，六椎下间主脾热，七椎下间主肾热，荣在骶也，项上三椎陷者中也。颊下逆颧为大瘕，下牙车为腹满，颧后为胁痛。颊上者，鬲上也。（这个热简单讲就是西医说的炎症）"}]},{"ID":"20231124090010-r8wgo3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124090010-r8wgo3t","updated":"20231124090010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231124090010-qywxzkk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231124090012-nrx1cr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124090012-nrx1cr3","updated":"20231124090733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"299、只要津液在，都可以汗解——倪海厦 ；"}]},{"ID":"20231124090545-4iq5liq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124090545-4iq5liq","updated":"20231124103512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"300、劳风（劳动出汗伤到风）对治：以救俛仰。巨阳引。精者三日，中年者五日，不精者七日，咳出青黄涕，其状如脓，大如弹丸，从口中若鼻中出，不出则伤肺，伤肺则死也。（深呼吸，呼气弯腰，吸气挺身，天阳气会进行肾脏）"}]},{"ID":"20231124103615-3jvukre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124103615-3jvukre","updated":"20231124104529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"301、虚不当刺，不当刺而刺，后五日其气必至；帝曰：其至何如？岐伯曰：至必少气时热，时热从胸背上至头，汗出，手热，口干苦渴，小便黄，目下肿，腹中鸣，身重难以行，月事不来，烦而不能食，不能正偃，正偃则欬，病名曰风水，论在《刺法》中。"}]},{"ID":"20231124104529-3hx2v3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124104529-3hx2v3f","updated":"20231124104534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"301.1、做针灸遇到虚症时能不刺就不刺，不应该刺的时候下针时，病症五日后又会回来，回来之后会少气发热等症状；"}]},{"ID":"20231124103711-z13d8bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124103711-z13d8bl","updated":"20231124104907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"302、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"邪之所凑，其气必虚，阴虚者，阳必凑之，故少气时热而汗出也。小便黄者，少腹中有热也。不能正偃者，胃中不和也。正偃则咳甚，上迫肺也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231124104908-nug1vee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124104908-nug1vee","updated":"20231124105141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"303、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"诸有水气者，微肿先见于目下也。（所有水气病，看面相眼袋都是微肿的）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231124105015-6vudfn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124105015-6vudfn1","updated":"20231124105135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"303.1、左眼袋光鲜，说明他对儿子很骄傲，出贵子；右边眼袋下方颜色光鲜说明女儿很优秀；"}]},{"ID":"20231124104940-qx3duom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124104940-qx3duom","updated":"20231124105604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"304、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"月事不来者，胞脉闭也，胞脉者属心而络于胞中，今气上迫肺，心气不得下通，故月事不来也。（月经来源于奶水的出处）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231124105524-kq0xhsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124105524-kq0xhsr","updated":"20231124110935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"305、帝曰：人身非衣寒也，中非有寒气也，寒从中生者何？岐伯曰：是人多痹气也，阳气少，阴气多，故身寒如从水中出。"}]},{"ID":"20231124110938-fq0rrbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124110938-fq0rrbn","updated":"20231124111018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"305.1、穿衣很多依旧感觉身冷，是因为人身阳气少阴气多，导致里寒重；"}]},{"ID":"20231124111209-f0kq6kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111209-f0kq6kc","updated":"20231124111226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"306、帝曰：人有四支热，逢风寒如炙如火者，何也？岐伯曰：是人者，阴气虚，阳气盛，四支者阳也，两阳相得，而阴气虚少，少水不能灭盛火，而阳独治，独治者，不能生长也，独胜而止耳，逢风而如炙如火者，是人当肉烁也。"}]},{"ID":"20231124111238-zzbt4yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111238-zzbt4yk","updated":"20231124111557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"306.1、常人手掌脚掌热，手背脚背冷，这里的情况是两面都是热的，遇到风寒时好像被火烤的感觉；其人必然肌肉逐渐消瘦。"}]},{"ID":"20231124111332-ug9uin2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111332-ug9uin2","updated":"20231124111615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"306.2、主要原因是阴虚阳盛，这种人的肌肉必然会逐渐消瘦；"}]},{"ID":"20231124111436-rgx2v2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111436-rgx2v2u","updated":"20231124111504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"306.3、独阳者，肌肉不能生长（阴虚阳盛）；"}]},{"ID":"20231124111625-xzgzr7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111625-xzgzr7k","updated":"20231124111629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"307、帝曰：人有身寒，汤火不能热，厚衣不能温，然不冻栗，是为何病？岐伯曰：是人者，素肾气胜，以水为事；太阳气衰，肾脂枯不长；一水不能胜两火，肾者水也，而生于骨，肾不生，则髓不能满，故寒甚至骨也。所以不能冻栗者，肝一阳也，心二阳也，肾孤藏也，一水不能胜二火，故不能冻栗，病名曰骨痹，是人当挛节也。"}]},{"ID":"20231124111639-wwj3di9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124111639-wwj3di9","updated":"20231124112007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"307.1、黄帝说：有的人身体寒凉，虽进汤火不能使之热，多穿衣服也不能使之温，但却不恶寒战栗，这是什麽病呢？岐伯说：这种人平素即肾水之气盛，又经常接近水湿，致水寒之气偏盛，而太阳之阳气偏衰，太阳之阳气衰，则肾脂枯竭不长。肾是水脏，主生长骨髓，肾脂不生则骨髓不能充满，故寒冷至骨。其所以不能战栗，是因为肝是一阳，心是二阳，一个独阴的肾水，胜不过心肝二阳之火，所以虽寒冷，但不战栗，这种病叫“骨痹”，病人必骨节拘挛（这种人必定关节肿大胀大，风湿关节炎来源）。"}]},{"ID":"20231124112058-l87p3vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124112058-l87p3vw","updated":"20231124112224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"307.2、如家庭主妇吃完饭洗碗，手在冰水中受到寒气入骨，长久以往，骨受寒邪，所以外边有风吹来也不觉得冷，自然也不会颤栗；"}]},{"ID":"20231124112225-9gwyj39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124112225-9gwyj39","updated":"20231124112524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"308、血气虚，肌肉就容易麻木不仁，卫气虚就没有办法出力；"}]},{"ID":"20231124112525-hl9luxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124112525-hl9luxd","updated":"20231129161848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"309、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问曰："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夫痎疟皆生于风，其蓄作有时者何也？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯对曰："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"疟之始发也，先起于毫毛，伸欠乃作，寒慄鼓颔，腰脊俱痛，寒去则内外皆热，头痛如破，渴欲冷饮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"何气使然？愿闻其道。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴阳上下交争，虚实更作，阴阳相移也。阳并于阴，则阴实而阳虚，阳明虚则寒栗鼓颔也；巨阳虚则腰背头项疼；三阳俱虚则阴气胜，阴气胜则骨寒而痛；寒生于内，故中外皆寒；阳盛则外热，阴虚则内热，则喘而渴，故欲冷饮也。"}]},{"ID":"20231124143139-pa7jf72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124143139-pa7jf72","updated":"20231129161851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"309.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一般说来疟疾都由于感受了风邪而引起，他的休作有一定时间，这是什麽道理？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯回答说："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"疟疾开始发作的时候，先起于毫毛竖立，继而四体不舒，欲的引伸，呵欠连连，乃至寒冷发抖，下颌鼓动，腰脊疼痛；及至寒冷过去，便是全身内外发热，头痛有如破裂，口渴喜欢冷饮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这是什麽原因引起的？请说明它的道理。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这是由于阴阳上下相争，虚实交替而作，阴阳虚实相互移易转化的关系。阳气并入于阴分，使阴气实而阳气虚，阳明经气虚，就寒冷发抖乃至两颌鼓动；太阳经气虚，便腰背头项疼痛；三阳经气都虚，则阴气更胜，阴气胜则骨节寒冷而疼痛，寒从内生，所以内外都觉寒冷。如阴气并入阳分，则阳气实而阴气虚。阳主外，阳盛就发生外热；阴主内，阴虚就发生内热，因此外内都发热，热甚的时候就气喘口渴，所以喜欢冷饮。"}]},{"ID":"20231124143713-avusjhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124143713-avusjhw","updated":"20231129161857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"309.2、标准的疟疾：口非常的渴，身体又冷得牙齿打战；"}]},{"ID":"20231124143400-d9xp7s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231124143400-d9xp7s5","updated":"20231129161900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"310、往来寒热，太阳症；往来寒热，恶心欲呕吐，少阳证；背痛身冷口干舌燥，疟疾；"}]},{"ID":"20231127101738-kvrv2i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231127101738-kvrv2i4","updated":"20231129161902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"311、风府：狭义来说是风府穴，广义来说受风的地方就是风府；"}]},{"ID":"20231127103148-br5k2wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231127103148-br5k2wt","updated":"20231129161906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"312、风症，24小时的症如忽冷忽热；疟症：一天发一次，发一次过段时间再复发；"}]},{"ID":"20231128083256-5713n4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128083256-5713n4l","updated":"20231129161908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"313、瘅疟：因为操劳而得到的病称之为瘅；"}]},{"ID":"20231128083319-qx5qxjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128083319-qx5qxjz","updated":"20231129161911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"314、针灸大热时不刺，脉象不规律时不刺，大汗时不刺；"}]},{"ID":"20231128085832-64c9jhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128085832-64c9jhs","updated":"20231129161913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"315、任何的疟疾，一定从四肢末梢开始发（阴阳交汇之处，阴阳不和，即从四肢开始体现）；（可以用桂枝汤调理）"}]},{"ID":"20231128093454-zwx046r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128093454-zwx046r","updated":"20231129161918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"315.1、所以治病发前的疟疾，将十指束缚住，让邪气不得往内延伸，在末梢孙络处看到有血脉崩张的地方，通通进行点刺放血；"}]},{"ID":"20231128114251-yi9eawm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128114251-yi9eawm","updated":"20231129161920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"316、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足太阳之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人腰痛头重，寒从背起，先寒后热，（火高）（火高）暍暍然，热止汗出，难已，刺郄中出血。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151420-6gbllqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151420-6gbllqo","updated":"20231128152153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足少阳之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人身体解（ 亻亦），寒不甚，热不甚，恶见人，见人心惕惕然，热多汗出甚，刺足少阳。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151420-9394x32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151420-9394x32","updated":"20231128152154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足阳明之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人先寒，洒淅洒淅，寒甚久乃热，热去汗出，喜见日月光火气，乃快然，刺足阳明跗上。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151420-uf3wuih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151420-uf3wuih","updated":"20231128152156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足太阴之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人不乐，好太息，不嗜食，多寒热汗出，病至则善呕，呕已乃衰，即取之。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151420-rsnnou0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151420-rsnnou0","updated":"20231128152157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足少阴之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人呕吐甚，多寒热，热多寒少，欲闭户牖而处，其病难已。"}]},{"ID":"20231128152142-4po42ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128152142-4po42ex","updated":"20231128152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"足厥阴之疟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，令人腰痛少腹满，小便不利，如癃状，非癃也，数便，意恐惧，气不足，腹中悒悒，刺足厥阴。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151438-28rlnem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151438-28rlnem","updated":"20231129161925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"317、"}]},{"ID":"20231128151453-lp2q7tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151453-lp2q7tp","updated":"20231128151506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺疟者，令人心寒，寒甚热，热间善惊，如有所见者，刺手太阴阳明。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151500-m7a325i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151500-m7a325i","updated":"20231128151507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心疟者，令人烦心甚，欲得清水，反寒多，不甚热，刺手少阴。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151453-169ng4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151453-169ng4h","updated":"20231128151507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝疟者，令人色苍苍然，太息，其状若死者，刺足厥阴见血。 "}]},{"ID":"20231128151503-no32i7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151503-no32i7o","updated":"20231128151508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾疟者，令人寒，腹中痛，热则肠中鸣，鸣已汗出，刺足太阴。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151453-3801vft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151453-3801vft","updated":"20231128151509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾疟者，令人洒洒然，腰脊痛，宛转，大便难，目（目旬）（目旬）然，手足寒，刺足太阳少阴。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151453-nruy953","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151453-nruy953","updated":"20231128151509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃疟者，令人且病也，善饥而不能食，食而支满腹大，刺足阳明太阴横脉出血。"}]},{"ID":"20231128151510-olgbiln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128151510-olgbiln","updated":"20231129161930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"318、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃为肾之关"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；肺气肃降跟肾有关，途中经过肺，如果肾出问题堵到了，肃降的肺气往回顶到胃中，会造成呕吐的现象；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以常常呕吐很严重的时候，往往是这个人的肾出问题了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231128152525-ru8uqfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128152525-ru8uqfm","updated":"20231128152525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231128152525-qtvncms.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231128152527-ncohocq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128152527-ncohocq","updated":"20231129161933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"319、疟的冷跟伤寒的冷不一样，伤寒的冷是身体感觉冷，疟的冷是由内而发，牙齿打颤；"}]},{"ID":"20231128153257-4fvrarv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128153257-4fvrarv","updated":"20231129161936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"320、疟脉缓大虚，不宜用针宜用药；"}]},{"ID":"20231128155114-1j4rbh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128155114-1j4rbh3","updated":"20231129161939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"321、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡治疟，先发如食顷乃可以治，过之则失时也。诸疟而脉不见，刺十指间出血，血去必已，先视身之赤如小豆者尽取之。十二疟者，其发各不同时，察其病形，以知其何脉之病也。先其发时如食顷而刺之，一刺则衰，二刺则知，三刺则已；不已，刺舌下两脉出血，不已，刺郄中盛经出血，又刺项已下侠脊者必已。舌下两脉者，廉泉也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231128155359-rxtg9vv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128155359-rxtg9vv","updated":"20231129161943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"321.1、治疟在病未发之时治最好；过了就失去了时机了；凡疟疾病人脉沉伏不见的，急刺十指间出血，血出病必愈；若先见皮肤上发出象赤小豆的红点，应都用针刺去。；上述十二种疟疾，其发作各有不同的时间，应观察病人的症状，从而了解病属于那一经脉。如在没有发作以前约一顿饭的时候就给以针刺，刺一次病势衰减，刺二次病就显著好转，刺三次病即痊愈；如不愈，可刺舌下两脉出血；如再不愈，可取委中血盛的经络，刺出其血，并刺项部以下挟脊两旁的经穴，这样，病一定会痊愈。上面所说的舌下两脉，就是指的廉泉穴。"}]},{"ID":"20231128155213-4h3cmqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128155213-4h3cmqb","updated":"20231129161948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"322、  凡刺疟疾，必先问明病人发作时最先感觉症状的部位，给以先刺。如先发头痛头重的，就先刺头上及两额、两眉间出血。先发倾项眷背痛的，就先刺颈项和背部。先发腰脊痛的，就先刺委中出血。先发手臂痛的，就先刺手少阴、手阳明的十指见的孔穴。先发足胫疲痛的，就先刺足阳明十趾间出血。"}]},{"ID":"20231128153253-dd74j1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128153253-dd74j1e","updated":"20231129162046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"323、一般来说，再井穴放血治疟的时候，阴经井穴不放，大部分放阳经井穴；"}]},{"ID":"20231128160458-vfq93wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128160458-vfq93wj","updated":"20231129162046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"324、厥：达到极点；"}]},{"ID":"20231128162619-3t3zizq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128162619-3t3zizq","updated":"20231129162045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★325、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒的移转：肾移寒于肝，痈肿少气。脾移寒于肝，痈肿筋挛。肝移寒于心，狂隔中。心移寒于肺，肺消，肺消者饮一溲二，死不治。肺移寒于肾，为涌水，涌水者，按腹不坚，水气客于大肠，疾行则鸣濯濯如囊裹浆，水之病也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231128162703-sujz89r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128162703-sujz89r","updated":"20231129162041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"325.1、肾的寒会移到肝脏去，肝的寒会移到心脏去，心的寒则不是移至脾脏而是移至肺脏去，肺的寒会移到肾脏；当脾脏有寒时，脾的寒会移入肝脏；"}]},{"ID":"20231128164534-kmzk7ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128164534-kmzk7ue","updated":"20231128164551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 186px;","style":"width: 176px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231128164534-t249p8y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 176px;\" parent-style=\"width: 186px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（移转路线）"}]},{"ID":"20231206113458-6idpi93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206113458-6idpi93","updated":"20231206113621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"325.3、很多止痛药会伤到肾，肾寒就会移转导致肝寒（西医不懂寒热，制造出来基本就是寒药）；"}]},{"ID":"20231128164458-gazjy31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128164458-gazjy31","updated":"20231129162039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"325.2、肾脏的寒进入肝脏时，会化脓发肿，病人会短气，呼吸很短；脾脏的寒进入肝脏时，肝会痈肿，病人会有抽筋的现象；肝脏的寒进入心脏时，就会造成发狂神乱，吃不下东西；心的寒进入肺里时，肺阳会消损（肺消：津液进不了肺），喝一碗水，小便排两碗水的量，属于无法治疗的死症；肺移寒于肾，则为涌水；涌水病的症状是腹部按之不甚坚硬，但因水气留居于大肠，故快走时肠中濯濯鸣响，如皮囊装水样，这是水气之病。"}]},{"ID":"20231128165103-dljeet3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128165103-dljeet3","updated":"20231129162037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★326、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"热的移转：脾移热于肝，则为惊衄。肝移热于心，则死。心移热于肺，传为鬲消。肺移热于肾，传为柔痓。肾移热于脾，传为虚，肠澼，死，不可治。胞移热于膀胱，则癃溺血。膀胱移热于小肠，鬲肠不便，上为口糜。小肠移热于大肠，为虙瘕，为沉。大肠移热于胃，善食而瘦入，谓之食亦。胃移热于胆，亦曰食亦。胆移热于脑，则辛渊，鼻渊者，浊涕不下止也，传为衄蔑瞑目。故得之气厥也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231128171145-yhui2b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128171145-yhui2b3","updated":"20231129162036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"326.1、脾脏的热会移到肝脏去，会造成病人受惊流鼻血；肝的热会移到心脏去，如此就是死症；心的热会移到肺脏去，就会中鬲过热造成消渴而多饮（消渴）；肺的热会移到肾脏，人就会筋软无力；肾的热会移到脾脏去，胃气虚，肠澼下痢，不可治的死症；"}]},{"ID":"20231128173741-8hmntzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128173741-8hmntzt","updated":"20231129162034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"326.2、胞位于膀胱与小肠之间，小肠是火膀胱是水，男人胞就是生精的地方，女子胞就是子宫卵巢；"}]},{"ID":"20231128174030-6bjd0du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128174030-6bjd0du","updated":"20231129162027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"326.3、胞的热移入了膀胱（代表小肠火温度不够），这时小便会小便不利和尿血（原因小肠不够热，正常尿液气化膀胱膨胀，尿液有足够压力喷出；精宫的血也是靠小肠热蒸化成白色的精液）；"}]},{"ID":"20231128174820-eef6bfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128174820-eef6bfz","updated":"20231129162026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"326.4、膀胱移热于小肠，使肠道隔塞，大便不通，热气上行，以至口舌糜烂（大便不通，沼气上逆导致的口舌糜烂）。小肠移热于大肠，则热结不散，成为伏瘕，或为痔疮。大肠移热于胃，则使人饮食增加而体瘦无力，病称为食亦。胃移热于胆，也叫做食亦。胆移热于脑，则鼻梁内感觉辛辣而成为鼻渊，鼻渊症状，是常鼻流浊涕不止，日久可致鼻中流血，两目不明。以上各种病症，皆由于寒热之气厥逆，在脏腑中互相移传而引起。"}]},{"ID":"20231128173137-pcvu4kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128173137-pcvu4kx","updated":"20231128173137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231128173137-3am3tie.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231128172351-zesl17z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128172351-zesl17z","updated":"20231129162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"327、五脏六腑都会让人咳嗽，不单单是肺；"}]},{"ID":"20231128170104-pyzny5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231128170104-pyzny5c","updated":"20231129162023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"327.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏咳：肺咳的症状，咳而气喘，呼吸有声，甚至唾血；心咳的症状，咳则心痛，喉中好象有东西梗塞一样，甚至咽喉肿痛闭塞；肝咳的症状，咳则两侧胁肋下疼痛，甚至痛得不能转侧，转侧则两胁下胀满；脾咳的症状，咳则右胁下疼痛，并隐隐然疼痛牵引肩背，甚至不可以动，一动就会使咳嗽加剧；肾咳的症状，咳则腰背互相牵引作痛，甚至咳吐痰涎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231129104622-cqqetsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129104622-cqqetsi","updated":"20231129162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"327.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏咳嗽日久不愈，就要传移于六腑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六腑咳：例如脾咳不愈，则胃就受病；胃咳的症状，咳而呕吐，甚至呕出蛔虫；肝咳不愈，则胆就受病，胆咳的症状是咳而呕吐胆汁；肺咳不愈，则大肠受病，大肠咳的症状，咳而大便失禁；心咳不愈，则小肠受病，小肠咳的症状是咳而放屁，而且往往是咳嗽与失气同时出现；肾咳不愈，则膀胱受病；膀胱咳的症状，咳而遗尿；以上各种咳嗽，如经久不愈，则使三焦受病，三焦咳的症状，咳而腹满，不想饮食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231129105828-gt6xfhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129105828-gt6xfhk","updated":"20231129162020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"327.3、治疗的方法怎样？治五脏的咳，取其俞穴；治六腑的咳，取其合穴；凡咳而浮肿的，可取有关脏腑的经穴而分治之。"}]},{"ID":"20231129104315-0p2r49m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129104315-0p2r49m","updated":"20231207161553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"328、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四海：脑部是髓海（上俞百会，下俞风府）；喉项部是气之海（上俞天柱、下俞人迎）；胃部是水谷之海（上俞气街、下俞足三里）；小肠部位十二经之海（冲脉主血，上俞大抒，下俞巨虚，上巨虚、下巨虚、上廉泉、下廉泉）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231129105350-9c6tnc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129105350-9c6tnc9","updated":"20231129162120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"329、五脏突然作痛，是什么致使的？岐伯说：人身经脉中的气血，周流全身，循环不息，寒气侵入经脉，经血就会留滞，凝涩而不畅通。如果寒邪侵袭在经脉之外，血液必然会减少；若侵入脉中，则脉气不通，就会突然作痛。"}]},{"ID":"20231129162400-x4lu8x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129162400-x4lu8x7","updated":"20231129162448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"330、黄帝道：有的痛忽然自止；有的剧痛却不能止；有的痛得很厉害，甚至不能揉按；有的当揉按后痛就可止住；有的虽加揉按，亦无效果；有的痛处跳动应手；有的在痛时心与背相牵引作痛；有的胁肋和少腹牵引作痛；有的腹痛牵引大腿内侧，有疼痛日久不愈而成小肠气积的；有突然剧痛，就像死人一样，不省人事，少停片刻，才能苏醒；有又痛又呕吐的；有腹痛而又泄泻的；有痛而胸闷不顺畅的。所有这些疼痛，表现各不相同，如何加以区别呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231129162402-aedwkg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129162402-aedwkg1","updated":"20231129162454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"330.1、详见举痛论；"}]},{"ID":"20231129162454-wmuatp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129162454-wmuatp1","updated":"20231129165329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"331、三焦生于气海；"}]},{"ID":"20231129165330-9lj9w65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129165330-9lj9w65","updated":"20231129171208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"332、寒气客于小肠膜原之间，络血之中，血泣不得注于大经，血气稽留不得行，故宿昔而成积矣。（肿瘤的由来）"}]},{"ID":"20231129171150-9ndu9tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129171150-9ndu9tx","updated":"20231129171220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"332.1、膜原就是三焦油网；"}]},{"ID":"20231129171220-cvk3t92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129171220-cvk3t92","updated":"20231129171307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"333、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么知道小肠是冷还是热？摸脚底板，脚底板热则小肠热，脚底板冷则小肠冷；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231129171301-0h0ifi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129171301-0h0ifi0","updated":"20231129171453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"334、寒气客于五藏，厥逆上泄，阴气竭，阳气未入，故卒然痛死不知人，气复反则生矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231129171454-93ct249","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129171454-93ct249","updated":"20231130085321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"334.1、寒气侵入到五脏，则厥逆之气向上散发，阴气衰竭，阳气郁遏不通，所以会忽然痛死，不省人事；等阳气恢复，昏死过去的人就又苏醒了。（寒将五脏束缚住，导致阳气无法进入五脏，造成人暂时昏厥）"}]},{"ID":"20231129171526-xhxavyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231129171526-xhxavyd","updated":"20231130090012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"335、寒气客于肠胃，厥逆上出，故痛而呕也。（病人吐并不代表就是热症，很有可能是寒症，用热药对治）"}]},{"ID":"20231130090013-urwnban","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130090013-urwnban","updated":"20231130090152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"336、寒气客于小肠，小肠不得成聚，故后泄腹痛矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231130090424-f1xtw32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130090424-f1xtw32","updated":"20231130090447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"337、热气留于小肠，肠中痛，瘅热焦喝，则坚干不得出，故痛而闭不通矣。（久劳，小肠过热导致的腹痛）"}]},{"ID":"20231130093135-ew45l8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130093135-ew45l8o","updated":"20231130093137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"338、暴怒则气上逆，大喜则气缓散，悲哀则气消散，恐惧则气下陷，遇寒则气收聚，受热则气外泄，过惊则气混乱，过劳则气耗损，思虑则气郁结，这九样气的变化，各不相同，各又导致什么病呢？岐伯说：大怒则气上逆，严重的，可以引起呕血和飨泄，所以说是“气逆”。高兴气就和顺，营卫之气通利，所以说是“气缓”。悲哀过甚则心系急，肺叶胀起，上焦不通，营卫之气不散，热气郁结在内，所以说是“气消”。恐惧就会使精气衰退，精气衰退就要使上焦闭塞，上焦不通，还于下焦，气郁下焦，就会胀满，所以说是“气下”。寒冷之气，能使腠理闭塞，营卫之气不得流行，所以说是“气收”。热则腠理开发，营卫之气过于疏泄，汗大出，所以说是“气泄”。过忧则心悸如无依靠，神气无所归宿，心中疑虑不定，所以说是“气乱”。过劳则喘息汗出，里外都越发消耗，因此说是“气耗”。思虑太多心就要受伤，精神呆滞，气就会凝滞而不能运行，因此说是“气结”。"}]},{"ID":"20231130112203-sjmo52o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130112203-sjmo52o","updated":"20231130155930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★340、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：有一种心腹胀满的病，早晨吃了饭晚上就不能再吃，这是什么病呢？岐伯回答说：这叫鼓胀病。黄帝说：如何治疗呢？岐伯说：可用鸡矢醴来治疗，一剂就能见效，两剂病就好了。 (如复发，说明不注意饮食)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130114034-8lreb41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130114034-8lreb41","updated":"20231130155510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"340.1、①鼓胀：是一种以腹部胀大如鼓，皮色萎黄，脉络显露为特征的疾病。现在把肝硬化腹水后期归为这类疾病。②鸡矢醴：矢，即鸡屎白。鸡矢醴，古人用来治疗鼓胀的一种药酒名。"}]},{"ID":"20231130113100-djscpeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130113100-djscpeb","updated":"20231130154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"340.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五畜中（鸡马牛犬猪），鸡为木（成语：呆若木鸡）， 鸡吃虫会连带土吃进去，排出来的大便一块有部分白色的，这是吃进去的土，白色的部分可以用药，黄色的部分没用；晒干打粉；（饲料鸡矢无用，要家鸡或山里的鸡）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130113809-tq7rufc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130113809-tq7rufc","updated":"20231130154853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"340.3、鸡矢醴：鸡矢跟米酒或甜酒煮在一起；"}]},{"ID":"20231130113934-odeztv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130113934-odeztv6","updated":"20231130155225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"341、有钱时哪怕各方各面奢侈都没关系，吃这方面，一定要简单。——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231130155225-4wiu27w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130155225-4wiu27w","updated":"20231130155934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★342、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：有一种胸胁胀满的病，妨碍饮食，发病时先闻到腥臊的气味，鼻流清涕，先唾血，四肢清冷，头目眩晕，时常大小便出血，这种病叫什么名字？是什么原因引起的？岐伯说：这种病的名字叫血枯，得病的原因是在少年的时候患过大的失血病，使内脏有所损伤，或者是醉后肆行房事，使肾气竭，肝血伤，所以月经闭止而不来。黄帝说：怎样治疗呢？要用什么方法使其恢复？岐伯说：用四份乌贼骨，一份藘茹，二药混合，以雀卵为丸，制成如小豆大的丸药，每次服五丸，饭前服药，饮以鲍鱼汁。这个方法可以通利肠道，补益损伤的肝脏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130113741-blfrtx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130113741-blfrtx7","updated":"20231130160012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"342.1、乌鲗骨：即乌贼骨，又叫海螵蛸；藘茹：茜草；雀卵：麻雀卵或鸽子卵；"}]},{"ID":"20231130155819-cz1g3tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130155819-cz1g3tn","updated":"20231130155848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"343、喝醉时禁止行房，否则气会衰竭，伤肝伤肾；"}]},{"ID":"20231130155850-iypbczq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130155850-iypbczq","updated":"20231130161934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★344、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：有种病少腹坚硬盛满，上下左右都有根蒂，这是什么病呢？可以治疗吗？岐伯说：病名叫伏梁。黄帝说：伏梁病是什么原因引起的？岐伯说：小腹部里藏着大量脓血，居于肠胃之外，不可能治愈的。在诊治时，不宜重按，每因重按而致死。黄帝说：为什么会这样呢？岐伯说：此下为小腹及二阴，按摩则使脓血下出；此上是胃脘部，按摩则上迫胃脘，能使横膈与胃脘之间发生内痈，此为根深蒂固的久病，故难治疗。一般地说，这种病生在脐上的为逆症，生在脐下的为顺症，切不可急切按摩，以使其下夺。关于本病的治法，在《刺法》中有所论述。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130161204-zfk5748","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130161204-zfk5748","updated":"20231130161851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"344.1、伏梁：胆堵塞或盲肠堵塞很久，最终破掉了，爆开的胆汁或脓血就会被三焦油网包住（腹膜炎）；黄帝内经讲很难治愈，肚脐以上难治，肚脐以下易治，张仲景解决了这个问题；"}]},{"ID":"20231130161935-84p33ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130161935-84p33ir","updated":"20231130162358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"345、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：有人身体髀、股、骨行等部位都发肿，且环绕脐部疼痛，这是什么病呢？岐伯说：病的名字叫伏梁，这是由于宿受风寒所致。风寒之气充溢于大肠而留着于肓，肓的根源在脐下气海，所以绕脐而痛。这种病不可以动作，动作就会出现小便不利的现象。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（破出的脓血如果散开堵住尿管，就会导致小便不利）"}]},{"ID":"20231130161939-hy9v3ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130161939-hy9v3ci","updated":"20231130162523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"346、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：先生屡次说患热中、消中病的，不能吃肥甘厚味，也不能吃芳香药草和金石药，因为金石药物能使人发癫，芳草药物能使人发狂。患热中、消中病的，都是富贵之人，现在如禁止他们吃肥甘厚味，则不适合他们的心理，不使用芳草石药，又治不好他们的病，这种情况如何处理呢？我愿意听听你的意见。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：芳草之气多香窜，石药之气多猛悍，这两类药物的性能都是疾坚劲的，若非性情和缓的人，不可以服用这两类药物。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：不可以服用这两类药物，是什么道理呢？岐伯说：因为这种人平素嗜食肥甘而生内热，热气本身是剽悍的，药物的性能也是这样，两者遇在一起，恐怕会损伤人的脾气，脾属土而恶木，所以服用这类药物，在甲日和乙日肝木主令时，病情就会更加严重。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130162414-gdafh28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130162414-gdafh28","updated":"20231130162830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"346.1、治疗热中、消中病，服药时要心平气和，古井不波的人才可以吃芳草和石药，否则禁用；"}]},{"ID":"20231130163014-fwrjp2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130163014-fwrjp2l","updated":"20231130163913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"347、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：好。有人患膺肿颈痛，胸满腹胀，这是什么病呢？是什么原因引起的？岐伯说：病名叫厥逆。黄帝说：怎样治疗呢？岐伯说：这种病如果用灸法便会失音，用针刺就会发狂，必须等到阴阳之气上下相合，才能进行治疗。黄帝说：为什么呢？岐伯说：上本为阳，阳气又逆于上，重阳在上，则有余于上，若再用灸法，是以火济火，阳极乘阴，阴不能上承，故发生失音；若用砭石针刺，阳气随刺外泄则虚，神失其守，故发生神志失常的狂症；必须在阳气从上下降，阴气从下上升，阴阳二气交并以后再进行治疗，才可以获得痊愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231130163902-dnk1ff1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130163902-dnk1ff1","updated":"20231130165538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"347.1、可以用药方让阴阳和，当病气盛用要攻可能造成正气虚；可以喝稀饭（五脏六腑皆受气于胃，暖胃气从而生五脏之气）；"}]},{"ID":"20231130165657-n9r9z70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130165657-n9r9z70","updated":"20231130165815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"347.2、正常情况阳在上往下走，阴在下往上走，现在阴阳不合，阴阳厥逆，导致重阳或重阴，所以就会灸法失声，针刺发狂；"}]},{"ID":"20231130164041-8e30vs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130164041-8e30vs4","updated":"20231130164055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"348、厥逆：跟常态相反，反着走就是厥逆；"}]},{"ID":"20231130165655-yiff28z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231130165655-yiff28z","updated":"20231201103820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"349、阳病治阴，阴病治阳，左病治右，右病治左；"}]},{"ID":"20231201103820-e7dkoo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231201103820-e7dkoo8","updated":"20231201104200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"350、腰背委中求；(腰背痛，大多可以在委中上面找到地方放血)"}]},{"ID":"20231201104131-3sx239b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231201104131-3sx239b","updated":"20231201104201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"351、治疗腰痛没一个失手，只有一种情况失手，病人开过刀——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231201104153-74k9bjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231201104153-74k9bjs","updated":"20231201104810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"352、腰痛：看到淤血放掉，没有淤血，找委中、阴谷穴及阴谷穴周边的压痛点下针；"}]},{"ID":"20231201104840-353f5vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231201104840-353f5vn","updated":"20231201104931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"353、风为百病之始；"}]},{"ID":"20231206095716-2y6bi9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206095716-2y6bi9m","updated":"20231206095721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"353.1、风气循风府而上，则为脑风；风入系头，则为目风，眼寒；饮酒中风，则为漏风；入房汗出中风，则为内风；新沐中风，则为首风；久风入中，则为肠风飧泄；外在腠理，则为泄风。故风者百病之长也，至其变化，乃为他病也，无常方，然致有风气也。"}]},{"ID":"20231201104931-x8n8my5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231201104931-x8n8my5","updated":"20231206092803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"354、寒则衰饮食，热则消肌肉；"}]},{"ID":"20231206092804-c8em6wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206092804-c8em6wt","updated":"20231206092859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"355、风气藏于皮肤之间，内不得通，外不得泄；风者，善行而数变，腠理开则洒然寒，闭则热而闷，其寒也则衰食饮，其热也则消肌肉，故使人怢慄而不能食，名曰寒热。（怢慄：颤栗、抖动）"}]},{"ID":"20231206092831-wmwfwqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206092831-wmwfwqs","updated":"20231206093126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"356、祛风、驱寒、祛热的药不是一回事；"}]},{"ID":"20231206093126-yxr4vyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206093126-yxr4vyu","updated":"20231206093433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"357、疬病：麻风病（是一种风症，鼻梁部位坏掉、皮肤溃烂，风症的寒热混杂在一起导致）；"}]},{"ID":"20231206093453-vej1dzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206093453-vej1dzt","updated":"20231206093540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"358、当诊断病人有寒热病时，开寒药跟热药混合在一起的方是不会有冲突的；"}]},{"ID":"20231206093609-hqsgcrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206093609-hqsgcrf","updated":"20231206094119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"359、风中五藏六府之俞，亦为藏府之风，各入其门户所中，则为偏风。"}]},{"ID":"20231206094124-0djrayt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206094124-0djrayt","updated":"20231206094129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"359.1、风邪侵入五脏六腑的腧穴，沿经内传，也可成为五脏六腑的风病。腧穴是机体与外界相通的门户，若风邪从其血气衰弱场所入侵，或左或右；偏着于一处，则成为偏风病。"}]},{"ID":"20231206094130-f66yy1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206094130-f66yy1d","updated":"20231206094135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"360、"}]},{"ID":"20231206100130-blemjhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100130-blemjhn","updated":"20231206100214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寸\t\t关\t\t尺"}]},{"ID":"20231206100138-i5221mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100138-i5221mg","updated":"20240220170140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳\t\t\t\t阴"}]},{"ID":"20231206100143-q1nivml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100143-q1nivml","updated":"20231206100217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸\t\t横隔\t\t腹"}]},{"ID":"20231206100209-r6qxwpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100209-r6qxwpp","updated":"20231206100622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"361、五脏风症的临床表现有何不同？"}]},{"ID":"20231206100623-mxptjen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100623-mxptjen","updated":"20231206102228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺风的症状，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多汗恶风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，面色淡白，不时咳嗽气短，白天减轻，傍晚加重，诊察时要注意眉上部位，往往眉间可出现白色。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100635-5vr9jja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100635-5vr9jja","updated":"20231206102230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心风的症状，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多汗恶风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，唇舌焦燥，容易发怒，面色发红，病重则言语謇涩，诊察时要注意舌部，往往舌质可呈现红色。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100621-geyln4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100621-geyln4k","updated":"20231206102231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝风的症状，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多汗恶风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，常悲伤，面色微青，咽喉干燥，易发怒，有时厌恶女性，诊察时要注意目下，往往眼圈可发青色。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100651-1tffmvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100651-1tffmvc","updated":"20231206102232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾风的症状，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多汗恶风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，身体疲倦，四肢懒于活动，面色微微发黄，食欲不振，诊察时要注意鼻尖部，往往鼻尖可出现黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100701-sd3x3qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100701-sd3x3qe","updated":"20231206102806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾风的症状，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"多汗恶风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，颜面疵然而肿，腰脊痛不能直立，面色黑如煤烟灰，小便不利（或男女人房事不利），诊察时要注意颐部，往往颐部可出现黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100711-9hqb4fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100711-9hqb4fn","updated":"20231206100724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃风的症状，是颈部多汗，恶风，吞咽饮食困难，隔塞不通，腹部易胀满，如少穿衣，腹即膜胀，如吃了寒凉的食物，就发生泄泻，诊察时可见形体瘦削而腹部胀大。"}]},{"ID":"20231206102849-50v6b2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206102849-50v6b2r","updated":"20231206102905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"首风的症状，是头痛，面部多汗，恶风，每当起风的前一日病情就加重，以至头痛得不敢离开室内，待到起风的当日，则痛热稍轻。"}]},{"ID":"20231206102851-o8w34vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206102851-o8w34vr","updated":"20231206102906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漏风的症状，是汗多，不能少穿衣服，进食即汗出，甚至是自汗出，喘息恶风，衣服常被汗浸湿，口干易渴，不耐劳动。"}]},{"ID":"20231206102858-w9uqnkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206102858-w9uqnkz","updated":"20231206102907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"泄风的症状，是多汗，汗出湿衣，口中干燥，上半身汗出如水渍一样，不耐劳动，周身疼痛发冷。"}]},{"ID":"20231206100724-gokmel3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206100724-gokmel3","updated":"20231206101830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"362、老人家眉毛长、耳朵里面长毛，都是长寿的象征；（年轻人耳朵里面长毛，属于凶恶之徒）——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231206101758-tq90qok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206101758-tq90qok","updated":"20231206110133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"363、中风，全身都痛，说明属风寒，要加驱寒的药；"}]},{"ID":"20231206110133-767cya7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206110133-767cya7","updated":"20231206114139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"364、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"痹病是由"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"风、寒、湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三种邪气杂合伤人而形成痹病。其中风邪偏胜的叫行痹，寒邪偏胜的叫痛痹，湿邪偏胜的叫著痹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231206110424-4o0bv6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206110424-4o0bv6k","updated":"20231206113206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"364.1、行痹：今天这儿痛，明天那儿痛，痛的地方会移走，这种就叫做行痹，风邪较强导致的；"}]},{"ID":"20231206110553-7ob3ieh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206110553-7ob3ieh","updated":"20231206113016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"364.2、痛痹：痛的时候痛的很严重，有时候痛感会消失，这叫就叫做痛痹，寒邪较强导致的；（如痛风，看起来红肿热，实则寒邪要用热药）"}]},{"ID":"20231206110705-ohty5g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206110705-ohty5g3","updated":"20231206113208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"364.3、著痹：痛感不会消失，如一直痛在某个关节，；"}]},{"ID":"20231206110115-46pstfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206110115-46pstfe","updated":"20231206114316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"365、黄帝问道：痹病又可分为五种，请问是哪五种？岐伯说：在冬天得病的称为骨痹，在春天得病的称为筋痹，在夏天得病的称为脉痹，在长夏得病的称为肌痹，在秋天得病的称为皮痹。"}]},{"ID":"20231206114017-qodqbol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206114017-qodqbol","updated":"20231206114027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"365.1、黄帝问道：痹病的病邪又有内侵而累及五脏六腑的，是什么道理？岐伯说：五脏都有与其相合的组织器官，若病邪久留不除，就会内犯于相合的内脏。所以，骨痹不愈，再感受邪气，就会内舍于肾；筋痹不愈，再感受邪气，就会内舍于肝；脉痹不愈，再感受邪气，就会内舍于心；肌痹不愈，再感受邪气，就会内舍于脾；皮痹不愈，再感受邪气，就会内舍于肺。总之，这些痹症是各脏在所主季节里重复感受了风、寒、湿气所造成的。"}]},{"ID":"20231206114141-xvsfub0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206114141-xvsfub0","updated":"20231206153829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"365.2、凡痹病侵入到五脏（可理解风湿入五脏），症状各有不同：肺痹的症状是烦闷胀满，喘逆呕吐，心痹的症状是血脉不通畅，烦躁则心悸，突然气逆上壅而喘息，咽干，易嗳气，厥逆气上则引起恐惧。肝痹的症状是夜眠多惊，饮水多而小便频数，疼痛循肝经由上而下牵引少腹如怀孕之状。肾痹的症状是腹部易作胀，骨萎而足不能行，行步时臀部着地，脊柱曲屈畸形，高耸过头。脾痹的症状是四肢倦怠无力，咳嗽，呕吐清水，上腹部阻塞不通。肠痹的症状是频频饮水而小便困难，腹中肠鸣，时而发生完谷不化的泄泻。膀胱痹的症状是少腹膀胱部位按之疼痛，如同灌了热水似的，小便涩滞不爽，上部鼻流清涕。"}]},{"ID":"20231206114318-l1melbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206114318-l1melbv","updated":"20231206154759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"365.3、阴气者，静则神藏，躁则消亡，饮食自倍，肠胃乃伤。"}]},{"ID":"20231206154800-dv95s2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206154800-dv95s2k","updated":"20231206154809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"365.1、五脏精气，安静则精神内守，躁动则易于耗散。若饮食过量，肠胃就要受损。"}]},{"ID":"20231206154754-3zsjmhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206154754-3zsjmhf","updated":"20231206154929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"366、淫气喘息，痹聚在肺；淫气忧思，痹聚在心；淫气遗溺，痹聚在肾；淫气乏竭，痹聚在肝；淫气肌绝，痹聚在脾。"}]},{"ID":"20231206154930-u71jvp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206154930-u71jvp5","updated":"20231206154939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"366.1、致痹之邪引起呼吸喘促，是痹发生在肺；致痹之邪引起忧伤思虑，是痹发生在心；致痹之邪引起遗尿，是痹发生在肾；致痹之邪引起疲乏衰竭，是痹发生在肝；致痹之邪引起肌肉瘦削，是痹发生在脾。总之，各种痹病日久不愈，病变就会进一步向内深入。其中风邪偏盛的容易痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20231206155504-c6wl8qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206155504-c6wl8qi","updated":"20231206155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"367、帝曰：其客于六府者何也？岐伯曰：此亦其食饮居处，为其病本也。六府亦各有俞，风寒湿气中其俞，而食饮应之，循俞而入，各舍其府也。帝曰：以针治之奈何？岐伯曰：五藏有俞，六府有合，循脉之分，各有所发，各随其过，则病瘳也。"}]},{"ID":"20231206155515-19df91h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206155515-19df91h","updated":"20231206155530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"367.1、黄帝问道：痹邪侵犯六腑是何原因？岐伯说：这也是以饮食不节、起居失度而导致腑痹的根本原因。六腑也各有腧穴，风寒湿邪在外侵及它的腧穴，而内有饮食所伤的病理基础与之相应，于是病邪就循着腧穴入里，留滞在相应的腑。黄帝问道：怎样用针刺治疗呢？岐伯说：五脏各有输穴可取，六腑各有合穴可取，循着经脉所行的部位，各有发病的征兆可察，根据病邪所在的部位，取相应的输穴或合穴进行针刺，病就可以痊愈了。"}]},{"ID":"20231206155804-w4n45ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206155804-w4n45ai","updated":"20231206155807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"368、黄帝问道：营卫之气亦能使人发生痹病吗？岐伯说：营是水谷所化生的精气，它平和协调地运行于五脏，散布于六腑，然后汇入脉中，所以营气循着经脉上下运行，起到连贯五脏，联络六腑的作用。卫是水谷所化生的悍气，它流动迅疾而滑利，不能进入脉中，所以循行于皮肤肌肉之间，熏蒸于肓膜之间，敷布于胸腹之内。若营卫之气的循行逆乱，就会生病，只要营卫之气顺从调和了，病就会痊愈。总的来说，营卫之气若不与风寒湿邪相合，则不会引起痹病。黄帝说：讲得好！"}]},{"ID":"20231206155808-tvihg6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206155808-tvihg6x","updated":"20231206155930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"369、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"痹病，有的疼痛，有的不痛，有的麻木不仁，有的表现为寒，有的表现为热，有的皮肤干燥，有的皮肤湿润，这是什么缘故？岐伯说：痛是寒气偏多，有寒所以才痛。不痛而麻木不仁的，系患病日久，病邪深入，营卫之气运行涩滞，致使经络中气血空虚，所以不痛；皮肤得不到营养，所以麻木不仁。表现为寒象的，是由于机体阳气不足，阴气偏盛，阴气助长寒邪之势，所以表现为寒象。表现为热象的，是由于机体阳气偏盛，阴气不足，偏胜的阳气与偏胜的风邪相合而乘阴分，所以出现热象。多汗而皮肤湿润的，是由于感受湿邪太甚，加之机体阳气不足，阴气偏盛，湿邪与偏盛的阴气相合，所以汗出而皮肤湿润。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231206160544-ur218py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206160544-ur218py","updated":"20231206160554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：痹病而不甚疼痛的是什么缘故？岐伯说：痹发生在骨则身重；发生在脉则血凝涩而不畅；发生在筋则屈曲不能伸；发生在肌肉则麻木不仁；发生在皮肤则寒冷。如果有这五种情况，就不甚疼痛。凡痹病一类疾患，遇寒则筋脉拘急，遇热则筋脉弛缓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231206155920-m613y58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206155920-m613y58","updated":"20231206160201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"370、流汗摸上去皮肤湿答答黏黏的，说明有痹，此人湿气重；"}]},{"ID":"20231206160202-c808ync","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206160202-c808ync","updated":"20231206162111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"371、如膝盖不行，针灸吃药都无效，说明病人筋萎了，肝有问题了；"}]},{"ID":"20231206162053-3waxzm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206162053-3waxzm5","updated":"20231206163438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"372、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨之所以有力量，是因为里面有髓，里面的髓没有或不够的时候，人没有办法久站；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231206163102-s1po5mu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206163102-s1po5mu","updated":"20231206163636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"373、痿症是怎样引起的？岐伯说：肺是诸脏之长，又是心脏的华盖。遇有失意的事情，或个人要求得不到满足，则使肺气郁而不畅，于是出现喘息有声，进而则气郁化热，使肺叶枯焦，精气因此而不能敷布于周身，五脏都是因肺热叶焦得不到营养而发生痿躄的，说的就是这个道理。"}]},{"ID":"20231206163638-8on3ejk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206163638-8on3ejk","updated":"20231206163731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"373.1、所以痿症之死，死源于肺；"}]},{"ID":"20231206165811-c1qu26b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206165811-c1qu26b","updated":"20231206165822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"373.2、热，才会产生痿；"}]},{"ID":"20231206163732-1293e5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206163732-1293e5e","updated":"20231206164723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"374、悲哀太甚，则胞络绝，胞络绝，则阳气内动，发则心下崩,数溲血也。"}]},{"ID":"20231206164003-kciv7n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206164003-kciv7n6","updated":"20231206164719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"374.1、如果悲哀过度，就会因气机郁结而使心包络隔绝不通，心包络隔绝不通则导致阳气在内妄动，逼迫心血下崩，于是屡次小便出血。"}]},{"ID":"20231206163105-0prht6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206163105-0prht6j","updated":"20231206165321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"375、湿，伤于下；"}]},{"ID":"20231206170755-75rmrn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206170755-75rmrn8","updated":"20231206171033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"376、肺热者色白而毛败，心热者色赤而络脉溢，肝热者色苍而爪枯，脾热者色黄而肉蠕动；肾热者色黑而齿槁。"}]},{"ID":"20231206171034-tmtx0f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171034-tmtx0f0","updated":"20231206171121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"377、论言治痿者独取阳明，何也？岐伯曰：阳明者，五藏六府之海，主润宗筋，宗筋主骨而利机关也。冲脉者，经脉之海也，主渗灌谿谷，与阳明合于宗筋，阴阳揔宗筋之会，会于气街，而阳明为之长，皆属于带脉 ，而络于督脉。故阳明虚则宗筋纵，带脉不引，故足痿不用也。"}]},{"ID":"20231206171122-nshf4em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171122-nshf4em","updated":"20231206171134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"377.1、治痿应独取阳明，这是什么道理呢？岐伯说：阳明是五脏六腑营养的源泉，能濡养宗筋，宗筋主管约束骨节，使关节运动灵活。冲脉为十二经气血会聚之处，输送气血以渗透灌溉分肉肌腠，与足阳明经会合于宗筋，阴经阳经都总会于宗筋，再会合于足阳明经的气衔穴，故阳明经是它们的统领，诸经又都连属于带脉，系络于督脉。所以阳明经气血不足则宗筋失养而弛缓，带脉也不能收引诸脉，就使两足痿弱不用了。"}]},{"ID":"20231206171135-41brtce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171135-41brtce","updated":"20231206171148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"377.2、如何治疗？岐伯说：调补各经的荥穴，疏通各经的输穴，以调机体之虚实和气血之逆顺；无论筋脉骨肉的病变，只要在其所合之脏当旺的月份进行治疗，病就会痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20231206171505-6tzrzft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171505-6tzrzft","updated":"20231206172153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"377.3、气街：足三里沿胃经上去，这一段称之为气街，会于关元（阳明气最旺盛的地方）；该位置属于宗筋之府，所以阳明虚会影响到宗筋；"}]},{"ID":"20231206171641-7sp0js0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171641-7sp0js0","updated":"20231206171641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231206171641-6ir2o1l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231206171643-jabjf95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206171643-jabjf95","updated":"20231207101033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"378、人体最深的一个脏：肝；足厥阴肝经，就是极点，到最里了，厥就是极限的意思；"}]},{"ID":"20231207110500-l1m636v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207110500-l1m636v","updated":"20231207110642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"379、热阙，一定是由于经常醉酒，饱食后行房，肾气虚，命门无气以滋阳脾造成的；热盛伤阴，导致热阙； "}]},{"ID":"20231207152402-q1kyk1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207152402-q1kyk1f","updated":"20231207152431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"380、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六经厥病病症：太阳经患厥病，令人感觉头脚都沉重，足不能行，眼花昏乱。阳明经患厥病，就会发为癫疾，令人狂走叫呼，腹满，不能卧下，卧下就面红发热，看到稀奇古怪的东西，胡言乱语。少阳经患厥病，令人突然耳聋，颊部肿，胸部发热，两胁疼痛，大腿不能行动。太阴经患厥病，令人肚腹胀满，大便不爽，不思饮食，吃了就呕吐，不能安卧。少阴经患厥病，令人舌干，小便赤，腹满，心痛。厥阴经患厥病，令人小腹肿痛，腹胀，小便不利，睡眠喜欢蜷腿，前阴萎缩，足胫内侧发热。治疗以上厥病，身体强壮的就用泄法，虚弱的就用补法，如既不强壮又不虚弱的，就刺所患病的本经主穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231207152432-kqzdk1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207152432-kqzdk1w","updated":"20231207153039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"381、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六经厥逆：足太阴经厥逆，则小腿拘挛，心痛连及腹部，要治它主病之经。足少阴经厥逆，则腹部虚满、呕逆、下泄清水，要治它主病之经。足厥阴经厥逆，则筋挛、腰痛，小便不通，胡言乱语，要治它主病之经。如太阴、少阴、厥阴同时厥逆，人会大小便不通，且手足逆冷，上至肘膝，三天后人就会死亡。足太阳经厥逆，则昏倒、经常鼻出血，要治它主病之经。足少阳经厥逆，则筋骨关节不灵活，腰部难以动弹，脖项拘禁，如若兼发肠痈，就难以治疗，如再受惊，人就会死亡。足阳明经厥逆，则喘促咳嗽，身发热，容易惊恐，鼻出血、呕血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231207155309-ug132e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207155309-ug132e1","updated":"20231207155320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"381.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"手太阴经厥逆，则胸腹虚满，咳嗽，常常呕出痰水，要治它主病之经。手心包络和手少阴心经厥逆，则心痛连及咽喉，如果身体发热，人就会死，不能治。手太阳经厥逆，则耳聋，眼睛流泪，头颈不能回顾，腰不能俯仰，要治它主病之经。手阳明经和少阳经厥逆，则发为喉痹，咽肿，颈项强直，要治它主病之经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231207153136-m28j59o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207153136-m28j59o","updated":"20231207155307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"381.2、厥为程度较轻的反逆，厥逆则为程度严重的反逆；"}]},{"ID":"20231207153040-orhv2zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207153040-orhv2zp","updated":"20231207153353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"382、脾主少腹，少腹下又是小肠，所以治脾常常治小肠；"}]},{"ID":"20231207153354-ume5zlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207153354-ume5zlf","updated":"20231207154049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★383、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝有病的时候，治疗肝病同时要通利大肠，光治肝不会好的；（金制木，便秘对肝不好）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231207154036-ax7mkzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207154036-ax7mkzx","updated":"20231207154036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231207154036-5lreudu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231207153710-b8sen4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207153710-b8sen4t","updated":"20231207161249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"384、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 肺与膀胱相表里，膀胱有问题时治肺，肺有问题时治膀胱；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231207155508-j1nc215","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207155508-j1nc215","updated":"20231207160012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"384.1、常态：肺像天，天下雨到肾脏，肾脏累积起来后运送到膀胱，运送之前第一次小肠火蒸化，蒸化的最好的津液进入骨头骨髓补骨补脑，次等的津液则进入膀胱二次蒸化，二次蒸化的津液进入肝脏（水生木）把肝脏清洗一遍，浊水再排出，所以肺的水跟膀胱水是相关的，所以膀胱有问题时治肺，肺有问题时治膀胱；"}]},{"ID":"20231207160017-3nja3zg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207160017-3nja3zg","updated":"20231207160017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231207160017-3mq1h1g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231207161256-xwmawsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207161256-xwmawsf","updated":"20231207161335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"384.2、同理因为脾跟小肠是相同的，脾有问题治小肠，小肠有问题治脾；"}]},{"ID":"20231207160019-vxh165p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207160019-vxh165p","updated":"20231207161115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"385、很多症状都会导致耳聋，耳鸣耳聋有可能是小肠经、胆经或三焦经问题，因为这三经交会耳朵附近，又肾主耳，所以内部的听力也是肾脏在管，肾虚也会造成耳鸣，肾脏耳鸣比较深，表症耳鸣则比较靠表；"}]},{"ID":"20231207161353-wiwfnhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231207161353-wiwfnhm","updated":"20231208143117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"386、判断是否化脓：化脓的部位是热的，周边皮肤较冷；"}]},{"ID":"20231208143123-npnyl3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208143123-npnyl3a","updated":"20231208144141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"387、食物味淡的成分，就会生气，味厚的东西就会滋阴；"}]},{"ID":"20231208144359-lcntojj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208144359-lcntojj","updated":"20231208144422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"388、帝曰：有病怒狂者，此病安生？岐伯曰：生于阳也，帝曰：阳何以使人狂？岐伯曰：阳气者，因暴折而难决，故善怒也，病名曰阳厥。帝曰：何以知之？岐伯曰：阳明者常动，巨阳少阳不动，不动而动大疾，此其候也。帝曰：治之奈何？岐伯曰：夺其食即已。夫食入于阴，长气于阳，故夺其食即已。使之服以生铁洛为饮，夫生铁洛者，下气疾也"}]},{"ID":"20231208144132-l7plvo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208144132-l7plvo5","updated":"20231208144400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"388.1、 生铁洛：打铁铺打铁时溅出来的含铁的火星，就是生铁洛；"}]},{"ID":"20231208144353-xzzqur1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208144353-xzzqur1","updated":"20231208145403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"389、黄帝说，很好，还有一种患身体发热的病人，表现为四肢怠惰，汗出如用水浴洗一样，怕风，少气，这是一种什么病? 岐伯回答说，病名叫酒风。黄帝问道，如何治疗呢? 岐伯回答说，用泽泻、白术各十分，麋衔五分（麋衔就是茜草），共研细末，每次服三指撮，饭前服下。"}]},{"ID":"20231208145337-vudogka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208145337-vudogka","updated":"20231208150708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"390、黄帝问道：有的妇女怀孕九个月而不能说话的，这是什么缘故呢？岐伯回答说：这是因为胞中的络脉被胎儿压迫，阻绝不通所致。黄帝说：为什么这样说呢？岐伯说：宫的络脉系于肾脏，而足少阴肾脉贯肾上系于舌本，今胞宫的络脉受阻，肾脉亦不能上通于舌，舌本失养，故不能言语。黄帝说：如何治疗呢？岐伯说：不需要治疗，待至十月分娩之后，胞络通，声音就会自然恢复。《刺法》上说：正气不足的不可用泻法，邪气有余的不可用补法，以免因误治而造成疾病。所谓“无损不足”，就是怀孕九月而身体瘦弱的，不可再用针石治疗以伤其正气。所谓“无益有余”，就是说腹中已经怀孕而又妄用泄法，用泄法则精气耗伤，使病邪独据于中，正虚邪实，所以说疾病形成了。"}]},{"ID":"20231208150709-4i1u9kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208150709-4i1u9kv","updated":"20231208150924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"391、 黄帝说：有病胁下胀满，气逆喘促，二三年不好的，是什么疾病呢？岐伯说：病名叫息积，这种病在胁下而不在胃，所以不妨碍饮食，治疗时切不可用艾灸和针刺，必须逐步地用导引法疏通气血，并结合药物慢慢调治，若单靠药物也是不能治愈的。"}]},{"ID":"20231208150925-bmmzdh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208150925-bmmzdh0","updated":"20231208151027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"392、人有身体髀部、大腿、小腿都肿胀，并且环绕肚脐周围疼痛，这是什么疾病呢？岐伯说：病名叫伏梁，这是由于风邪久留于体内所致。邪气流溢于大肠而留着于肓膜，因为肓膜的起源在肚脐下部，所以环绕脐部作痛。这种病不可用按摩方法治疗，否则就会造成小便涩滞不利的疾病。"}]},{"ID":"20231208151028-iagf310","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208151028-iagf310","updated":"20231208151624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"393、疹：久病；疹筋：久病伤到筋了；"}]},{"ID":"20231208151625-r4269tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208151625-r4269tr","updated":"20231208151859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"394、望诊：黄色、红色为热症，青色、黑色为痛症，白色为寒症，黑色且白色则为寒痛症；"}]},{"ID":"20231208152000-fkbgsr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208152000-fkbgsr8","updated":"20231208152453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"395、黄帝说：有人患头痛已经多年不愈这是怎么得的？叫做什么病呢？岐伯说：此人当受过严重的寒邪侵犯，寒气向内侵入骨髓，脑为髓海，寒气由骨髓上逆于脑，所以使人头痛，齿为骨之余，故牙齿也痛，病由寒邪上逆所致，所以病名叫做“厥逆”。黄帝说：好。"}]},{"ID":"20231208152517-xd5ijrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208152517-xd5ijrb","updated":"20231208152551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"395.1、环头痛：湿盛，脾湿造成的头痛，头环着一圈痛；"}]},{"ID":"20231208152502-puw90gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208152502-puw90gt","updated":"20231208163926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"396、黄帝说：有患口中发甜的，病名叫什么？是怎样得的呢？岐伯说：这是由于五味的精气向上泛溢所致，病名叫脾瘅（瘅：劳动的劳）。五味入于口，藏于胃，其精气上输于脾，脾为胃输送食物的精华，因病津液停留在脾，致使脾气向上泛滥，就会使人口中发甜，这是由于肥甘美味所引起的疾病。患这种病的人，必然经常吃甘美而肥腻的食物，肥腻能使人生内热，甘味能使人中满，所以脾运失常，脾热上溢，就会转成消渴病。本病可用‘兰草’治疗，以排除蓄积郁热之气。"}]},{"ID":"20231208152514-mpwypm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208152514-mpwypm3","updated":"20231208153058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"397、血糖高并不会发心脏病，是因为吃胰岛素，胰岛素导致的心脏病；"}]},{"ID":"20231208153142-cy8s0t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208153142-cy8s0t9","updated":"20231208154523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"397.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长期打胰岛素治血糖高，会使身体内脏胰脏退化不分泌胰岛素，用中医疗法治疗糖尿病，停了胰岛素后，血糖初期会变得很高，这是正常现象；血糖高会有心脏病，这样的说法是错误的；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"只要保证病人的脚是热的，不会有心脏病；"}]},{"ID":"20231208153059-ywlrcuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208153059-ywlrcuk","updated":"20231208154348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"397.2、长期打胰岛素的人，停了胰岛素就会一直瘦，因为脾主肌肉主肥气；"}]},{"ID":"20231208153101-2rcvxg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208153101-2rcvxg2","updated":"20231208164132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"398、黄帝说：有病口中发苦的，应取足少阳胆经的阳陵泉治疗仍然不愈，这是什么病？是怎样得的呢？岐伯说：病名叫胆瘅。肝为将军之官，主谋虑，胆为中正之官，主决断，诸谋虑取决于胆，咽部为之外使。患者因屡次谋略而不能决断，情绪苦闷，遂使胆失却正常的功能，胆汁循经上泛，所以口中发苦。治疗时应取胆募日月穴和背部的背腧穴，这种治法，记载于《阴阳十二官相使》中。"}]},{"ID":"20231208164134-nle4dsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208164134-nle4dsk","updated":"20231208164207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"399、黄帝说：有患癃病的，一天要解数十次小便，这是正气不足的现象。同时又有身热如炭火，咽喉与胸膺之间有格塞不通的感觉，人迎脉躁动急数，呼吸喘促，肺气上逆，这又是邪气有余的现象。寸口脉微细如头发，这也是正气不足的表现。这种病的原因究竟在哪里？叫做什么病呢？岐伯说：此病是太阴脾脏不足，热邪炽盛在胃，症状却偏重在肺，病的名字叫做厥，属于不能治的死症。这就是所谓“五有余、二不足”的症候。黄帝说：什么叫“五有余、二不足”呢？岐伯说：所谓“五有余”，就是身热如炭，喘息，气逆等五种病气有余的症候。所谓“二不足”，就是癃一日数十溲，脉微细如发两种正气不足症候。现在患者外见五有余，内见二不足，这种病既不能依有余而攻其表，又不能从不足而补其里，所以说是必死无疑了。"}]},{"ID":"20231208164208-eyxzi92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231208164208-eyxzi92","updated":"20231208164442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"400、黄帝说：人出生以后就患有癫痫病的，病的名字叫什么？是怎样得的呢？岐伯说：病的名字叫胎病，这种病是胎儿在母腹中得的，由于其母曾受到很大的惊恐，气逆于上而不下，精也随而上逆，精气并聚不散，影响及胎儿，故其子生下来就患癫痫病。"}]},{"ID":"20231211100403-0oxpll2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211100403-0oxpll2","updated":"20231211101332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"401、黄帝说：面目浮肿，像有水状，切按脉搏大而且紧，身体没有痛处，形体也不消瘦，但不能吃饭，或者吃得很少，这种病叫什么呢？岐伯说：这种病发生在肾脏，名叫肾风。肾风病人到了不能吃饭、常常惊恐的阶段，若惊后心气不能恢复，心肾俱败，神气消亡，则为死症。黄帝说：对。"}]},{"ID":"20231211101333-gknokue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211101333-gknokue","updated":"20231211145906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"402、肝肾同病，人易受惊；"}]},{"ID":"20231211145906-9ym5d6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211145906-9ym5d6v","updated":"20231211150210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"403、跗骨脉：脉沉细小且急；"}]},{"ID":"20231211143208-5of73ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211143208-5of73ti","updated":"20231211150315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"404、肾肝并沉为石水，并浮为风水，并虚为死，并小弦欲惊。"}]},{"ID":"20231211150317-qf2sa88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211150317-qf2sa88","updated":"20231211153614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"405、疝：疝气；（病下有山；表现为停滞不动，痛不移转，而且沉重），一般疝气都是来自寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231211152535-h2sye2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211152535-h2sye2s","updated":"20231211153530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"406、肾脉大、急、沉，代表里面有肿瘤；"}]},{"ID":"20231211153530-bit0yg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211153530-bit0yg0","updated":"20231211153726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"407、肾脉大急沉，肝脉大急沉，皆为疝。心脉搏滑急为心疝，肺脉沉搏为肺疝。（没有脾疝）"}]},{"ID":"20231211153411-0zenrv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211153411-0zenrv8","updated":"20231211153738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"408、三阳急为瘕，三阴急为疝，二阴急为痫厥，二阳急为惊。"}]},{"ID":"20231211153739-fwpfk7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211153739-fwpfk7t","updated":"20231211154045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"408.1、三阳（太阳）急为肚子里面长硬块，三阴（太阴）急为疝气，二阴（厥阴）急为癫痫，二阳（阳明）为惊；"}]},{"ID":"20231213103123-5ooy5w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213103123-5ooy5w9","updated":"20231213103212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"408.2、所有的疝通通是寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231211154209-c2ipgsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211154209-c2ipgsc","updated":"20231211154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"409、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉症合救的回来，脉症不合为死症；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231211154229-m16bmii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211154229-m16bmii","updated":"20231211154848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"410、胃病强七天，胃下底部还保留着一点点食物，允许7天喝水可以活；——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231211154747-7c585p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211154747-7c585p7","updated":"20231211162808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"411、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所有的脉都是以胃气为本（浮弦洪沉缓皆带有胃气的缓的特性），胃本身阳气非常之大，所以能够受纳五谷，滋润五脏六腑；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231211162805-w6j42ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211162805-w6j42ck","updated":"20231211164325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"412、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一个人能够讲话的这个动作，是由三个动作连在一起的，肾脉灌到肺（络过心包），肺脉再灌到喉咙，喉咙再灌到金津玉液穴进入舌头；所以肾脏在发它的阳，心脏在发它的音的高低，肺脏在发它的气；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231211164318-sleyj70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211164318-sleyj70","updated":"20231211164830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"413、失血的脉一定是下沉而且是虚，脉浮到表面来就是阳要绝了；"}]},{"ID":"20231211164830-pgs872y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211164830-pgs872y","updated":"20231211170305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"414、常态的肾脏本身就是寒热的焦点：双肾之间是命门火，双肾是水；（所以常人体温是温的，如寒热不均匀，说明寒热（阴阳）分开了）；（所以最好的阳，是潜于中间即潜于内的）"}]},{"ID":"20231211170356-gl16hk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211170356-gl16hk8","updated":"20231211170507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"414.1、阴能固阳，如大便下痢，阴过分损耗了，阴不固阳，阳气就会外浮身体发热，就会出现上身热，下身下痢的情况；"}]},{"ID":"20231211165929-v69ysg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211165929-v69ysg8","updated":"20231211171259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"415、肾主腰椎，除外伤，肾有问题会有腰椎痛；"}]},{"ID":"20231211154312-4svpth2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231211154312-4svpth2","updated":"20231212085300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"416、癫痫病：阳从督脉上头顶再降下，如头部有痰堵塞到，那阳就会堵到，积累之下就引发癫痫；"}]},{"ID":"20231212085536-86hnupy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212085536-86hnupy","updated":"20231212085919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"417、肾阳虚会引发头痛，会痛到牙齿去，标准症状手脚冰冷，可能也会导致眼盲，不能见物；肾阴虚有几个症状，如眼睛发花，看到五颜六色，如先耳鸣，再聋，如"}]},{"ID":"20231212085955-52h6inf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212085955-52h6inf","updated":"20231212090052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"417.1、肾虚的前提下，也可从排便看阴阳虚，如大便正常，但偶尔下痢，为阳虚，大便一天一次，为阴虚；"}]},{"ID":"20231212093814-c4e2hwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212093814-c4e2hwz","updated":"20231212100548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"418、少阳谓心胁痛者，言少阳盛也，盛者心之所表也。九月阳气尽而阴气盛，故心胁痛也。所谓不可反侧者，阴气藏物也，物藏则不动，故不可反侧也。所谓甚则跃者，九月万物尽衰，草木毕落而堕，则气去阳而之阴，气盛而阳之下长，故谓跃。（跃：呕吐；少阴病胸胁苦满想吐的原因）"}]},{"ID":"20231212101016-pgxqm3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101016-pgxqm3c","updated":"20231212101152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"419、常人阴阳二气阳下阴上，如阳明热，阳气上浮不下，阴就被堵到没法上，人体二气不循环，阴就会积累在下形成胫肿；"}]},{"ID":"20231212101323-ovbji89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101323-ovbji89","updated":"20231212101342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"420、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"水本来自肾，散于肺；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231212101342-72i7yl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101342-72i7yl6","updated":"20231212101706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"421、 心移热于小肠；"}]},{"ID":"20231212101706-4jjbgwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101706-4jjbgwy","updated":"20231212101714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231212101714-fnribv3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231212101820-h18njij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101820-h18njij","updated":"20231212101852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"421.1、所谓胸痛少气者，水气在藏府也，水者，阴气也，阴气在中，故胸痛少气也。（如中有水气，阻碍了心移热小肠的通路，就会导致胸痛少气）"}]},{"ID":"20231212101715-u4bn5nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212101715-u4bn5nn","updated":"20231212103525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"422、心胃相通，心脏有问题时胃口会开起来，因为想自救；某些病症下，人会与动物一样，心脏有病时，本能胃口大增，去到处找草药吃，当吃到正确的有利于身体的食物时胃口就会下降，停止暴饮暴食；（现今人饮食习惯不良且认知有误，所以常常呈现身热一直吃的亚健康状态，实际身体并没有足够的能量消化食物）"}]},{"ID":"20231212103105-ztsua9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212103105-ztsua9m","updated":"20231212103646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"423、脉解篇"}]},{"ID":"20231212103647-naabiry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212103647-naabiry","updated":"20231212104933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"424、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺咳久了（每次咳肺会搜索），会伤阳；像动脉血管破裂、脑溢血，不该破裂都破裂的人体组织都是阳虚；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231212104919-qse9gaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212104919-qse9gaz","updated":"20231212110836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"425、 桂枝汤，手冷脚温，桂枝加倍，脚冷手温，白芍加倍；"}]},{"ID":"20231212110836-opms5p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212110836-opms5p6","updated":"20231212113314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"426、先有针灸，后有中药；"}]},{"ID":"20231212113819-c1x3cms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212113819-c1x3cms","updated":"20231212113821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"427、疾病有在表在里的区别，刺法有浅刺深刺的不同，病在表应当浅刺，病在里应当深刺，各应到达一定的部位（疾病所在），而不能违背这一法度。刺得太深，就会损伤内脏；刺得太浅，不仅达不到病处，而且反使在表的气血壅滞，给病邪以可乘之机。因此，针刺深浅不当，反会给人体带来很大的危害，使五脏功能紊乱，继而发生严重的疾病。"}]},{"ID":"20231212113822-yoq9io5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212113822-yoq9io5","updated":"20231212113829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"427.1、所以说：疾病的部位有在毫毛腠理的，有在皮肤的，有在肌肉的，有在脉的，有在筋的，有在骨的，有在髓的。因此，该刺毫毛腠理的，不要伤及皮肤。若皮肤受伤，就会影响肺脏的正常功能，肺脏功能扰乱后，以致到秋天时，易患温疟病，发生恶寒战栗的症状。该刺皮肤的，不要伤及肌肉，若肌肉受伤，就会影响脾脏的正常功能，以致在每一季节的最后十八天中，发生腹胀烦满、不思饮食的病症。该刺肌肉的，不要伤及血脉，若血脉受伤，就会影响心脏的正常功能，以致到夏天时，易患心痛的病症。该刺血脉的，不要伤及筋脉，若筋脉受伤，就会影响肝脏的正常功能，以致到秋天时，易患热性病，发生筋脉弛缓的症状。该刺筋的，不要伤及骨，若骨受伤，就会影响肾脏的正常功能，以致到冬天时，易患腹胀、腰痛的病症。该刺骨的，不要伤及骨髓，若骨髓被损伤而髓便日渐消减，不能充养骨骼，就会导致身体枯瘦，足胫发酸，肢体懈怠，无力举动的病症。"}]},{"ID":"20231212114356-vg1x0gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212114356-vg1x0gf","updated":"20231212114704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"428、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"扎针绝对不能扎到内脏。刺中心，一天就死，会打嗝噫气；刺中肝，五天就死，讲话不断；刺中肾，六天就死，病人打喷嚏；刺中肺，三天就死，咳嗽；刺中脾，十天就死，会出现吞咽的症状；刺中胆，一日半就死，出现恶心呕吐的症状；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231212114706-6syyhu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231212114706-6syyhu1","updated":"20231212151203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"429、 大醉之人不刺、过劳操劳之人不刺、大怒生气之人不刺、大饱大恶大渴大虚之人不刺；"}]},{"ID":"20231213081335-vprgszh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213081335-vprgszh","updated":"20231213092308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"430、静脉曲张要放血放掉，这种属淤血；又因为人体主要上半身为阳为气，下半身为阴为血，所以静脉曲张多积累在下半身；"}]},{"ID":"20231213092309-ez1ycb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213092309-ez1ycb7","updated":"20231213101439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"431、黄帝说：我听说九针与天地四时阴阳相应合，请你讲讲其中的道理，以使其能流传于后世，作为治病的常法。岐伯说：一天、二地、三人、四时、五音、六律、七星、八风、九野，人的形体也与自然界相应，针的式样也是根据其所适应的不同病症制成的，所以有九针之名。人的皮肤在外，庇护全身，与天相应，肌肉柔软安静，如土地厚载万物一样，脉与人体本身相应，筋约束周身、各部功能不同，犹如一年四季气候各异，人的声音与五音相应。人的脏腑阴阳之气配合犹如六律的高低有节；人的牙齿和面目的排列犹如天上的星辰一样；人的呼吸之气犹如自然界的风一样；人的九窍三百六十五络分布全身，犹如地上的百川万水，纵横灌注于九野一样。所以九针之中，一（镜）针刺皮，二（员）针刺肉，三（提）针刺脉，四（锋）针刺筋，五（铍）针刺骨，六（员利）针调和阴阳，七（毫）针补益精气，八（长）针驱除风邪，九（大）针通利九窍，祛除周身三百六十五节间的邪气。这就叫做不同的针有不同的功用和适应症。人的心愿意向与八风相应，人体之气运行与天气运行相应，人的发齿耳目五声与五音六律相应，人体阴阳经脉运行气血与大地江河百川相应，肝脏精气通于两目，目又属于九窍，所以肝目与九数相应。"}]},{"ID":"20231213101442-g3xvv6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213101442-g3xvv6y","updated":"20231213102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"432、诊脉只是用于确认望闻问的结果的，如果摸脉跟‘望闻问’得出的结果不一致，舍脉取症；"}]},{"ID":"20231213102030-vc8g8vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213102030-vc8g8vu","updated":"20231213103249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"433、越重的症，药会越来越少；——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231213103249-lvosbbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213103249-lvosbbo","updated":"20231213105020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"434、阳极生阴，阴极生阳；所以遇到有高明的医师，遇到热极的病人，不开寒药反而开热药，能让阳极生阴恢复正常；"}]},{"ID":"20231213105020-51j4tig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213105020-51j4tig","updated":"20231213115026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★435、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡十二经络脉者，皮之部也。是故百病之始生也，必先于皮毛，邪中之则腠理开，开则入客于络脉，留而不去，传入于经，留而不去，传入于府，廪于肠胃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231213113638-qv2ystn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213113638-qv2ystn","updated":"20231213114816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"435.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏病都是由外传的，先于皮毛，最后入脏；如现在有肝病，两年前并没有肝病，但两年前的病邪就已经被身体侦测到了，呈现出1点到3点不能睡觉的症状；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231213114310-pmsr3id","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213114310-pmsr3id","updated":"20231213114401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"435.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以经络有问题并不代表着脏有问题，如半夜3-5点不能睡，说明肺经有问题了，并不代表着肺有问题；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231213114451-ympubw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213114451-ympubw1","updated":"20231213115129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"435.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病起时不是治的时机，病退时才是治的时机；如肺属金，申酉时为金病起、辰戌丑未为土（土生金）病甚两者治疗效果不佳，亥子时为水（金生水）治疗效果好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"——非绝对"}]},{"ID":"20231213115242-80lyhdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213115242-80lyhdi","updated":"20231213115330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"435.4、病邪→皮毛→络脉→经→腑→脏"}]},{"ID":"20231213113618-wsrnlpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213113618-wsrnlpj","updated":"20231213115510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"436、病邪留于筋骨之间，寒多则筋挛骨痛，热多则筋弛骨消，肉烁（月囷）破，毛直而败。"}]},{"ID":"20231213115512-cl13iv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213115512-cl13iv3","updated":"20231213145445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"437、阴络之色应其经，阳络之色变无常，随四时而行也。"}]},{"ID":"20231213145446-prqncqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213145446-prqncqb","updated":"20231213145924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★438、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"圣人易语，良马易御——气穴论。（气穴论：歧伯一章讲完经络）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231213160238-35v9z9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213160238-35v9z9d","updated":"20231213160743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"438.1、心痛彻背背痛彻心："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"天突穴+中脘穴+关元穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"+背后第十椎（三焦气脉汇于第十椎）；"}]},{"ID":"20231213161212-akq7xjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213161212-akq7xjd","updated":"20231213161221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"438.2、黄帝说：好。 我想听听溪骨之会合是怎样的。"}]},{"ID":"20231213161220-m6tl2jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213161220-m6tl2jg"}},{"ID":"20231213161219-wr5f7ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213161219-wr5f7ht"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：较大的肌肉与肌肉会合的部位叫谷，娇小的肌肉与肌肉会合的部位叫溪。分肉之间，溪谷会合的部位，能通行营卫，会合宗气。若邪气溢满，正气壅滞，则脉发热，肌肉败坏，营卫不能畅行，必将郁热腐肉成脓，内则消烁骨髓，外则可溃大肉，若邪六连于关节肌腠，必使髓液皆溃为脓，而使筋骨败坏。若寒邪所客，积留而不去，则营卫不能正常运行，以致筋脉肌肉卷缩，肋肘不得伸展，内则发生骨痹，外则肌肤麻木不仁这是不足的症候，乃由寒邪留连溪骨所致。溪谷与三百六十五穴相会合，以应于一岁。若是邪在皮毛孙络的小痹，则邪气随脉往来无定，用微针即可治疗，方法与刺孙络是一样的。"}]},{"ID":"20231213145648-amv3g44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213145648-amv3g44","updated":"20231213164434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"439、治落枕手臂痛，将痛的手举起，往脖子项部以下按到不能再往下的位置，做一个记号，然后在记号的位置灸；"}]},{"ID":"20231213164426-tj7kbwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213164426-tj7kbwe","updated":"20231213164426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231213164426-oeicqf9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231213164428-mzkihdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213164428-mzkihdm","updated":"20231213165617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"440、女人督脉的起点：尿道口与阴毛中间凸起处；"}]},{"ID":"20231213165248-h1fqa5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213165248-h1fqa5v","updated":"20231213165344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"440.1、男人督脉的起点：循阴茎，下至会阴直上；"}]},{"ID":"20231213165122-l66cgoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213165122-l66cgoh","updated":"20231213171745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"441、骨空论：治疗骨头的病，就在骨空处；"}]},{"ID":"20231213171745-l94h6iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213171745-l94h6iw","updated":"20231213174121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"442、疯狗咬到（狂犬病预治）：伤口处灸三壮；（如狂因此并有往来寒热，寒热相结的症状，可以参考黄帝内经60篇，骨空论之‘灸寒热之法’灸相应穴位）"}]},{"ID":"20231213173753-8y33wwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213173753-8y33wwt","updated":"20231213173754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"443、黄帝问道：少阴为什么主肾？肾又为什么主水？"}]},{"ID":"20231213180100-nwno3fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213180100-nwno3fc","updated":"20231213180225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯回答说：肾属于至阴之脏，至阴属水，所以肾是主水的脏器。肺属于太阴。肾脉属于少阴，是旺于冬令的经脉。所以水之根本在肾（肾为本），水之标末在肺（肺为末），肺肾两脏都能积聚水液而为病。黄帝又问道：肾为什么能积聚水液而生病？岐伯说：肾是胃的关门，关门不通畅，水液就要停相聚而生病了。其水液在人体上下泛溢于皮肤，所以形成浮肿。浮肿的成因，就是水液积聚而生的病。黄帝又问道：各种水病都是由于肾而生成的吗？岐伯说：肾脏在下属阴。凡是由下而上蒸腾的地方都属于肾，因气化而生成的水液，所以叫做“至阴”。呈勇力而劳动（或房劳）太过，则汗出于肾；出汗时遇到风邪，风邪从开泄之腠理侵入，汗孔骤闭，汗出不尽，向内不能入于脏腑，向外也不得排泄于皮肤，于是逗留在玄府之中，皮肤之内，最后形成浮肿病。此病之本在于肾，病名叫“风水”。所谓玄府，就是汗孔。"}]},{"ID":"20231213180347-00nn1pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213180347-00nn1pd","updated":"20231213180347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231213180347-pyi4zbm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231213180109-2yqottn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213180109-2yqottn","updated":"20231214093733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"444、任何水积在那边的症状，都跟肾有关系；"}]},{"ID":"20231214093735-ivspoat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214093735-ivspoat","updated":"20231214094439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★445、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：春天针刺，取络脉分肉之间，是什么道理？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214093912-6m6miix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214093912-6m6miix","updated":"20231214093918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：春天木气开始当令，在人体，肝气开始发生；肝气的特性是急躁，如变动的风一样很迅疾，但是肝的经脉往往藏于深部，而风刚赶发生，尚不太剧烈，不能深入经脉，所以只要浅刺络脉分肉之间就行了。"}]},{"ID":"20231213161207-fiv5npq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231213161207-fiv5npq","updated":"20231214094032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：夏天针刺，取盛经分腠之间，是什么道理？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214093930-g8pwtf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214093930-g8pwtf2","updated":"20231214093932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：夏天火气开始当令，心气开始生长壮大；如果脉形瘦小而搏动气势较弱，是阳气充裕流溢于体表，热气熏蒸于分肉腠理，向内影响于经脉，所以针刺应当取盛经分腠。针刺不要过深只要透过皮肤而病就可痊愈，是因为邪气居于浅表部位的缘故。所谓盛经，是指丰满充足的阳脉。"}]},{"ID":"20231214093956-3if8w3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214093956-3if8w3z","updated":"20231214094034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：秋天针刺，要取经穴和输穴，是什么道理？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214093956-ut6yl6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214093956-ut6yl6r","updated":"20231214094000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：秋气开始当令肺气开始收敛肃杀，金气渐旺逐步盛过衰退的火气，阳气在经脉的合穴，阴气初生，遇湿邪侵犯人体，但由于阴气未至太盛，不能助湿邪深入，所以针刺取经的“输”穴以泻阴湿之邪，取阳经的“合”穴以泻阳热之邪。由于阳气开始衰退而阴气位至太盛，所以不取“经”穴而取“合”穴。"}]},{"ID":"20231214094004-bxhymad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214094004-bxhymad","updated":"20231214094036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：冬天针刺，要取“井”穴和“荥”穴，是什么道理？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214094004-nwjjwqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214094004-nwjjwqm","updated":"20231214094006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：冬天水气开始当令，肾气开始闭藏，阳气已经衰少，阴气更加坚盛，太阳之气浮沉于下，阳脉也相随沉伏，所以针刺要取阳经的“井”穴以抑降其阴逆之气，取阴经的“输”穴以充实不足之阳气。因此说：“冬取井荥，春不衄”，就是这个道理。"}]},{"ID":"20231214100210-g22hjrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214100210-g22hjrb","updated":"20231214100212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：先生说过治疗热病的五十九个俞穴，我已经知道其大概，但还不知道这些俞穴的部位，请告诉我它们的部位，并说明这些俞穴在治疗上的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20231214100210-52zoxvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214100210-52zoxvu","updated":"20231214100213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：头上有五行，每行五个穴位，能泄越诸阳经上逆的热邪。大杼、膺俞、缺盆、背俞这八个穴位，可以泻除胸中的热邪。气街、三里、上巨虚和下巨虚这八个穴位，可以泻出胃中的热邪。云门、肩髃、委中、贿空这八个穴位，可以泻出四肢的热邪。以上共五十九个穴位，都在治疗热病的俞穴。"}]},{"ID":"20231214100210-tqo74k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214100210-tqo74k8","updated":"20231214100213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：人感受了寒邪反而会传变为热病，这是什么原因？"}]},{"ID":"20231214100210-vxw2qhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214100210-vxw2qhd","updated":"20231214100214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：寒气盛极，就会郁而发热。"}]},{"ID":"20231214094007-5ktjxg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214094007-5ktjxg5","updated":"20231214094731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"446、久病新病怎么看？新病的人气色一定没有改变，久病的人气色一定伤到；"}]},{"ID":"20231214094731-sf0mzn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214094731-sf0mzn1","updated":"20231214114923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"447、黄帝问曰：余闻刺法言，有余写之，不足补之，何谓有余？何谓不足？岐伯对曰：有余有五，不足亦有五，帝欲何问？帝曰：愿尽闻之。岐伯曰：神有余有不足，气有余有不足，血有余有不足，形有余有不足，志有余有不足，凡此十者，其气不等也。"}]},{"ID":"20231214114929-10e85vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214114929-10e85vo","updated":"20231214114929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 153px;","style":"width: 143px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231214114929-e97rae4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 143px;\" parent-style=\"width: 153px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231214115339-xeu8365","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214115339-xeu8365","updated":"20231214115406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"447.1、如何让五实五虚平衡？让经络平衡就好了；"}]},{"ID":"20231214094443-5p5jjbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214094443-5p5jjbe","updated":"20231214115246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"448、心藏神，肺藏气，肝藏血，脾藏肉，肾藏志"}]},{"ID":"20231214115248-2zz9sb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214115248-2zz9sb9","updated":"20231214115438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"449、神有余则笑不休，神不足则悲。"}]},{"ID":"20231214115440-mobetts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214115440-mobetts","updated":"20231214171207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"450、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"气并血虚，血并气虚；(虚症不是气虚就是血虚)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214170803-cwle3ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214170803-cwle3ka","updated":"20231214170858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"450.1、并字可以理解为堵塞，痈结，堵；"}]},{"ID":"20231214170900-rzwtw6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214170900-rzwtw6w","updated":"20231214171023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"450.2、气血并行，气先走六寸，血随之，如果气并住了，就会血虚，血并住了，就会气虚；"}]},{"ID":"20231214170834-mdkashj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214170834-mdkashj","updated":"20231214171209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"451、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚症是一个东西堵塞到了，不是气就是血，实症就是气血两者都堵了，形成了肿瘤；所以要治疗实症，不仅要加行气的药，还要加活血化瘀的药；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231214171200-feypczq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214171200-feypczq","updated":"20231214171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"452、黄帝说：实是通过什么渠道来的？虚又是通过什么渠道去的？形成虚和实的道理，希望能听你讲一讲。"}]},{"ID":"20231214171352-mtbuc13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214171352-mtbuc13","updated":"20231214171858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：阴经和阳经都有俞穴有会穴，以互相沟通。如阳经的气血灌注于阴经，阴经的气血盛满则充溢于外，能这样运行不已，保持阴阳平调，形体得到充足的气血滋养，九候的脉象也表现一直，这就是正常的人。凡邪气伤人而发生病变，有发生于阴的内脏，或发生于阳的体表。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"病生于阳经在表的，都是感受了风雨寒暑邪气的侵袭；病生于阴经在里的，都是由于饮食不节、起居失常、房事过度、喜怒无常所致"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20231214171453-v9tag0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214171453-v9tag0y","updated":"20231214171723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"452.1、九候：上身有三部，胸有三部，下身有三部；（手上也有九候，按到皮肤一部、按到肌肉一部、按到骨边一部，寸关尺各有三部共9数）"}]},{"ID":"20231214171528-9kgowel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214171528-9kgowel","updated":"20231214172109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"453、喜按为虚，拒按为实；"}]},{"ID":"20231214172109-xrtaijj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214172109-xrtaijj","updated":"20231214172222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"454、阴可满不可实，阳可实不可满；"}]},{"ID":"20231214172222-728tb6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214172222-728tb6n","updated":"20231214172703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"455、虚症是阳气四散，基本上是体内有寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231214172704-jb7u227","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214172704-jb7u227","updated":"20231214173031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"456、阳虚容易怕冷，阴虚体内会生热；阳盛则外热，阴盛则内寒；"}]},{"ID":"20231214172938-9ys9moc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214172938-9ys9moc","updated":"20231214173402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"457、黄帝说：医经上所说的阳虚则生外寒，阴虚则生内热，阳盛则生外热，阴盛则生内寒。我已听说过了，但不知是什么原因产生的。"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-l353wc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-l353wc6","updated":"20231214173405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：诸阳之气，均承受于上焦，以温煦皮肤分肉之间，现寒气侵袭于外，使上焦不能宣通，阳气不能充分外达以温煦皮肤分肉，如此则寒气独留于肌表，因而发生恶寒战栗。"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-la29go5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-la29go5","updated":"20231214173406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：阴虚则生内热是怎样的呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-v75qnm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-v75qnm0","updated":"20231214173407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：过度劳倦则伤脾，脾虚不能运化，必形气衰少，也不能转输水谷的精微，这样上焦即不能宣发五谷气味，下脘也不能化水谷之精，胃气郁而生热，热气上熏于胸中，因而发生内热。"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-r3ia7us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-r3ia7us","updated":"20231215143105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳盛则生外热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是怎样的呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-a50vtg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-a50vtg5","updated":"20231214173409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说；若上焦不通利，可使皮肤致密，腠理闭塞，汗孔不通，如此则卫气不得发泄散越，郁而发热，所以发生外热。"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-dd721f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-dd721f5","updated":"20231215143107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴盛则生内寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是怎样的呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231214173354-l2pknwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173354-l2pknwe","updated":"20231214173411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：若寒厥之气上逆，寒气积于胸中而不下泄，寒气不泻，则阳气必受耗伤，阳气耗伤，则寒气独留，寒性凝敛，营血滞涩，脉行不畅，其脉搏必见盛大而涩，所以成为内寒。"}]},{"ID":"20231214173411-q1ogom6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231214173411-q1ogom6","updated":"20231215142955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★458、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"有些人娇生惯养不愿意运动出汗导致毛孔退化，没法流汗，且严重到用了大剂的发汗剂都不会出汗（发汗剂不出汗反而导致身热脸涨红气喘），怎么处理？洗冷水澡，寒极生热，冷浴生大热——倪师"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231215142937-6ht1gfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215142937-6ht1gfk","updated":"20231215143013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"458.1、玄府：汗孔；"}]},{"ID":"20231215142507-v4r130j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215142507-v4r130j","updated":"20231215143722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"459、帝曰：血气以并，病形以成，阴阳相顷，补写奈何？岐伯曰：写实者气盛乃内针，针与气俱内，以开其门，如利其户；针与气俱出，精气不伤，邪气乃下，外门不闭，以出其疾；摇大其道，如利其路，是谓大写，必切而出，大气乃屈。帝曰：补虚奈何？岐伯曰 ："}]},{"ID":"20231215143718-78z3cm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143718-78z3cm8","updated":"20231215143723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 持针勿置，以定其意，候呼内针，气出针入，针空四塞，精无从去，方实而疾出针，气入针出，热不得还，闭塞其门，邪气布散，精气乃得存，动气候时，近气不失，远气乃来，是谓追之。"}]},{"ID":"20231215143734-ev35te8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143734-ev35te8","updated":"20231215143737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"459.1、"}]},{"ID":"20231215143757-lg7rqfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143757-lg7rqfc","updated":"20231215143801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：血气和邪气已并，病已形成，阴阳失去平衡的，刺治应怎样用补法和泻法呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231215143757-cl9xfsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143757-cl9xfsn","updated":"20231215143802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：泻实证时，应在气盛的时候进针，即在病人吸气时进针，使针与气同时入内，刺其俞穴以开邪出之门户，并在病人呼气时出针，使针与气同时外出，这样可使精气不伤，邪气得以外泄；在针刺时还要使针孔不要闭塞，以排泄邪气，应摇大其针孔，而通利邪出之道路，这叫做“大泻”，出针时先以左手轻轻切按针孔周围，然后迅速出针，这样亢盛的邪气就可穷尽。"}]},{"ID":"20231215143757-bosg69d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143757-bosg69d","updated":"20231215143803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝说：怎样补虚呢？岐伯说；以手持针，不要立即刺入，先安定其神气，待病人呼气时进针，即气出针入，针刺入后不要摇动，使针孔周围紧密与针体连接，使精气无隙外泄，当气至而针下时，迅速出针，但要在病人吸气时出针，气入针出，使针下所至的热气不能内还，出针后立即按闭针孔使精气得以保存。针刺侯气时，要耐心等待，必俟其气至而充实，始可出针，这样可使以至之气不致散失，远处未至之气可以导来，这叫做补法。"}]},{"ID":"20231215143805-7lnd7qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215143805-7lnd7qx","updated":"20231215144249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"460、病在骨，亦可用焠针和药烫病处；病不知疼痛，可以刺阳蹻阴蹻二脉；身有疼痛，而九侯之脉没有病象，则用缪刺法治之。如果疼痛在左侧，而右脉有病象，则用巨刺法辞之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231215144116-b3mskgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215144116-b3mskgy","updated":"20231215145622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"460.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巨刺和谬刺，两者共同点都是左病右治，右病左治，差异点是巨刺在经，谬刺在络；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231215144319-65goo91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215144319-65goo91","updated":"20231215144352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"460.2、例手痛，痛不在经上，这时候就可以用谬刺法刺另一只手的痛点位置对治；"}]},{"ID":"20231215144212-la250sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215144212-la250sm","updated":"20231215144645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"★461、缪刺论；"}]},{"ID":"20231215144546-txhy7pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215144546-txhy7pv","updated":"20231215145501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.1、缪刺就是病邪在络上，左病右治，右病左治，不遵从经络的‘虚则补其母’‘实则泻其子’原则；"}]},{"ID":"20231215151040-z134vw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151040-z134vw5","updated":"20231215151148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.2、所有的络病，都是新病；——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231215151154-anhqo4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151154-anhqo4w","updated":"20231215151235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.3、西药都是性寒的；——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231215151235-bvlyke7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151235-bvlyke7","updated":"20231215161823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.4、重击、摔伤、较剧烈重伤时，然谷穴位置会崩起有淤血，下针，放血即可；如果然谷穴放血还没好，扎冲阳穴地方放血；如果还没效果，三毛穴的地方放血；（三毛放血人会醒来，三毛艾灸助眠）"}]},{"ID":"20231215163210-7jkcl2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215163210-7jkcl2h","updated":"20231215164552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治诸经刺之，所过者不病，则缪刺之。耳聋，刺手阳明，不已，刺其通脉出耳前者。 齿龋，刺手阳明，不已，刺其脉入齿中，立已。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（所有病经过经，就从经上对治，不过经的就用缪刺法；耳聋，刺手阳明经或放血没好，就取近取穴或用筷子找压痛点；牙齿痛，刺手阳明，没好，就扎两个牙齿中间的肉，针下去放血）"}]},{"ID":"20231215165821-851e033","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215165821-851e033","updated":"20231215165917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"461.6、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大凡刺治的方法，先要根据所病的经脉，切按推寻，评审虚实而进行调治；如果经络不调，先采用经刺的方法；如果有病痛而经脉没有病变，再采用缪刺的方法，要看皮肤不是否有郁血的络脉，如有应全部把郁血刺出。以上就是缪刺的方法。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231215161340-yq4dop0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215161340-yq4dop0","updated":"20231215162307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"462、实症出来的时候症状是持续的，虚症出来的症状是时有时无；——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231215162215-8j3n3nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215162215-8j3n3nj","updated":"20231215164854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"463、牙痛：内庭+何故（牙痛合谷）——倪师常用"}]},{"ID":"20231215164855-i10bldj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215164855-i10bldj","updated":"20231215165249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"464、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"手足少阴太阴足阳明之络，此五络，皆会于耳中，五络皆病则令人身脉皆动，而形无知也，其状若尸，或曰尸厥；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（对治：刺其足大指内侧爪甲上，去端如韭叶，后刺足心，后刺足中指爪甲上各一痏，后刺手大指内侧，去端如韭叶，后刺手心主，少阴锐骨之端各一痏，立已。不已，以竹管吹其两耳，鬄其左角之发方一寸，燔治，饮以美酒一杯，不能饮者灌之，立已。）"}]},{"ID":"20231215165101-wrfcmx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215165101-wrfcmx0","updated":"20231218092006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"465、春气在经脉，夏气在孙络，长夏气在肌肉，秋气在皮肤，冬气在骨髓中。"}]},{"ID":"20231215151155-2jeu85k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151155-2jeu85k","updated":"20231218094438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"466、标本病传论篇；"}]},{"ID":"20231218094440-3h650i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218094440-3h650i2","updated":"20231218094538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"466.1、标本怎么确认？例患者高烧，便秘七天，则高烧为标，便秘为本；例患者高烧三四天，大便正常，则发烧为本；"}]},{"ID":"20231218094833-4j14whf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218094833-4j14whf","updated":"20231218100558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"466.2、先病而后逆者治其本，先逆而后病者治其本，先寒而后生病者治其本，先病而后生寒者治其本，先热而后生病者治其本，先热而后生中满者治其标，先病而后泄者治其本，先泄而后生他病者治其本，必且调之，乃治其他病 ，先病而后生中满者治其标，先中满而后烦心者治其本。（先得某个病，然后才因此得到其他病，则先得的病为本，先治先得的病；又病人黄疸，得黄疸前大便不正常、睡眠不正常，这时要先治黄疸，因为疸堵到了才会出现其他副症，完全堵到就出现黄疸的症状）"}]},{"ID":"20231218094538-s22dym4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218094538-s22dym4","updated":"20231218104904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"467、伤寒论中，将日变更为候，一候七天（六天，第七天开始更换）；——倪师"}]},{"ID":"20231218104904-atgt656","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218104904-atgt656","updated":"20231218105335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"468、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"各种疾病按次序这样相传，都有一定的死期，不可以用针刺治疗；假如是间脏相传就停止不再传脏，即使传过三脏、四脏，还是可以用针刺治疗的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231215151155-949fud9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151155-949fud9","updated":"20231218105702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"469、著至教论篇"}]},{"ID":"20231218105704-5h2ieqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218105704-5h2ieqk","updated":"20231218161721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"470、上为天阳，下为地阴，天阳与地阴交汇之处，在地上往上数三寸，三寸以上的位置；人睡觉时，头会百汇，脚会涌泉，所以人在睡觉时是睡在天和地交接的地方，所以人会受到天地滋养；当人站起来时，则受天之阳比较多，受地之阴比较少，所以人是以阳为主，阳中带阴；"}]},{"ID":"20231218161552-4iiue60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218161552-4iiue60","updated":"20231218161726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231218161552-ioxdjcl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 213px;","style":"width: 203px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231218161726-19i3b1g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 203px;\" parent-style=\"width: 213px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231218161745-1byvhoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218161745-1byvhoy","updated":"20231218161835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"470.1、老鼠在地上跑，所以承受地气多，天阳少，所以鼠辈是阴多阳少；"}]},{"ID":"20231218162207-4ehojan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218162207-4ehojan","updated":"20231218162233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"470.2、常人阴阳是平衡互济（互助）的；"}]},{"ID":"20231218172127-wy1dpuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218172127-wy1dpuh","updated":"20231218172257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"470.2、鹿睡觉是用鹿角靠着树丛睡，与天阳亲近，由此可看出鹿茸属阳；"}]},{"ID":"20231218110702-uk0ql8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218110702-uk0ql8c","updated":"20231218164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"471、治年长的人的病先看他的腑，年轻人先看他的经；"}]},{"ID":"20231215151155-e866vth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151155-e866vth","updated":"20231218165846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"472、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"夫圣人之治病，循法守度，援物比类，化之冥冥，循上及下，何必守经。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231215151155-i23o2q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231215151155-i23o2q8","updated":"20231219091436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"473、血无止法；"}]},{"ID":"20231219093110-zitr143","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219093110-zitr143","updated":"20231219094926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"474、疏五过论篇"}]},{"ID":"20231219094927-zum9kzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219094927-zum9kzq","updated":"20231219095352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"475、圣人之治病也，必知天地阴阳，四时经纪，五藏六府，雌雄表里，刺灸砭石，毒药所主，从容人事，以明经道，贵贱贫富，各异品理，问年少长，勇怯之理，审于分部，知病本始，八正九候，诊必副矣。"}]},{"ID":"20231219095355-r2e18wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219095355-r2e18wm","updated":"20231219100715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"476、徵四失论篇"}]},{"ID":"20231219095611-6c6egd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219095611-6c6egd7","updated":"20231219110054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"477、每年农历一月都为寅月；"}]},{"ID":"20231219111326-21vrefn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219111326-21vrefn","updated":"20231219111406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"478、表症在时，代表里症不严重，因为表症在代表阳气很够才会有表症；"}]},{"ID":"20231219111406-31rf11d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219111406-31rf11d","updated":"20231219115513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"479、气不够会多梦，严重气虚会昏迷；"}]},{"ID":"20231219115538-fgrqya5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219115538-fgrqya5","updated":"20231219141253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"479.1、是以肺气虚，则使人梦见白物，见人斩血藉藉，得其时，则梦见兵战。肾气虚，则使人梦见舟舩溺人，得其时，则梦伏水中，若有畏恐。肝气虚，则梦见菌香生草，得其时，则梦伏树下不敢起。心气虚，则梦救火阳物，得其时，则梦燔灼。脾气虚，则梦饮食不足，得其时，则梦筑垣盖屋。此皆五藏气虚，阳气有余，阴气不足。合之五诊，调之阴阳，以在经脉。"}]},{"ID":"20231219115943-914nvzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219115943-914nvzl","updated":"20231219154908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"480、夫水之精为志，火之精为神，水火相感，神志俱悲，是以目之水生也。"}]},{"ID":"20231219155507-7ex6x1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219155507-7ex6x1h","updated":"20231219155536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"480.1、人真的伤心哭时，涕泪俱出；"}]},{"ID":"20231219155537-941kpr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219155537-941kpr9","updated":"20231219160142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"481、唐容川、曹颖甫——对倪师影响最大的两位经方家；"}]},{"ID":"20231219115514-3ppny0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219115514-3ppny0i","updated":"20231219160759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"482、刺法论"}]},{"ID":"20231219160930-19zfj5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219160930-19zfj5l","updated":"20231219161156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"483、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"立春时，大敦穴放几滴血（可处理肝气郁结，无病时放几滴血对肝也有好处）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231219161157-qvgh8go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219161157-qvgh8go","updated":"20231219162036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"484、春分后到清明时节，取荣穴，心包络荣穴劳宫穴把心火散开"}]},{"ID":"20231219162036-vjb8bsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219162036-vjb8bsf","updated":"20231219162155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"485、立夏取脾经腧穴太白穴，去脾土之郁结，湿气；"}]},{"ID":"20231219163333-gqswb5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219163333-gqswb5n","updated":"20231219171109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"486、春夏取井荣，秋冬取经合，长夏时取腧穴；（先刺左，再刺右边，因为人的气由左到右，血由右到左）"}]},{"ID":"20231219163742-c76vp1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219163742-c76vp1p","updated":"20231219163820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"487、让肺气舒畅，从肺经经渠穴下针；"}]},{"ID":"20231219163820-bt199ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219163820-bt199ar","updated":"20231219163938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"488、冬天取阴谷穴，能让肾经通畅；"}]},{"ID":"20231219163930-h0ta2n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219163930-h0ta2n5","updated":"20231219171631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"489、肝阴实，取肺经井穴少商，再刺合穴；"}]},{"ID":"20231219163406-vcsga44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219163406-vcsga44","updated":"20231219172136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"490、散心火，取水克火，水阳脏膀胱经，阴脏肾经，在阴脏井穴下针，阳脏合穴下针；"}]},{"ID":"20231219172136-t6e2blq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219172136-t6e2blq","updated":"20231219172904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"491、脾土湿热过盛，取木克土，肝经井穴大敦穴下针，胆经合穴阳陵泉下针；"}]},{"ID":"20231219172809-1pld72l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219172809-1pld72l","updated":"20231219172940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"492、肺经气过盛，取火克金，取心包经井穴中冲穴，三焦经合穴天井穴下针；"}]},{"ID":"20231219172940-zluc4vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231219172940-zluc4vr","updated":"20231220095325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"493、疫病，都是节气过长导致；"}]},{"ID":"20231220095328-5rb3fcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220095328-5rb3fcc","updated":"20231220101014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"494、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"天干五合：甲己合化土，乙庚合化金，丙辛合化水，丁壬合化木，戊癸合化火。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231220101014-m1wykel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220101014-m1wykel","updated":"20231220102909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"495、人病心虚（刺法论），又遇群相二火司天失守，感而三虚，遇火不及，黑尸鬼犯之，令人暴亡，可刺手少阳之所过，复刺心俞。人脾病，又遇太阴司天失守，感而三虚，又遇土不及，青尸鬼邪，犯之于人，令人暴亡，可刺足阳明之所过，复刺脾之俞。人肺病，遇阳明司天失守，感而三虚，又遇金不及，有赤尸鬼犯人，令人暴亡，可刺手阳明之所过，复刺肺俞。人肾病，又遇太阳司天失守，感而三虚，又遇水运不及之年，有黄尸鬼，干犯人正气，吸人神魂，致暴亡，可刺足太阳之所过，复刺肾俞。"}]},{"ID":"20231220102628-tgj97i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220102628-tgj97i3","updated":"20231220102740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"495.1、精神病相关，如心虚，水克火，肾气相侵入导致看见黑色的鬼影，同理，脾病，木克土，看到的是青色的鬼影；"}]},{"ID":"20231220102740-m2tdoy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220102740-m2tdoy0","updated":"20231220103243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"496、十二脏‘神’失守刺法：心者，君主之官，神明出焉，可刺手少阴之源。肺者，相傅之官，治节出焉，可刺手太阴之源。肝者，将军之官，谋虚出焉，可刺足厥阴之源。胆者，中正不官，决断出焉，可刺足少阳之源。膻中者，臣使之官，喜乐出焉，可刺心包络所流。脾为谏议之官，知周出焉，可刺脾之源。胃为仓廪之官，五味出焉，可刺胃之源。大肠者，传道之官，变化出焉，可刺大肠之源。小肠者，受盛之官，化物出焉，可刺小肠之源。肾者，作强之官，伎巧出焉，刺其肾之源。三焦者，决渎之官，水道出焉，刺三焦之源。膀胱者，州都之官，津液藏焉，气化则能出矣，刺膀胱之源。（阳经刺原穴，阴经刺腧穴）"}]},{"ID":"20231220103119-todf6un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220103119-todf6un","updated":"20231220103634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"497、24小时腹式呼吸（胎息），人能健康长寿——倪师；"}]},{"ID":"20231220103634-496gzi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220103634-496gzi1","updated":"20231220152008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"498、天生人，地成人；"}]},{"ID":"20231220163645-2zmb66j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220163645-2zmb66j","updated":"20231220163937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"499、天医：一个医生在家，不仅将家里人的疾病先一步治好，还能通过改地理位置将自然灾祸消除；"}]},{"ID":"20231220163840-ag1te0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220163840-ag1te0j","updated":"20240601091000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"500、上医治未病，中医治欲病，下医治已病。"}]}]}